<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">ኢዮቤ ማጻፋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">ኢዮቤ ማጻፋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">ኢዮቤ ማጻፋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">ኢዮ</para>
  <para style="mt">ኢዮቤ ማጻፋ</para>
  <para style="imt">ጊዶ ቆፋ</para>
  <para style="ip">ኢዮቤ ማጻፋን ኑኒ ቤኢዛ ታሪኬይ ዎልቃማ ሜቶይኔ ቆሆይ ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ኢሲ ሱሬ ኣሳ ጊሻስ ቆንጪሴስ። ሄ ኣዴዚካ ባ ናይታኔ ባ ሃሮ ኡባፌ ሜላ ኣቶይሳፌካ ቦላራ ኢታ ማዱን ማዱንጺዲ ዋዬቴስ፤ ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ጊንጾ ማላን ሄቶ ሺቂዳ ሃሳያን ኢዮቢኔ ኢዛ ላጌቲ ሃ ኢታ ዋዪሲዛ ሜቶዛን ባስ ሴቴቲዛ ዮኦዛ ቆንጪሴቴስ፤ ዉርሴንካ ጾሲ ኢዮቤስ ቆንጪሲዴስ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ኢዮቤ ላጌቲ ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ዋዬዛ ጊሻስ ካሴ ባንቲ ኤሪዛ ሃይማኖቴ ዎጋፔ ዴንዲዲ ባንታስ ዲዛ ዱማ ዱማ ቆፋ ሺሼቴስ፤ ሄሲካ፥ «ጾሲ ኪያ፤ ኣሳስ ሎኦ ዎጋ ኢሜስ፤ ኢታ ኣስ ጊዲኮ ቃጻዬስ» ጌቴስ። «ሄሳካ ኢዮቤ ሃ ኡባ ሜቶይ ጋኪዳይ ኢዚ ናጋራ ኦዳ ጊሻስ ጊዶንታ ኣጌና» ጌቴስ። ኢዮቤ ጊዲኮ ኢዛ ቦላ ዎሶይ ባይንዳዴኔ ሱሬ ኣስ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ ሃይሳ ማላ ዎልቃማ ቂጻቴይ ኢዛስ ቤሴና። ኢዮቤ ማላ ሱሬ ኣሳ ቦላ ሃይሳ ማላ ዎልቃማ ሜቶይ ጋኪዳይሲ ቢርሼቶንታ ማሌ ጊዲዴስ። ሃ ኡባ ሜቶዛን ኢዮቤ ኣማኖይ ያኔ ሃ ቃጾንታ ኣጊኮካ ቱማ ፒርዲዛ ጾሳይ ሊኬ ፒርዳ ኢዛስ ኢሚዲ ኢዛ ጋኪዳ ሜቶዛፔ ኬሳና ማላኔ ካሴ ዴኦዛ ኢዛስ ዛራና ማላ ጾሳ ሚኒዲ ዎሳፔኔ ኦይሾፔ ጉዬ ጊቤና።</para>
  <para style="ip">ጾሲ ኢዮቤ ኢዛ ኦይቺዳ ኦይሻታስ ዛሮ ማራራ ማራራ ኢሞንታ ኣጊኮካ ኢዮቤስ ዲዛ ሚኖ ኣማኖዛ ናሺዲ ጾሲ ባ ዎልቃኔ ባ ኤራቴ ማላሊሲዛ ኦጌራ ጊንጾን ኢዛስ ቆንጪሲዴስ። ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ ጾሲ ባይራኔ ኤራ ጊዲዳይሳ ሻኪ ኤሪዴስ። ጾሳ ጾሳቴ ሻኪ ኤሪዳፔ ጉዬ ካሴ ኢዚ ሃንቆን ኩሚዲ ኬሲዳ ዴጾ ቃላታ ጊሻስ ዬላቲዲ ማሮቴን ጌሊዴስ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ማጻፋስ ዉርሴ ሼምፖይ ኢዮቢ ባና ጋኪዳ ሜቶዛፔ ዛሮ ዴሚዲ ካሴ ዴኦዛን ሲሚዳይሳኔ ቃሴካ ሃሮ ባጋራ ካሴይሳፌ ሃ ኣ ዴሚዳይሳ ቆንጪሴስ። ሃራ ባጋራ ቃሴ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ሜቶይ ኣይ ጋሶን ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኪዳኮን ኢዮቤ ላጌታስ ጌሎንታ ጊሻስ ጾሳይ ኢስታ ሚን ሴሪዴስ።</para>
  <para style="ip">ሎሴ ጊዲዳ ዱማ ዱማ ሃይማኖቴ ዎጋታፔ ጾሲ ባ ባጋራ ባይራ ጊዲዳይሳ ኢዮቢ ጻላላ ኤሪዳ ጊሻስ ባ ላጌታ ጊሻስ ዎሲዴስ፤ ጾሲካ ኢዛ ዎሳ ሲዪዴስ። ጾሲ ኢዮቤስ ዉርሴ ዴኦዛ ኮይሮይሳፌ ኣ ሎኤዴስ።</para>
  <para style="iot">ሃ ማጻፋይ ኦይኪዳ ኩሜ ቆፋ</para>
  <para style="io1">ኢዮቤ ጋኪዳ ሜቶታ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1፡1—2፡13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ኢዮቢ ባ ዬሌታ ጋላሳ ቃንጊዴስ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3፡1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ኮይሮ ዩሾ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4፡1—14፡22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ናምኣን ዩሾ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15፡1—21፡34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ሄን ዩሾ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 22:1-26:14">22፡1—26፡14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ኢዮቤስ ዉርሴ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 27:1-31:40">27፡1—31፡40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ኤሊሁ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32፡1—37፡24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ጾሲ ኮይሮ ዩሾ ሃሳይዳ ሃሳያ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-39:30">38፡1—39፡30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ናምኣን ዩሾ ጾሳ ሃሳያኔ ኢዮቤ ዛሮ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 40:1-42:6">40፡1—42፡6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">ጾሲ ኢዮቤስ ዛሮ ኢሚዲ ኣንጂዴስ <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42፡7-17</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ፓጬ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>ኡጼ ጌቴቲዛ ዴሬን ኢሲ ኢዮቤ ጌቴቲዛ ኣሲ ዴስ። ኢዚካ ኢታ ኡባፌ ሃኪዳዴ፤ ዎሶይ ኢዛ ቦላ ባይንዳዴ፤ ጾሳስ ያዪዛዴኔ ሱሬ ኣሳ። <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>ኢዛስ ላፑን ኣቱማ ናይቲኔ ሄ ማጫ ናይቲ ዴቴስ። <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>ሃሮ ባጋራካ ኢዛስ 7,000 ዶርሳቲ፥ 3,000 ጋሜላቲ፥ 500 ዋ ቦራቲኔ 500 ሃሬቲ ዴቴስ፤ ቃሴካ ኬሂ ዳሮ ኣይሌቲ ዴቴስ። ኣርሼይ ሞኪዛሶ ባጋራ ኢዛ ማላ ዱሬኔ ጊታ ኣሲ ሃራይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>ኢዮቤ ኣቱማ ናይቲ ኢሶይ ኢሶይ ባሶን ታራን ታራን ዲጊሳ ጊግሲዲ ኢሲፌ ሺቂ ኡፋዬቴቴስ፤ ሄ ሚቼታካ ባንታኮ ጼይጊሲዲ ኢስታራ ኢሲፌ ሜቴሲኔ ኡዬቴስ። <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>ዲጊሳ ጋላሳቲ ኣዳፔ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ ዎንታራ ዴንዲዲ ባ ናይታ ጼይጊሲዲኔ ኢሳ ኢሳ ሱንን ያርሾ ሺሼስ። ኢዚ ሄሳ ኦዛይ፥ «ታ ናይቲ ጌሊ ጊዳ ጾሳ ጫዪዲ ኣዉኮራ ናጋራ ኦዳኮኔ!» ጉሳ ሂርጋን ናይታ ናጋራፔ ጌሻናስ ጊዲ ኦስ። ኢዮቢ ሃይሳ ያርሾ ዎጋ ቃንጾንታ ኡባ ዎዴ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>ጋላሳታፔ ኢሲ ጋላስ ሳሎ ኪታንቻቲ ጎዳ ሲን ሺቂዳ ዎዴ ጻላኤይካ ኢስታራ ኢሲፌ ሺቂዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1፡6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:2">ሜ 6፡2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>ጾሲካ፥ «ኣዋፔ ያዲ?» ጊዲ ጻላኤ ኦይቺዴስ። ጻላኤይካ፥ «ሳኣ ጋጻ ኡባ ያኔ ሃ ዩዬሬታዳ ያዲስ» ጊዲ ጎዳስ ዛሪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>ጎዳይ ጻላኤዛ፥ «ታ ኣይሌዛ ኢዮቤ ሎኤ ቤያዲ? ኢዛ ማላ ኣማኔቲዳኔ ሱሬ ኣስ ቢታ ቦላ ቤቲቤና፤ ኢዚ ኢታ ኡባፌ ሃኪዲ ታስ ያዪዛ ሱሬ ኣሳ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>ጻላኤይካ ዛሪዲ፥ «ኢዮቢ ኔስ ጾሳስ ጮ ያዪዜ? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>ኢዚ ኔስ ያዪዛይ ኔኒ ኢዛኔ ኢዛ ናይታ፥ ኢዛስ ዲዛ ሃሮ ኡባ ሎኤ ናጊዳ ጊሻሳ፤ ኢዚ ኦዛ ኦሶዛ ኩሜ ኣንጂዳ ጊሻሲኔ ዳሮ ዉዴ ሜሄታ ኔ ኢዛስ ኢሚዳ ጊሻስ ጊዴኔ? <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>ኣኔ ኔ ኩሼ ዬዳዳ ኢዛስ ዲዛይሳ ኡባ ኔ ይሲዳኮ ቱማ ኢዚ ኔና ቆንጬን ጫያና» ጊዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1፡9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">ኣጁ 12፡10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>ጎዳይካ ጻላኤስ፥ «ኤሮ ኣኔ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ኢሲ ሜቶካ ጋፋ ኣቲን ኢዛስ ዲዛ ሃሮዛ ቦላ ኔ ኮዪዳዚ ኦናዉ ዳንዳያሳ» ጊዴስ። ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ጻላኤይ ጾሳ ሲንፌ ኬኢዲ ቢዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ናይታ ሃይቆኔ ኢዛ ሃሮ ዮ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>ጋላሳታፔ ኢሲ ጋላስ ኢዮቤ ናይቲ ባይራ ኢሻሶን ዉሪ ሺቂዲ ሚዲኔ ዎይኔ ጫጄ ኡዪዲ ኡፋዬቴቴስ። <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>ሄ ጋላስ ኢሶይ ኪቴቲ ዪዲ፥ «ኑኒ ቦራታ ዋጺዲ ጎዪሺን፤ ሃሬቲካ ኑ ማታ ዴምባን ሄሜቲሺን፥ <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>ሳባ ዴሬ ኣሳቲ ዪዲ ኑ ቦላ ኦላ ዴንዲ ኡባካ ዲኢ ኤኪ ቢዳ፤ ኔ ኣይሌታ ኡባታካ ማሻን ዎዳ፤ ታኒ ጻላላ ኣታዳ ሃኒዳ ኡባ ኔስ ዮታናስ ያዲስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>ኮይሮ ኪታንቻይ ባ ሃሳይዛ ሃሳያ ቡሮ ኦንጎንታ ዲሺን ናምኣን ኪታንቻይ ዪዲ፥ «ዶርሳታኔ ሄሚዛ ሄንንቻ ኡባ ዎልቃን ሳሎፔ ዎዲ ዎዴስ፤ ታኒ ጻላ ኣታዳ ሃኒዳ ኡባ ኔስ ዮታናስ ያዲስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>ሃይሳ ኪታንቻይ ሃሳዪ ኦንጎንታ ሃራ ኪታንቻይ ዪዲ፥ «ሄ ቡቴን ሻኬቲዳ ቦንቂዛ ካላዳዌ ኣሳቲ ዪዲ ቆፖንታ ዲሺን ኑ ቦላ ኢታ ሜቶ ጋዳ፤ ጋሜላታ ኡባ ዲኢ ኤፊቺዳ፤ ኔ ኣይሌታ ኡባ ማሻን ዎዳ፤ ታኒ ጻላ ኣታዳ ሃኒዳ ሚሽ ኡባ ኔስ ዮታናስ ያዲስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>ሃይሳ ሃ ኪታንቻይ ሃሳዪ ኦንጎንታ ሃራ ኪታንቻይ ዪዲ፥ «ኔ ናይቲ ኡባቲካ ባንታስ ባይራ ኢሻሶን ሺቂዲ ሚሼኔ ዎይኔ ጫጄ ኡዪሼ ኡፋዬቲዛ። <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>ባዞፌ ዪዳ ጎቴ ጫርኮይ ቆፖንታ ዲሺን ዪዲ ኬ ኩሜ ሺሬቺ ዬጊዴስ፤ ኬዚካ ኢስታ ቦላ ዎን ዉሪካ ሃይቂዳ፤ ታኒ ጻላ ኣታዳ ሃኒዳ ሚሽ ኡባ ኔስ ዮታናስ ያዲስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ ዴንዲዲ ካዮቲዲ ባ ማይኦዛ ዳኪዴስ፤ ባ ሁኤ ቡሉሲዴስ፤ ቢታን ጉፋኒ ጎይኒዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>«ታኒ ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎፔ ካሎ ዬሌታዲስ፤ ሃይቂዛ ዎዴካ ካሎ ባና፤ ጎዳይ ኢሚዴስ፤ ጎዳይ ኤኪዴስ፤ ጎዳ ሱን ጋላቴቲዳዝ ጊዶ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>ሃ ፓጬይ ኡባይ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ጋኪንካ ኢዚ ኡባካ ናጋራ ኦቤና፤ ጾሳ ቦላካ ጫሞ ቃላ ኬሲቤና።<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s">ቃሴካ ኢዮቤ ጋኪዳ ፓጬ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>ጋላሳታፔ ኢሲ ጋላስ ሳሎ ኪታንቻቲ ጾሳ ሲን ሺቂዛ ዎዴ ጻላኤይካ ኢስታራ ኢሲፌ ሺቂዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>ጎዳይካ፥ «ኣዋፔ ያዲ?» ጊዲ ጻላኤ ኦይቺዴስ። ጻላኤይካ፥ «ቢታ ኡባ ቦላ ያኔ ሃ ሲሜሬታዳ ያዲስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>ጎዳይካ ጻላኤ፥ «ታ ኣይሌዛ ኢዮቤ ሎኤ ቤያዲ? ኢዛ ማላ ኣማኔቲዳይኔ ኪያ ኣስ ቢታ ቦላ ቤቴና፤ ኢዚ ኢታ ኡባፌ ሃኪዲ ታስ ያዪዛ ሱሬ ኣሳ፤ ኢዛ ይሳናስ ኔ ዳንዳያና ማላ ታ ኔስ ኣ ኢማና ማላ ኔ ታና ዴንዳይ ሃዳና። ቤያ ኢዮቢ ጊዲኮ ሃኖ ጋካናስ ባ ሱሬቴን ሚኒ ኤቂዴስ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>ጻላኤይካ፥ «ጋልባ ጊሻስ ጋልባ»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2፡4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ጋልባ ጊሻስ ጋልባ ጊዛይሲ ታልኤ ዎይኮ ኩሼ ዛሮ ጊዲዳይሳ ቆንጪሴስ።</char></note> ጊዛይሳ ማላ «ኣሲ ባ ኣሾ ኣሻናስ ጊሼ ባስ ዲዛይሳ ኡባ ኢሜስ። <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>ሃኢ ጊዲኮ ኔ ኩሼ ኢዛ ቦላ ሚጫዳ ኢዛስ ኩሜ ኣሳቴ ቦላ ቆሆ ኔ ጋዳኮ ቱማ ኔና ቆንጬራ ጫያና» ጊዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>ጎዳይካ ጻላኤዛ፥ «ኣኔ ሎኦ፤ ዎ ዎፓ ኣቲን ኢዛ ቦላ ኔ ኮዪዳይሳ ኦናስ ዳንዳያሳ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ጻላኤይ ጾሳ ሲንፌ ኬኢዲ ኢዮቤስ ሁኤ ቢናናፔ ዶሚዲ ቶሆ ጹጉን ጋካናዉ ዎልቃማ ማዱንን ዋዬታና ማላ ኦዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>ሄሳፌ ዴንዲዳይሳን ኢዮቢ ቢዲን ቦላ ኡቲዲ ባ ማዱን ኮንኣን ቃች ዶሚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>ኢዮቤስ ማቼያ፥ «ሃኢካ ጾሳ ቦላ ዲዛ ኔ ኣማኖዚ ሚኖ ዲዜ? ጾሳ ጫያዳ ሃይቃ!» ጋዱስ።<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>ኢዮቢካ፥ «ዋናዳ ኤያ ማጫሳ ሃሳያ ሃሳያይ? ጾሲ ሎኦ ሚሽ ኢሚዛ ዎዴ ኡፋይሳን ኤኮስ፤ ሃኢ ጊዲኮ ኢታ ኢዚ ኑ ቦላ ኤሂሺን ኢዛ ቦላ ዙዙማናስ ቤሲዜ?» ጊዴስ። ኢዮቢ ሃ ኡባ ሜቶይኔ ዋዬይ ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኪንካ ኢዚ ጾሳ ቦላ ኢታ ሚሽ ሃሳይዲ ናጋራ ኦቤና።<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ላጌ ሄታ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜ፥ ሹሃ ዴሬ ኣስ ቤሊዳዲኔ ናኢማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ዞፋሬ ጌቴቲዛ ሄ ላጌቲ ኢዮቤስ ዴቴስ። ኢስቲካ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ሜቶዛ ሲዪዳ ዎዴ ኢዛስ ኢስቲ ቃቶይሳ ቆንጪሳናሲኔ ኢዛ ሚንናስ ባንታ ዴሬፔ ጼይጌቲዲ ኢሲፌ ኢዮቤኮ ዪዳ። <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>ቡሮ ሃኮራ ዪሺን ኢዮቤ ቤኢዳ፤ ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢዚ ኢዮቤ ጊዲዳይሳ ሻኪ ኤራናስ ዳንዳይቤቴና። ኢስታስ ዎዚናይ ሜቂን ኢዛስ ሚሼቲዲ ባንታ ማይኦዛ ዳኪዳ፤ ጉዱላዛ ኤኪዲ ፑዴ ሳሎ ላሊዳ፤ ባንታ ሁኤንካ ማኪዲ ኣዳፌ ዋሲዲ ዬሆ ዶሚዳ። <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>ኢዛስ ዋዬዛ ዳራ ቤኢዳ ጊሻስ ኣይኮ ሃሳዮንታ ኢዛራ ላፑን ጋላሳኔ ላፑን ኦማርስ ቢታ ቦላ ኡቲዲ ጋምኢዳ።<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቢ ባ ዬሌቲዳ ጋላስ ቃንጌ</para>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ ሃሳያ ዶሚዴስ፤ ባ ዬሌቲዳ ጋላሳ፥<verse eid="JOB 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2-3"/>«ታኒ ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">ሜቲዳ ኦማርሳያኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">ታኒ ዬሌቲዳ ጋላሳያ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:2-3">ቃንጌቲዳይታ ጊዴቶ!<verse eid="JOB 3:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>ሄ ጋላሳይ ማን ላሜቶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">ሳሎ ጾሳይ ኢዛ ቆፖፎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">ፖኦይ ሙሌካ ኢዛን ቤቶፎ።<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>ሻሩማኒኔ ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ካሜቲዳይሳ ጊዶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ሻራይ ካሚን ማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ኢዛ ፖኦ ሚቶ።<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>ሄ ጋላሳ ኦማርሳዮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማይ ካሞ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ላይ ጋላሳታራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ኢሲፌ ታይቤቶፎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ኣጊናታ ቆዳን ጌሊ ቆፌቶፎ።<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>ሄ ጋላሳ ኦማርሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ኣይኮይ ባይንዳዝ ጊዶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ኡፋይሳ ቃላይካ ኢዛን ሴቴቶፎ።<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>ሌዋታኔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3፡8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ሌዋታኔ ጌቴቲዛይሲ ቤኒ ዎዴን ሃይላሾ ሚሳቲዛ ጊታ ዶኣኮ።</char></note> ጌቴቲዛ ዶኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">ቃሴናስ ዳንዳይዛይቲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">ጋላሳታ ቃንጊዛይቲ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:8">ሄ ጋላሳዮ ቃንጌቶ።<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>ሄ ጋላሳ ኦማርስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ባካሌ ጾሊንቴቲ ሜቶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ፖኦ ሂዶታይ ኢዛን ቤቶፎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ዎንታ ጻልቄይ ኢዛን ጻልቆፎ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3፡1-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:14-18">ኤር 20፡14-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>ታ ኣይፌታፔ ሜቶ ጌንና፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎ ታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">ጎርዶንታ ኣጊዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:10">ሄ ጋላሳይ ቃንጌቲዳይሳ ጊዶ።<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>«ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎን ዳሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ሃ ጊዳ ኣቲዳኮ ኣዜ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎፔ ኬኢዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ኣይስ ሃይቃቤኪና?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>ጉልባቴቲ ታና ሞኪ ኤካናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ንቲካ ታና ንናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ኣይስ ቤቲዶ?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>ሃኢ ታኒ ሳሮን ኢቺዳኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">ስካዳካ ሼምፖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">ዴማናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>ሃኢ ላሌቲ ቤቲዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">ባስ ኬጺዳ ቢታ ካዎታራኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:14">ዞሪዛይታራ ታ ስካዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:14">ሼምፖ ዴማናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>ባ ኬ ዎርቃኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">ቢራን ኩንዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">ዳናታራ ታ ኢሲፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">ሼምፓናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>ቃሴካ ኣይስ ቢታ ጋርሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ሞጌቲዳ ኣዉጫያ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ዎይኮ ኢሲ ጋላሳ ፖኦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ሙሌካ ቤኦንታ ና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ኣይስ ጊዳቤኪና?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>ሄን ኢታታ ዋዪሶይ ኣታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">ዳቡርሲዛ ኦሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">ዴኢዳይቲ ሼምፓና።<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>ቃሼቲ ዲዛ ኣሳቲካ ሳሮ ዴማና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">ባና ኦሲሲዛ ኣሳታ ሃንቆ ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">ሲያናይሳፌካ ኣታና።<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>ላፋቲኔ ጊታ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">ኢሲፌ ቤታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">ኣይሌቲካ ሄን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">ባ ጎዳታፔ ዎዜታና።<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>«ጾሲ ኡንኦ ቦላ ዲዛይታስ ፖኦ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">ዱሳዚ ጫሞ ቆፋን ኩሚዳዴስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">ዴኦ ኣይስ ኢሚዜ?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>ሃይቆ ላሞቲዛይታሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">ቆቴቲ ዲዛ ኣቆፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">ኣ ኮዪዲ ዴሞንታይታስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:21">ዴኦ ኣይስ ኢሚዜ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3፡21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">ኣጁ 9፡6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>ዱጌ ዱፎን ጌሊሼ ኡፋዬቲዛይታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">ዴኦይ ኣይስ ኢሜቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>ኢዚ ቢዛ ኦጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ኢዛዴፌ ጌሜቲዳዴሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ጾሲ ጎርዲ ዎዳ ኣሳስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 3:23">ፖኦይ ኣይስ ኢሜቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>ዬሆይ ታስ ካ ጊዲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">ዋሶይካ ታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">ጎጊዛ ሃ ማላ ጊዲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>ታ ያዪዳ ሚሽ ታ ቦላ ዪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ታ ዳጋሚዳይሲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">ታ ቦላ ጋኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>ታ ጊዶን ሂርጋይ ጻላ ዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">ሳሮይ፥ ዎፓይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">ሼምፖይ ዴና» ጊ ቃንጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s">ኤልፋዜይ ኮይሮ ሃሳይዳ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜይ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>«ኢዮቤ! ኢሲ ኣሲ ኔ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">ዎልቃ ሃሳይኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">ኢዛዴ ኔ ዳንዳያን ኤዝጋኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">ሃሳያናፔ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">ኦኒ ኣጋኔ?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>ኔኒ ዳሮ ኣሳታ ታማርሳዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">ዳቡርዳ ቄሴታካ ሚንዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>ካሴ ኔ ቃላቲ ጴቲዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">ማዴቴስኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">ኔኒ ኮኮሪዛ ጉልባቴታካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:4">ሚንሳኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>ሃኢ ጊዲኮ ሜቶይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">ኔ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">ሂዶታይ ባይንዳዴ ጊዳዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:5">ሜቶይካ ኔ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:5">ሚኒዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:5">ሂዶታ ቃንጻዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>ጾሳስ ኔ ያዪዛ ያሻይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">ኣማንዛዝ ጊዴኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">ኔ ሱሬ ኦጌቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:6">ኔስ ሂዶታታ ዴቴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>ጺሎ ኣስ ጊዲ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">ኢዛ ሜቶይ ጋኪዳዴይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">ሱሬ ኣስ ጊዲ ዲሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">ቲምኢ ጊ ይዳዴይ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:7">ዲኮ ኣኔ ቆፓ።<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>ታኒ ኣኬኪዳ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ኢታቴ ጎዪዲ ሜቶ ዜሪዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ሄይታንቲ ባ ኦሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ሺሻና።<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>ኢስቲ ጾሳ ፔኖን ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">ኢዛ ሃንቆ ዳምባላን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">ኢስቲ ዲፒ ጊ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>ኢታቲ ጋሞ ማላ ጻጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ባ ቃላ ቁ ኦዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ዋሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ጾሲ ጊዲኮ ኢስታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ኣቻ ሜንሬና።<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>ጋሞይ ሻንካቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ሚዛዝ ይዳ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ሃይቂዛ ማላ ኢስቲካ ሃይቃና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:11">ጋሞ ማራቲካ ላሌቲዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:11">ኢስታ ናይቲካ ላሌታና፤<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>ጋላሳፌ ኢሲ ጋላስ ጹራ ጊዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ኪታይ ታኮ ዪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ሄሳ ሄ ኪታዛ ሳሱኬን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">ታ ሲያዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>ኣሳይ ኦማርስ ዎልቃማ ስኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ሴሪዳ ዎዴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ታና ኢታ ኣጉሞይ ኣጉንዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:15">ኢዮ 33፡15</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>ባቦይኔ ኮኮርሲ ታና ኦይኪን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">ታስ ሜቄቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">ኮኮራና ማላ ኦዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>ኣያናይ ታ ሲንራ ኣዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ዳጋማፔ ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">ታ ሃሳይ ኤቂዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>ሄንካ ኢሲ ሚሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ኤቂ ዲዛይሳ ቤያዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ቲሺ ኦ ጼላዲስ ሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:16">ኢዚ ኣዛኮ ሻካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ኤራናዉ ዳንዳያቤኬ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ጮኡ ጊዳሶሆፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ሂዝጊዛ ቃላ ሲያዲስ፥<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‹ጾሳ ሲንን ጺሎ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">ቤታናስ ዳንዳይዛ ኣሲ ዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">ዎይኮ ባና ሜዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 4:17">ጌሻ ኣሲ ቤታኔ?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>ጾሲ ባስ ኦዛይታን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ኣማኔቶንታ ኣጊኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ባ ኪታንቻታ ቦላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ኢዚ ሞሮ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ዴሚዛዝ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>ሂስቲን ሃራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ሞንታ ዲሺን ላሌቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ኢስታ ዮቻይ ቢታፌ ጊዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ኡርቃፌ ኦሴቲዳ ኬ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ዲዛይታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ዋኒ ኣማኔታኔ?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4፡19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ኦላ ጌቴቲዛይሲ ኢሲ ኢሲ ባጋ ጋሞ ቃላን ሃራ ጌቴቴስ።</char></note><verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>ማላዶፔኔ ኦማርሳፌ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">ኢስቲ ሜቄሬታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">ኤሬቶንታ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">ኢስቲ ሜርናስካ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>ቶሌ ሽኬይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">ሾዴቲቺዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">ዱንካኔ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">ኢስቲ ኤራቴ ባይንዳ ሃይቃና።›<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>«ኢዮቤ! ኔ ጼይጊን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">ኔስ ኮያናዴይ ዲኮ ጼይጋ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">ኔስ ማዶ ኢማና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:1">ኪታንቻታፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:1">ኣዋይሳኮ ጼላይ?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>ኤያ ኣስ ዪሎይ ዎና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">ቃናቴይካ ኣስ ይሳና።<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>ኤያ ኣሲ ሚኒዲ ዲሺን ቤያዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢዛ ኣቆይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">ቆፖንታ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:3">ጾሳ ሃንቆን ላሌቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>ኢዛ ናይቲካ ባ ዴኦዛስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">ኣማንዛዝ ዴሜቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">ዱቡሻንካ ኢስታ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">ሃሳይዛ ኣስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:4">ኢስቲ ዴሞንታ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:4">ኢስታ ቦላ ቆሆይ ጋካና።<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>ኢዚ ዜሪዳ ካካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">ኮሻቲዳ ኣሳቲ ማና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">ሃራይ ኣቲን ኣጉን ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">ሞኪዳይሳካ ኢዛስ ኣሼቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">ሳሜቲ ኡቲዳ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:5">ኢዛ ሃሮዛ ኤካናስ ኣሞቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>ሜቶይ ጮ ቢታፌ ዴንዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">ዋዬይካ ጋዴፔ ጮ ኬዜና።<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>ታማ ፊንጼ ቦንቆፌ ዴንዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">ፑዴ ፊንጺዛ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">ኣሲካ ዋዬስ ዬሌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>«ታኒ ኔና ጊዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">ጾሳ ዎሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">ታ ሜቶ ኡባ ኢዛስ ቆንጪሳና።<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>ኢዚ ቆዳይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ማላሊሲዛ ሚሽ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ፒልጊን ጋኬቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ጊታ ሚሽ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>ቢታ ቦላ ኢራ ቡኪሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">ጎሻታካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">ሃን ሹጊሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>ካዉዪዳይታ ቦንቾን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">ቁ ሂስቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">ሙዞቲዛይታ ሚንዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">ኡፋይሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>ኢስታ ኦሶይ ፖሌቶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">ጌኔ ኣሳታ ቆፋ ሃዳ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>ጪንጫታ ኢስታ ጌኔ ኦሶዛን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">ዛሪ ኦይኬስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">ጌኔ ኣሳታ ቆፋካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">ኤሶራ ይሴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5፡13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:19">1ቆሮ 3፡19</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>ጋላሳይ ኢስታስ ማ ጊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">ቡሮ ሴታ ጋላሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:14">ኦማርስ ማ ጊዶን ዲዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:14">ኢስቲ ታታፌታና።<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>ማንቆታ ኢስታ ሞርኬታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ማሻፌ ኣሼስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ሜቶታንቻታካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ዋዪሲዛይታ ኩሼፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:15">ኬሲ ኤኬስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>ማንቆታስ ሂዶታ ኢሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">ማካላቴካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">ቢታ ቦላፌ ይሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>«ጾሲ ሴሪዛ ኣሲ ኣንጄቲዳይሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:17">ጾሳ ሴራ ሌቆፋ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5፡17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">ሌሚ 3፡11</ref>፤ <ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">ኢብ 12፡5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>ጾሲ ማዱንኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ዛሪዲ ፓስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ኢዚ ሜንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ባ ኩሼን ዛሪዲ ኮሌስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5፡18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:1">ሆሴ 6፡1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>ኡሱፑን ቆሞ ቦሻፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">ኔና ኣሺ ኤካና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">ላፑንዛንካ ኣይ ቆሆይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:19">ኔ ቦላ ጋኬና።<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>ኮሻ ላይን ኢዚ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">ሼምፖራ ፓጻ ዎና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">ኦላ ላይንካ ኢዚ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 5:20">ሃይቆፔ ኣሻና።<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>ጾሲ ኔና ኢታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">ኢንጻርሳፌ ናጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">ቦሻይ ኔ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">ዪኮካ ያያካ።<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>ዎልቃማታ ቆሆይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">ኮሻይ ኔና ዳጋንና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">ቢታ ዶኣታስካ ኔ ያያካ።<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>ኔ ጎዪዛ ጋዴን ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">ሹቺ ዋዪሴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">ዶኣታራካ ኔ ሳሮን ዳና።<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>ኔ ኬን ሳሮይ ኩማናይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ኔ ሻካ ኤራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ኔ ሜሄ ጼሊሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">ኣቆፔ ፓጬና።<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>ኔ ዜሬይ ዳራናይሳ ኔ ኤራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ኔ ዜሬይካ ዴምባን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ማታ ማላ ዳራና።<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>ካ ካጺዲ ማጼቲዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">ኔካ ሎኤ ጪማዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">ዱፎን ባና።<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>ኑኒ ሃይሳ ኡባ ፒልጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">ቱሙ ጊዲዳይሳ ኤሪዶስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">ኔኒካ ኣኬካዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">ሃይሳ ኦሶን ፔይሻ።»<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>«ታ ሙዞቴ ጌዳሬቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ኡቲዳኮ ኣዜ ዲዛይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ታ ሜቶይ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">ጌዳራን ጌዳሬቲ ኡቲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:2">ኣዜ ዲዛይ!<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>ኣባ ላንቄን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ኣጬፔ ኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ዴጻናኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ዳንዳያይ ፓጪዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ታ ሃሳያይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:3">ኔና ማላሊሳናስ ቤሴና።<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ታና ባ ዪሻታን ጫዲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ኢስታ ማርዜቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ታ ኣሳቴ ጊዶን ላሌቲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">ዳጋንዛ ጾሳ ቦሻይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:4">ታ ዩሾን ዩዪ ኣዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>ቱማፔ ሃርዲዳይ ጪሊላ ማታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">ዴሚዲ ጫጊ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">ቦራይካ ባሶ ማታ ዴሚኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:5">ጻጊ ኤሪዜ?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>ማጺኔይ ጌሎንታ ማልኦንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">ካ ሜቴቲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">ጱጱሌ ሃ ማልኢዜ?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>ሃይሳ ማላ ካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">ማናስ ኮይኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">ሙሲ ኣቲን ኩሼንካ ቦቺኬ።<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>«ታ ኣሞቲዛይሳ ጾሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">ታስ ኢሚዳኮ ኣዜ ዲዛይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">ኢዚ ታ ዋሶ ሲዪዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">ኣዜ ዲዛይ!<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>ሃይሳ ኡባፌ ኢዛስ ሼኔ ጊዲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ኢዚ ታና ሜንሬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ዬጊዛኮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ባ ኩሼዛ ዬዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">ኢዚ ታና ይሲዳኮ!<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>ሼምፖ ኢሞንታ ኣይ ሃርጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ታና ሳኪኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ታኒ ኡፋይሳን ጉፓና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ታኒ ጌሻዛ ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ኣይ ዎዴንካ ካዳቤኬ፤<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>«ዴኦን ዴኣና ማላ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">ኣይ ሚኖቴ ታስ ዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">ሂዶታይ ባይንዳ ኣጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">ኣይስ ዴኣዚና?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>ታኒ ሹቻ ማላ ሚኖ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">ታ ኣሳቴይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">ጻርቂማላ ሚኖ?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>ታና ማዳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">ታስ ኣይኮ ዎልቃይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">ታስ ዲዛ ዎልቃይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">ኡባይ ኤኬቲቺዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>«ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">ያሽ ኣጊዳዴሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">ዳቡርዳዴስካ ኢዛ ላጌይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:14">ኢዛስ ኪያቴ ቤሳናስ ኮሼስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>ታ ኢሻቲ ጊዲኮ ሃሮይ ሃሮቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">ዎዳፔ ጉዬ ሜሊዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">ኣማንንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">ሻፋታ ማላ ባሌዛይታ።<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>ሻፋታን ባልጎ ባልጎ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">ሻቺ ኩሜስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>ቦኔ ኣጊናታን ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">ማዪ ዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">ሻፋቲካ ሃ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">ሜላታ ጊዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>ጫና ሜሄታ ላጊ ኦጌራ ቢዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ኣሳቲ ሃ ኮሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ኦጌፔ ኬኢ ባዞ ቢታ ጌሊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">ቶይሉ ቶይሊሼ ዬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>ቴማ ቢታፌ ቢዛ ማንዳራ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">ሃ ኮዬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">ሳባ ዴሬ ዛልኣንቻቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:19">ሃ ዴማናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:19">ሂዶታ ኦቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>ባንቲ ኣማኔቲ ኡቲዳ ሻፋቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">ሜሊዳይሳ ቤኢዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">ሂዶታ ቃንጼቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">ሃኮ ጋኪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:20">ዪሎቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>ኢንቴካ ታስ ሃይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ሃ ሻፋታ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ታ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ሜቶዛ ቤኢዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">ጌዴ ጉዬ ባቃቲዴታ።<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>ሂስቲን ታ ኢንቴና ሄሳ ዎይኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">ሃይሳ ታስ ኢሚቴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">ዎይኮ ኢንቴ ሃሮዛፔ ኬሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">ታና ኣሺቴ ጋዲና?<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>ቃሴ ታ ሞርኬታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ኩሼፔ ታና ኣሺቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ዎይኮ ታና ዋዪሲዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ኩሼፔ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 6:23">ኬሲ ኤኪቴ ጋዲና?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>«ታና ታማርሲቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ታኒካ ጮኡ ጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">ታ ሞሮዛካ ታና ቤሲቴ።<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>ቱማ ቃላይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">ጫሞ ጊዲኮካ ኤኬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">ኢንቴ ዋላሳይ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">ኣይኮስካ ጎኤና።<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>ኢንቴ ታ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">ጫርኮ ማላ ቆዴታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">ሂስቲኮ ሂዶታ ቃንጺዳ ታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">ዛሮ ኢማናስ ኣይስ ኮዬቲ?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>ዪኦ ናይታ ቦላ ሳማ ዬጌታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ኢንቴ ኢንቴ ሲቆ ላጌታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ባይዛናስ ሚሻን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">ማርሼቴቲ?<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>«ኣኔ ታና ሃ ጼሊቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">ኢንቴ ሲንን ታ ዎርዶታዲና?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>ኢንቴስ ቆሆ ጊዶንታ ማላ ሲሚቴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">ታኒ ሊኬ ኣሳኮ!<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>ቱሙካ ታ ኢንጻርሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">ቆሆይ ቤታኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">ታ ዶናይካ ጌኔ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">ሻኪ ኤራናስ ዳንዳዬኔ?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>«ኣሳስ ቢታ ዱሳይ ባጼ ዱስ ዴኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">ኢስታስ ጋላሳይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:1">ኡኔ ኦዛ ኦሳንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:1">ጋላሳ ማላ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>ኢስቲካ ኩዋ ጋርሳን ሼምፓናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ኣሞቲዛ ኦሳንቻታኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ባ ዳሞዛ ኤካናስ ናጊዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">ኡኔ ኣሳ ማላ ጊዴቴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>ታ ዳቡርዳ ኣጊናቲ ታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ጎኣይ ባይንዳይታ ጊዲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ሜቶ ኦማርሳቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ታስ ቆፋ ኦማርስ ጊዲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>ኢቺዛ ዎዴ ኣዉዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">ዴንዳንዲናሻ ጋዳ ቆፓይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">ኦማርሳይካ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">ታስ ጌዴ ኣዱቄስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">ታኒካ ዎንታና ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:4">ሃ ሄ ሺሬታሼ ኣቃይስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>ታስ ኩሜ ኣሳቴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ጉጹኔን ኩሚዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ታስ ኣሾይካ ማዱንጺ ጎጊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ታስ ማዱንይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">ቂዲ ኡዛዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>ታ ላይታ ጋላሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ዳ ሞቄ ጾንጌፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ኤሶቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ኢሲ ሂዶታይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">ዉርሴ ጋኬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>ታ ጎዳዉ! ታ ሼምፖያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ፔኖ ማላ ጊዲዳይሳ ቆፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ኡባካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ሎኦ ሚሽ ዴሚኬ።<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>ሃኢ ታና ቤኢዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">ናምኣን ዛሪዲ ቤዬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">ኢዚ ኮይዛ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">ታና ዴማናዉ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>ሻራይ ላሌቲ ይዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">ሃይቂዲ ዱፎን ቢዛ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">ሃ ሲሚዲ ዬና።<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>ናምኣን ዛሪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">ባሶ ሲሜና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">ኢዛዴ ኤሪዛይቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">ኢዛ ባሌታና።<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>«ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ጮኡ ጊኬ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ታስ ኣያናይ ጬጪዳይሳፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ዴንዲዳይሳን ታ ሃሳያይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ታ ሼምፖያ ኢራዬቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ጊሻስ ዙዙማይስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>ሃይሳ ሊኬ ናጌቲዛዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ኔ ታና ኦዳይ ታኒ ኣባዬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ዎይኮ ኣባ ጊዶን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ዶኣዬ?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>ታ ሂጻይ ታና ሚንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ታ ኢቺዛሶይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ታ ሳኮዛ ባሌስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">ጋዳ ታ ቆፓዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>ኔኒ ጊዲኮ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">ኣጉሞን ያሺሳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">ኣጁታንካ ዳጋንሳ።<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>ሃይሳ ሜቶይ ዳሪዳ ኣሳቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">ቶካዳ ዳናፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">ታ ጩሌታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">ሃይቃናይሳ ዶራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>ሂዶታ ቃንጻዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">ዳናስካ ታ ኮይኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">ታስ ላይይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">ቃን ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:16">ታና ኣጋጋ።<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>«ኔ ሶሆ ኢማናሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">ቆፓናስ ኣሲ ኣዜ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7፡17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4">ማዛ 8፡4</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 14:3">14፡3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>ዎንታን ዎንታን ፒልጋና ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">ዎዴን ዎዴንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">ኔ ፓጫና ማላ ኣሲ ኣዜ?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>ጩች ሚቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">ጉ ዎዴካ ታስ ኢሚኪ?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>ኣሳ ካሌቲዛ ጎዳዉ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ታኒ ናጋራ ኦይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ኔኒ ኣይ ቆሄታዲ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:20">ኣይስ ታ ቦላ ኔ ቶራ ዛራዲ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:20">ኣይስ ሃይሳ ኬና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:20">ታ ኔና ዴጻዲና?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>ኡባካ ታ ናጋራ ኣቶ ጊኪ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ታ ኦዛ ቆሆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ታፔ ዲጊኪ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:21">ታ ዱፎን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:21">ጌላና ዎዴይ ጋኪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:21">ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ኔ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 7:21">ኮዪዳኮካ ታ ቤቲኬ።»<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s">ቤሊዳዴ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>ሹሃ ዴሬ ኣስ ቤሊዳዴ ጌቴቲዛይሲ ሂዝጊዲ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>«ኔ ዶናፔ ኬኢዛ ቃላቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">ጎቴ ጫርኮ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">ኣዉዴ ጋካናስ ሃይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">ኔ ሃሳያኔ?<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>ጾሲ ፒርዳ ቦካሲ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">ጺሎቴ ቦካሲ ኤሪዜ?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>ኔ ናይቲ ጾሳ ቆሂዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">ኢስቲ ባንታ ፒርዳ ኤኪዳ ጉሳ።<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>ጊዲኮካ ኔ ጾሳኮ ሲሚኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">ጾሳ ዎሲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>ሱሬኔ ጌሽ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 8:6">ኢዚ ኤሶቲ ኔስ ቤሲዛ ሶሆን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 8:6">ኔና ዛራና።<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>ኔ ዶሜይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">ጉ ሚሳቲኮካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">ኔስ ፖሎይ ኬሂ ሎኦ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>«ኣኔ ካሴ ዬሌታ ኦይቻ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">ካሴ ኣዋቲ ጋኪዳሶዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">ፒልጋ ጼላ።<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>ኑ ላይዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ቡሮ ጉ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ኑኒ ኣይኮካ ኤሮኮ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ኑ ላይይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">ኤሾ ማላ ኣዛዛ።<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>ኢስቲ ኔስ ታማርሲዛይሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">ኔስ ዮቲዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">ባ ኣኬኪዛይሳፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">ኤኪዲ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>ቱሙካ ጫሬይ ባይንዳሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">ሻጫ ማታይ ሞኪ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">ሃ ባይንዳሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">ማርጮይ ጪሊሊዜ?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>ሃይሲ ሃኖንታ ኣጊኮ ዲጪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">ቡች ጋካናፔ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">ቡሮ ጪሊላን ዲሼ ሜሌስ።<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>ጾሳ ዶጊዛ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ኡባ ዉርሴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ሄሳ ማላ ሃናና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ጾሲ ባዋ ጊዛ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">ሂዶታይ ቃንጼታና።<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>ኣቻሮ ኬ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ሚሻን ኣማኔቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ኢስቲ ሂዶታ ኦዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ሚሺ ዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ካዉሻራ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>ኣቻሮ ኬ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">ኢስቲ ዜምፒዛ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">ኢዚ ሚኒ ኤቄና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 8:15">ኣቻሮ ኬዛ ኢዚ ኦይኪኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 8:15">ዱጼሬቲ ዎና።<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>ሃ ካሊዳ ሃሩማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">ሆኦ ዴሚዲ ዳዬስ፤<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>ጻጶዛ ሹቻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">ሙሄ ጊዶን ዬዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">ዛላ ዛኣን ጻጴስ።<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>ባ ዲዛሶፔ ሾዴቲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">ኢዚ ዲዛሶዚ ኤሬቴና።<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>ኢዛ ዉርሴ ሄሳ ማላ ጊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">ሃራ ማታቲ ቢታፌ ዶሌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>«ጾሲ ዎሶይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">ኣሳታ ኦሌና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">ኢታ ኣሳታ ቄሴ ሚንና።<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኔኒካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">ኡፋይሳን ሚጫና ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">‹ኢሊላና› ማላ ኢዚ ኦና።<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>ኔና ኢጺዛ ኣሳቲ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">ዬላ ማይኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">ኢታ ኣሳታ ኬካ ያና።»<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>ኢዮቢ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>«ኤ! ታኒ ሃይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">ቱሙ ጊዲዳይሳ ኤራይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኣሲ ጾሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:2">ዋኒ ጺሎ ጊዳናስ ዳንዳይዜ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9፡2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:17">ኢዮ 4፡17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>ኢዛራካ ኦኒ ማርሼታናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ኢዚ ኢሲ ሺ ኦይሾታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ኦይቺዛ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:3">ኢስታፌ ኢሲኖካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:3">ዛራናስ ዳንዳይዛዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>ጾሲ ኤራንቻኔ ዎልቃማ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">ኢዛራ ኤቄቲዲ ጾኔቶንታይ?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>ኣኬኮንታ ዙማታ ኮኮርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">ባ ሃንቆዛንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">ሺሬቺ ዬጋና።<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>ጾሲ ቢታ ዲዛሶፔ ኮኮርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">ቢታ ቱሳታካ ቃሴና።<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>ኣዋ ኣርሼይ ሞኮንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ኦናዉ ዳንዳዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ጾሊንቴቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ፖኢሶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">ኦና።<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>ኦኒካ ማዶንታ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">ሳሎታ ሚጪዳይ ኢዛ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">ኢዚ ኣባ ዳምባላ ቦላ ሄሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>ዛርዶ፥ ኦሪዮኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">ፒሊያዲሴ ጌቴቲዛ ጾሊንቴታ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">ቃሴካ ዱጌ ባጋራ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">ዳሮ ጾሊንቴታ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">ሳሎ ቦላ ሜ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">ዎዳይ ጾሳ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9፡9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:31">ኢዮ 38፡31</ref>፤ <ref loc="AMO 5:8">ኣሞ 5፡8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>ኢዚ ኦዛ ማላሊሲዛ ሚሻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">ኑኒ ፒልጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">ኣኬካናዉ ዳንዳዮኮ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:10">ኢዚ ፖሊዛ ማካላ ሚሻታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:10">ኑኒ ቆዳናዉ ዳንዳዮኮ።<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>«ጾሲ ታ ማታራ ኣኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ታ ዴሚኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ሃ ታኮ ሺቂኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ሻካዳ ኤሪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>ኢዚ ባ ኮዪዳይሳ ኤኪኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">ኦኒካ ኢዛ ዲጌና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">‹ኣይስ ሃይሳ ኦይ?› ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">ኢዛ ኦይቻናስ ጻሊዛይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>ጾሳይ ባ ሃንቆዛፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ጉዬ ሲሜና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ኤራኣቤ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ኣባ ጊዶ ዶኣታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ማዲዛይቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:13">ኢዛ ቶሆ ጋርሳን ጉልባታና።<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>«ሂስቲን ታኒ ኢዛስ ዛሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">ዋና ኢማና ዳንዳያዚና?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">ኢዛራ ማርሼታናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">ኣይ ቃላ ታ ዴማኔ?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>ጌሽ ጊዳ ታ ቤቲዳኮካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ታ ቦላ ፒርዲዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ታና ማራና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:15">ዎሳና ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:15">ኢዛስ ዛሮ ኢማናስ ጻሊኬ።<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>ታ ኢዛ ሱን ጼይጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">ኢዚ ዛሮ ታስ ኢሚዛ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:16">ታ ማጋና ኢዚ ሲያና ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:16">ታ ኣማኔቲኬ።<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>ኢዚ ታና ጎቴ ጫርኮን ሊቂሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ኣይኮ ጋሶይካ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ታስ ማዱን ሃ ዳርሳና።<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>ሼምፖ ታ ዛራና ዎዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ጋካናስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ታስ ሼምፖ ኢሜና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ታ ሼምፖን ዋዬ ኩንዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>ታስ ዲዛ ዎልቃን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ታ ኢዛራ ባጼታና ጎንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ዎልቃን ኢዛራ ኤቄቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:19">ዳንዳያናይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ታ ሞቴታዳ ኢዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ላና ጎንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:19">ኢዛ ፒርዲዛ ኣሳታኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:19">ሺሻናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:19">ዳንዳይዛ ኣሲ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>ታኒ ጌሺኔ ጺሎኮሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ታ ሃሳያይ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ቆሃንቻ ኬሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ታ ሃሳይዛ ሃሳያቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ታ ቦላ ፒርዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>«ኣይኮካ ታኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ቦሬይ ባይንዳዴ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ታ ጊሻስ ቆፒኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">ታ ሼምፖዮካ ሃራሴታይስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>ጾሲ ጺሎዛኔ ቆሃንቻዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">ይሲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">ኣይኮ ዱማቴካ ዴና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:22">ታ ጊዳይ ሄሳ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>ኣሲ ኢታ ሜቶን ዉርሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">ኢዚ ጌሻ ኣሳ ሜቶ ቂስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>ቢታይ ኢታ ኣሳታ ኩሼን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ኣ ኢሜቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ኢዚ ፒርዲዛ ኣሳታ ኣይፌ ጎዜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:24">ሃይሳ ኦዳይ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:24">ጊዶንታ ኣጊኮ ሃራይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>«ታ ላይቲ ዎጺዛይታፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ሃ ኣ ኤሶቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ኣይኮ ኡፋይሲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ታ ዴሞንታ ኣቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>ኢስቲካ ሶኬ ጊዛይሳፌ ኦሴቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">ዎጎሎ ማላ ኤሶቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">ባቂ ኤኪዛ ጎሌ ካፎ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">ኤሶቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>ታኒ ታ ዙዙን ባላና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">‹ታ ሲንካ ካሬ ኣጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">ኣኔ ፖኢሳ ቤሳይስ› ጊኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>ጾሲ ታና ጌሽ ኦዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">ቆዶንታይሳ ታኒ ኤሪዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">ሜቶይኔ ዋዬይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">ታ ቦላ ጋካና ጋዳ ያያይስ።<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>ሂስቲን ታ ቆሃንቻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">ጌቴታ ቆዴቲዳ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">ታስ ሃዳ ዳቡራይ ኣዛሴ?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>ታኒ ታ ኣሳቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ሳሙናን ሜጪዛ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ታ ኩሼዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">ኬሃ ጌሺዛ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ሃ ኡባ ኦንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">ኔኒ ዱጌ ኢታ ጪማን ታና ኦላና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:31">ታ ማይኦቲካ ታና ሻቴታና።<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>ኢዚ ታ ማላ ኣስ ጊዶንታ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">ፒርዲዛ ኣሳታኮ ቢዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:32">ፒርዴቶስ ጋናዉ ዳንዳይኬ።<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>ኑ ቦላ ባ ኩሼዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">ጋ ዎዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">ፒርዲ ኑና ሻኪዛ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:33">ኑ ጊዶን ዲዛኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>ኢዛ ቴማቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">ታና ሂርጊሶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">ጾሲ ባ ጉፌዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">ታ ቦላፌ ዴንዳኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>ታኒ ኢዛስ ያዮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">ሃሳያናኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:35">ሃኢ ጊዲኮ ታ ዲዛ ሃኖን ዳሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 9:35">ሃሳያና ዳንዳይኬ።<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>«ዱሲ ታና ሳሌዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">ታ ዴኢዛ ጫሞ ዴኦዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:1">ቆንጬን ሲሳና።<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>ታኒ ጾሳ ሂዝጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">ታ ቦላ ኔስ ላንጬይ ዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:2">ታስ ቆንጪሳ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:2">ታ ቦላ ፒርዶፋ!<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>ሃይሳ ሊኬ ኔ ታና ሜቶይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ኔስ ዎጋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ኔኒ ኔርካ ሜዳ ኣሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:3">ኔ ካናስ ኔስ ቤሲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ኢታ ኣሳታ ዱላታይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ኔና ኡፋይሲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>ኔ ኣይፌይ ኣሳ ኣይፌ ማላ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">ዎይኮ ኔ ኣሳ ጼላይ?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>ኔ ዎዴቲ ኣሳይሳ ማላ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">ዎይኮ ኔ ላይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">ኣሳ ላይ ማላ ቃን?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>ኣይስ ኔ ታ ቆሆዛ ጼላይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">ኣይስ ኔ ታ ናጋራካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:6">ካላ ካላዳ ኣጎንታ ኢጻይ?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>ታኒ ቆሆንታይሳኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">ኔ ኩሼፔ ኦኒካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">ታና ኣሾንታይሳ ኔ ኤራሳ።<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>ታስ ሜኔ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ኢሚ ሜዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ኔ ኩሼታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ሂስቲን ሃኢ ሃ ኩሼቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">ታና ዛሪ ላሊ ይሳኔ?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>ማና ሚሻ ማላ ኔ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ቢታፌ ሜይሳ ቆፓ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ሂስቲን ሃኢ ኔ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ጉዱላ ማላ ሊቂሳኔ?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>ታና ማ ማላ ቲጋዳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">ሜቆ ማ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">ኢርኪሳ ኦዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>ታ ኣሳቴ ጋልባኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ኣሾን ካማዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ሜቄኒኔ ሻያን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ጋ ኦይዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>ዴኦኔ ሜርና ሲቆ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ታስ ኢማዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ኔ ናጎይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">ታ ኣያና ሚንዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>«ሄኮ ሃይታ ሃ ሚሻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ኔ ዎዚናን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ቆታ ዎዳ ዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ኔ ቆፋይካ ሃይሳ ጊዲዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ታ ኤራዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>ታ ቆሂዳ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ኔ ኣይፌቲ ቤያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ታ ናጋራ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ታና ቃጻዮንታ ኣካ።<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>ታ ናጋራ ኦዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ኤሶራ ሜቶ ጊዶን ኩንዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ሎኦ ሚሽ ኦዳ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ጋላቴቲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">ታ ጊልቂን ዬላይ ታና ጋኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>ታ ኦቶሬቲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ኔ ታና ጋሞ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ሻንካታዳ ኦይካና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ኔ ታና ቆሃናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ዛራ ዛራ ሻንካታና።<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>ታ ቦላ ማርካቲዛ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ኔ ኡባ ጋላስ ዴማና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ታ ቦላ ኔ ሃንቆይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">ጌዴ ዳሪ ዳሪ ባና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:17">ኔኒ ታና ቆሃናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:17">ኡባ ጋላስ ኦራ ቆፋታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:17">ኦላ ኣሳታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:17">ታ ቦላ ዴንሳ።<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>«ታ ጎዳ ጾሳዉ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">ኣይስ ታ ዬሌታና ማላ ኦዲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">ኦኒካ ታና ቤኦንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:18">ታ ሃይቃይቺዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:18">ሎኦኮሺን!<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>ታ ሜቶንታ ኣታርኪና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">ታኒ ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">ዱፎን ቢዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 10:19">ታስ ሎኦ ጊዳናኮሺን!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>ታ ዳና ላይያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">ቃን ጊዴኬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">ሄ ቃን ላይይን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">ጉራ ታ ኡፋዬታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">ታና ኣጋርኪ!<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>ሄሲካ ታኒ ናምኣን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">ሃ ሲማናስ ዳንዳዮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">ባናፔ ሲንና።<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>ታ ባናሶዚ ማ ኩዋይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ሺሮይ ኩሚዳ ቢታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">ሄን ዲዛ ፖኦዚ ማ ማላ።»<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s">ዞፋሬ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>ናኢማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ዞፋሬይ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>«ሃይሳ ሃ ሃዳ ቃላታስ ኡባስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">ዛሮ ኢሚዛይ ባዬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">ኣሲ ሃሳያ ዳሮን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">ጺሎ ጊዳና ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>ኢዮቤ! ኔ ሃሳይዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">ሃዳ ሃሳያታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">ዛሮይ ኢሜቶንታ ሚሳቲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">ኔ ሃይሳ ማላ ቂልጪሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">ኔና ሴራና ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">ባይንዳዝ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>ኔ ቆፋን፥ ‹ታኒ ጺሎ› ጋሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">ጾሳስካ፥ ‹ኔ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">ታኒ ጌሻ› ጋሳ።<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>ጾሲ ኔስ ሃሳይዳኮኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">ሊኬ ዛሮ ኢሚዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">ኣዜ ዲዛይ!<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>ኤራቴስ ኦጌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ዳሮ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ጾሳይ ኔስ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ጹራ ቆንጪሲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ኣዜ ዲዛይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ሄሳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ጾሲ ኔና ቃጻዪዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:6">ኔስ ቤሲዛይሳፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:6">ጉራ ጊዲዳይሳ ኤራ።<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>«ኔኒ ጾሳስ ጪማ ጊዲዳ ጹራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">ኤራናስ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">ፒልጋዳ ጋካናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>ኢዛ ጊታቴይ ሳሎፔ ቦላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">ኔኒ ኣይ ኦናዉ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:8">ኢዛ ጪማቴይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:8">ሲኦሌፔካ ዚቃ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">ኔኒ ኣይ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>ጾሳ ጊታቴይ ቢታፌ ዳሬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">ኣባፌ ኣኬስ።<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>ጾሲ ዪዲ ቃቺኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ጌዴ ፒርዳ ኬ ሺሺዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:10">ኦኔ ኢዛ ዲጋናይ?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>ጾሲ ጎኦንታ ኣሳታ ኤሬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">ኢዚ ቆሆ ቤዪሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">ጮኡ ጊዲ ጼሌና።<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>ኤያ ኣሲ ኤራንቻ ጊዳናፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">ሃሬይ ኣስ ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">ዬሌታናይሲ ካዉያና፤<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>ጊዲኮካ ኔኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ኔ ዎዚና ሱሪሲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ኔ ኩሼዛ ሚጫዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">ፑዴ ጾሳኮ ዎሲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>ኔኒ ናጋራፔ ሃኪኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ኢታ ሚሺካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ኔሶን ቤቶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ኔ ኦኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>ሄ ዎዴ ቁ ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">ዬላይ ባይንዳ ኡባ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:15">ኔ ቤያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">ዬላይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:15">ሚና ኤቃናዉ ዳንዳያሳ።<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>ኔ ሜቶዛ ኡባ ኔ ዶጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">ኔ ኣኬኪዛይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">ኣ ቢቺዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:16">ሃሮ ሃ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>ኔ ሼምፖያ ሴታ ጋላሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ኣዋፔ ኣዳ ፖኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ማይካ ዎንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">ፖኦ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>ኔስ ሂዶታይ ዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">ኔኒካ ኣማኔታዳ ዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">ጾሲ ኔና ናጊዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:18">ኔኒ ሂርጋይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:18">ዎፑ ጋዳ ዳና።<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>ኔ ኦናስካ ባቦንታ ኢቻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">ዳሮ ኣሳቲካ ኔ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">ቦንቾ ዴማናስ ኮያና።<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>ኢታታ ኣይፌይ ቆቃና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">ኢስቲ ኣታና ኦጌቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 11:20">ጎርዳ ጊዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">ኢስታ ዉርሴይካ ሃይቆ።»<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>ኢዮቢ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>«ቱሙካ ኢንቴ ኬሂ ኤራንቻታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ኢንቴ ሃይቂሺንካ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ኢንቴናራ ኢሲፌ ሃይቃና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:2">ሚሳቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ታስካ ኢንቴይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ኣኬካይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ታኒ ኢንቴፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ኣይ ሚሻንካ ጉጺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ኢንቴ ሃሳይዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:3">ኣሲ ኡባይ ኤሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>«ታ ጾሳ ጼይጊን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ታስ ኢዚ ዛሪዳ ዎዴይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ሃኢ ታኒ ታ ላጌታስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:4">ቂስ ጊዳዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">ታኒ ሞሮይ ባይንዳ ጺሎ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:4">ኣሳ ኡባስ ቂስ ኣታዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>ሜቶይ ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኮንታ ኣሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">ማታን ሜቶቲዳ ኣሳ ሜቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">ሌቃናይሲ ካዉሻ ሚሻ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኩንዳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">ጋንዲጋርዛዴ ሱጊ ዬጌታ።<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>ባ ኤቃ ጾሳታ ጎይኒዛይቲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">ካይሶቲኔ ጾሳ ካዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">ኣሳቲካ ሳሮን ዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>«ጊዲኮካ ሜዶሳታ ኦይቻ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">ኢስቲ ኔና ታማርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:7">ሳሎ ካፎታ ኦይቻ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:7">ኢስቲ ኔስ ዮታና።<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>ዎይኮ ቢታይስ ዮታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">ኢዛካ ኔና ታማርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:8">ኣባ ጊዶ ሞሌቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:8">ኔስ ዮታና።<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>ሃይሳ ኡባ ጊዶፌ ጾሳ ኩሼይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ሃይሳ ኦዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ኤሮንታይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>ሼምፖራ ፓጻ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ሜቴ ኡባይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ኢሲ ኢሲ ኣሳ ሼምፖይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:10">ጾሳ ማታ ጊዶን ዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>ኢንጻርሲ ካ ቃና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">ሻኪ ኤሪዛይሳ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">ሃይካ ሃሳያ ቆሞታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">ሻኪ ኤሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>ኤራቴይ ጪማቴን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">ኣኬካይካ ላይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">ኣዱሳቴን ቤቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>«ጾሳስ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">ኣ ኤራቴኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">ዎልቃይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">ዞሬይኔ ኣኬካይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">ኢዛ ማታፔ ቤቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>ጾሲ ላሊዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">ኦኒካ ዛሪ ኬጻናዉ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:14">ዳንዳዬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">ጾሲ ቃቺዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">ኦኒካ ቢርሻናዉ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>ጾሲ ኢራ ዲጊኮ ኮሻ ጊዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">ኢራ ቡኪሲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">ቃሴ ቢታይ ሃሮን ሜጬታና።<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>ጾሲ ሚኖኔ ጾኒዛዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">ባሌቲዛዴይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">ባሌዛዴይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">ናምኣቲካ ኢዛ ጎዳቴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:16">ጋርሳና።<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>ኢዚ ዞሪዛይታ ኤራቴ ዲጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">ዴሬ ካሌዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">ኢዚ ኤያ ኦና።<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>ኢዚ ካዎታ ካዎቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">ኣራታፔ ዎና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">ቃሾ ኣሳ ማላ ዳንጮ ቢርሺሳና።<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>ቄሴታፔ ኢስታ ቄሴቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">ዎ ኤኪዲ ኢስታ ጎዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">ጎዳቴ ቦላ ዲዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">ኢስታ ጎዳቴፌ ዲጋና።<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>ኣማኔቲዳ ኣሳታ ጮኡ ኦና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">ጪማታፔካ ኣኬካ ዲጋና።<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>ጊታ ኣሳታ ዬላቻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">ዎልቃማታ ዎልቃ ዲጋና።<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>ማሶን ቆቴቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">ጹራ ቆንጪሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">ሳካና ማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">ፖኦን ላማና።<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>ካዎታካ ጊታሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:23">ዛሪዲካ ይሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">ካዎቴካ ዳርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:23">ዛሪዲካ ላላና።<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>ካሌዛይታስ ኣኬካይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ፓጫና ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ኦጌይ ባይንዳ ባዞ ቢታን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">ቶይላታና ማላ ኢዚ ኦና።<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>ፖኦይ ባይንዳ ማሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">ኢስቲ ጴታና ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:25">ማቲዳ ኣሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 12:25">ኢስቲ ጋዲጋዳና ማላ ኦና።<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>«ሄኮ ሃይሳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">ታ ኣይፌይ ቤዪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">ታ ሃይካ ሲዪዲ ኣኬኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>ኢንቴ ኤሪዛይሳ ኬና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ታኒካ ኤራይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ታ ኣይኮንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ኢንቴፌ ጉጺኬ።<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>ጊዲኮካ ታ ሃሳያይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳራ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">ታ ኢዛራካ ማርሼታና።<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>ኢንቴ ጊዲኮ ዎርዶን ኩሚዴታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">ኦናካ ፓናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">ዳንዳዮንታ ኣኪሜታ ማላ።<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>ሃይሳ ኡባፌ ኢንቴ ጮኡ ጊዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">ኤራንቻታ ሚሳቲ ቤታናኮሺን!<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>ታኒ ሺሺዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ማርሼ ቃላ ሲዪቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ታ ቆሆካ ታኒ ዮቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">ጮኡ ጊዲ ኤዝጊቴ።<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>ጾሳ ሱንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">ኣይስ ዎርዶ ሃሳዬቲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">ባሌን ኢንቴ ጾሳ ኡፋይሳና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:7">ኢንቴስ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>ኢዛ ቤሶንታ ኦጌራ ማዴቲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">ኢዛስ ጻባቃ ኤቃንዴቲ?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>ጾሲ ኢንቴና ቆሪዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">ኢሲ ሎኦ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">ኢንቴፌ ዴማንዴሻ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:9">ኢንቴ ኣሳታ ኤይሲዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:9">ጾሳካ ኤይሳናዉ ዳንዳያና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:9">ኢንቴስ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>ኢንቴ ጌማራ ዎርዶ ማዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">ቱማፔ ጾሲ ኢንቴና ሃንቃና።<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>ኢዛ ቦንቾይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">ኢንቴና ያሼኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">ኢዛ ቴማይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">ኢንቴና ዳጋንኔ?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>ኢንቴ ሌሚሶን ሃሳይዛ ሃሳያቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ቢዲን ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ጎኣይ ባይንዳይታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ኢንቴ ማርሼቴይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">ማና ሚሻ ማላ ሜቄሬታና።<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>ኣኔ ጮኡ ጊቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ታኒ ሃሳያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ታስ ጊሻ ኢሚቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:13">ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ባ ዶሶይሳ ሃኖ።<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>«ታኒ ኣች ሳጻዳ ጌንጬጫሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:14">ዲዛይ ኣዛሴ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">ታ ሼምፖያካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">ታ ኩሼን ዳዉስ።<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>ሄሳ ጊሻስ ጾሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ታና ዎና ኮይኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ታፔ ኣቲዛ ሚሺ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:15">ኣይኮይካ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:15">ጊዲኮካ ታ ሃኖዛ ኢዛስ ኤሪሳና።<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>ናጋራንቻ ኣሲ ጾሳ ሲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ሺቃናስ ዳንዳዮንታ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ኦኔ ኤሪዛይ ሃይሲ ታ ጻላቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ፓጻናስ ጋሶ ጊዳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ዳንዳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>ኣኔ ታ ሃሳይዛ ቃላታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ዎጋራ ኤዝጊቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ታ ዶናራ ታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">ማርካቲዛይሳ ሲዪቴ።<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>ታ ማርሼቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">ሎኤ ጊጊሳዳ ሺሻዲስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">ኢዚ ታስ ፒርዳናይሳካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:18">ታ ኤራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>ታና ሞቲዛይ ዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">ታኒ ማርሼቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">ጮኡ ጋዳ ሃይቃና።<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>«ጎዳዉ! ታ ኔ ሲንፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ቆቴቶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ሄይታ ናምኡ ሚሻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ታስ ኦ።<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>ሄይቲካ ኔ ሃንቆ ቄሴታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:21">ታ ቦላፌ ዴን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">ያሺሲዛ ኔ ታማን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">ታና ዳጋንፋ።<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>ጾሳዉ! ኮይሮ ኔ ሃሳያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">ታ ኔስ ዛሮ ኢማና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">ታኒካ ሃሳያና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:22">ኔካ ዛሮ ኢማ።<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>ኤሮ ጊዶ ታ ኦዳ ናጋራይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">ቆሆይ ኣይ ሊኬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">ኣኔ ታ ሞሮዛኔ ታ ናጋራ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:23">ታና ኤሪሳ።<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>ኔ ሲን ታፔ ጌንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">ታና ኔ ሞርኬ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">ኣዛስ ቆዳይ?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>ጫርኮይ ቆቆፊዛ ቦንጮ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">ሜላ ሃፓ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:25">ኔ ኣይስ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 13:25">ያሺሴን ጎዳይ?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>ታ ቦላ ኔ ጻፊዳ ሞቶይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ኬሂ ጫሞ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ታኒ ዬላጋቴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ኦዳ ቆሆዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">ታስ ኣጋቤካ።<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>ኔ ታ ቶሆታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ዱሩማታ ጊዶን ቃቻዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ታ ታንጎ ኡባ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ኔ ካሌታሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">ታ ጌዶን ኔ ኤቃሳ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13፡27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:11">ኢዮ 33፡11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>«ሄሳ ጊሻስ ታኒ ዎቂዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ሚሻ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ጊዳዳ ኣታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ባዳይ ሚዳ ማይኦ ማላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">ታ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>«ኣሾ ማይኢዳ ኣሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ላይይ ቃን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ሄሲካ ሜቶን ኩሚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>ጪሻ ማላ ቤቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">ሄራካ ቆኬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">ኤሾ ማላ ዳሮ ጋምኦንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:2">ሄራ ኣስ።<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>ሂስቲን ኔኒ ሃይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">ኣሳ ሜቴ ካሌታይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">ኔ ሲንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">ፒርዳስ ሺሻኔ?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>ቱና ሚሻፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">ጌሻ ሚሽ ዴማናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">ዳንዳይዛዴይ ኦኒካ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>ኣሳ ላይስ ዎዳ ዛዋይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ኣሲ ዳና ኣጊናቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:5">ኔ ማታን ቆዳን ዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ኔኒካ ዎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ላይ ዛዋፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ኣዛዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>ኡኔቲ ኣቂዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ባ ኦና ጋላሳ ኦሶዮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ፖሊዲ ኡፋዬቲዛ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ኣሲካ ባ ዳቡራ ጋላሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">ኡፋዬታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:6">ኔ ኣይፌ ኢዛ ቦላፌ ዴን።<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>ቃንጼቲዳ ሚ ኡስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ሂዶታይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ናምኣን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ሲሚ ኣጫናሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">ሃጋታ ኬሳናስ ዳንዳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>ኣይኮካ ጻጶቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">ቢታ ጊዶን ጪሚኮካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">ኣኖይካ ቢታ ጊዶን ሙሲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>ኢርጻ ዴሚኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">ናምኣን ኣጬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">ኦራ ቶኬቲዳ ሚ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:9">ሃጋታ ኬሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>ኣሲ ጊዲኮ ሃይቂዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">ካሴ ባይንዳ ማላ ሃኔስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">ሃይቂዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">ኣዋን ቤታኔ?<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>ኣባ ሃ ዉሪዛ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">ሻፋ ሃካ ሜሊዛ ማላ፥<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>ኣሲካ ሄሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ሃይቂዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:12">ሃ ሲሜና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ሳሎይ ኣናሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ጋካናስ ዴንዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ስኮፌካ ቤጌና።<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>«ሃይቂዳይታ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ኔ ታና ቆቲዳኮ ኣዜ ዲዛይ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ኔ ሃንቆዚ ኣና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ዎዴይ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:13">ኔ ታና ቆቲዳኮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ቃጻሮ ጋላስ ቃቻዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ኔ ታና ቆፒዳኮ!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>ኣሲ ሃይቂዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ኣሾራ ፓጻ ዳናስ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ታስ ዎዴይ ላሜታና ጋካናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ታ ሃይሳ ባጼ ላይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:14">ጌንጫ ኣና።<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኔኒ ታና ጼይጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">ታኒካ ኔስ፥ ‹ዬ› ጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:15">ኔ ሜታ ጊዲዳ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:15">ቤያናስ ኔ ላሞታና።<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>ሄኮ ሃኢ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">ኔ ታ ሄሜታ ካሌታሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">ጊዲኮካ ታ ናጋራ ቆፓካ።<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>ታ ቆሆይ ካራጺቴን ጹንቴታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">ታ ናጋራካ ኔ ካማና።<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>«ዙማይ ሃሮቲዛ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">ዎዲዛ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">ዛላይካ ባ ዲዛሶፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">ቃሌቲዛ ማላ፥<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>ሃ ሹች ዎጪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">ኦንጊዛ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:19">ዲኦይ ቢታ ሜጪዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:19">ኔኒካ ኣሳ ሂዶታ ይሳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>ኔ ዎልቃይ ሜርናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">ኢዛዴ ቦላ ሚኔስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">ኢዚካ ካሴ ባይንዳ ማላ ሃኔስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:20">ኔ ኢዛ ሜካ ላማዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 14:20">ኔ ሲንፌ ይሳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>ኢዛ ናይቲ ቦንቾ ዴሚዳኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">ኢዚ ኤሬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">ካዉዪዛኮካ ኢዚ ጼሌና።<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>ኢዛስ ኢዛ ኣሳቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">ዋዬዚ ሲዬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">ኢዚካ ባ ሜቶዛ ጊሻስ ጻላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">ዬኬስ።»<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s">ኤልፋዜ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜይ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>«ቱሙ ኤራ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">ጫርኮ ማላ ኩሼን ኦይኬቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:2">ሚሽ ሃሳዪ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">ኢዛ ኡሎን ቆሂዛ ቆፋይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:2">ዳናስ ቤሲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>ኤራ ኣሲ ኣይኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">ጎኦንታ ቃላታኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">ጎኣይ ባይንዳ ሃሳያን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">ማርሼቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>ኔኒ ጾሳስ ያዪዛይሳ ኣጋዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">ጾሳስ ቤሲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">ጎይኖዛካ ዲጋሳ።<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>ኔ ቆሃንቻ ጊዲዳይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">ኔ ሃሳያን ኤሬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">ጊዶ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">ጪንጫቴ ሃሳያን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:5">ካማናስ ባጼታሳ።<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>ኔ ቦላ ፒርዲዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ኔ ዶናፔ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ታና ጊዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">ኔ ሃሳያይ ኔናቴ ቆንጪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>«ኣሳፔ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">ዬሌቲዳይ ኔኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">ዙማቲ ሜታናፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">ሲንን ኔ ዬሌታዲ?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>ቱሙ ጾሳ ጹራ ሲያዲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">ኣሳ ኤራቴ ኤሪዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:8">ኔና ጻላ ኔስ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>ኑኒ ኤሪዛይሳፌ ዱማ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">ኔ ኤሪዛይሲ ኣዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">ኑ ኤሪዛይሳፌ ኔስ ቆንጪዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:9">ዱማ ሚሺ ኣዜ?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>ዬሌታን ኔ ኣዋፔ ጪሚዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">ሁኤይ ፑሉሚዳ ጪማቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:10">ቆፋን ኑናራ ዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>ኑ ባጋራ ኔስ ዮቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">ጾሳፌ ኢሜቲዳ ሚንይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">ኔስ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>ኔና ኔ ዎዚናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">ኣይስ ሃራሶ ኤፊዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">ኣይስ ሃንቆን ዴሬቃ ጼላይ?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>ሃይሳ ኦሶን ጾሳ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">ኔ ኣያና ዴንዳሳ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">ሃይሳ ማላ ሃንቆ ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:13">ሃሳያናዉ ጋካዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>«ኣሲ ጌሽ ጊዳናስ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">ኣሾ ማይኢዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">ጺላናስ ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>ጾሳይ ባ ኪታንቻታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ኣማኔቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ሳሎይካ ኢዛ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ጌሽ ጊዴና።<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>ሞሬቲዳይኔ ቱኒዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">ናጋራካ ሃ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">ኡዪዛ ኣሲ ኣይ ማላ ኢታ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15፡14-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">ኢዮ 25፡4-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17-18"/>«ኢስታ ኣዋቲ ቆቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ኢስታስ ኦዳይሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ኤራንቻቲ ቆንጪሲዳይሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ታኒካ ፒልጊዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ታ ኔና ኤሪሳይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:17-18">ሲያ ታ ኔስ ዮታይስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>ቢታያ ኢስታስ ጻላ ኢሜታዱስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ኢማቲካ ኢስታ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ዋላኬቲቤቴና።<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>ኣስ ዋዪሲሼ ዴኢዛ ኢታ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">ባ ላይ ኩሜን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">ዋዬቲሼ ዳና።<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>ዳጋንዛ ጊሪስ ኢዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ባ ሃይን ሲያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ኡባ ሚሺ ሳሮ ሚሳቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:21">ኢዛስ ቤቲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:21">ኢዛ ይሲዛ ሚሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ኢዛ ቦላ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>ኢዛስ ቃዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">ማሻን ሃይቆ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">ማፔ ኣታና ሂዶታይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:22">ኢዛስ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>ካፎስ ዎራ ኣቲዳ ካ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">ኢዚ ዎራ ኣታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">ኢዚ ያና ማ ጋላሳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:23">ኢዛኮ ማቲዳይሳ ኢዚ ኤሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>ሜቶይኔ ጬጬይ ኢዛ ያሻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">ኦላስ ጊጌቲዳ ካዎ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:24">ኢዛ ቦላ ሚናና።<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>ሃይሲ ሃናናይ ጾሳ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">ባ ኩሼ ዴንዳ ጊሻሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">ጻሊዳ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>ኢዚ ባ ኦርዴኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">ሚኖ ጎንዳሌ ኤኪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">ጾሳራ ኤቄታና ኬዚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>«ኢዛ ኣይፌይ ሞን ጎዜቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">ኢዛ ጼሳይካ ኦርዲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>ሃይሲ ሃ ኣዴዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ሙሌራ ኩንዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ይዳ ካታማታን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ላሌታናስ ማቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:28">ካይሳ ኬታ ጊዶን ዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>ዱሬቴና፤ ኢዛ ሃሮይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">ዳሮ ዎዴ ጋምኤና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">ቢታ ቦላካ ኣኬና።<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>ማፔ ኣቲ ባናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ዳንዳዬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ታማ ላጮይ ሃጋታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:30">ሜሊሲዳይሳ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:30">ጪሻቲካ ጫርኮን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ቆኪዳ ሚ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>ሃዳ ሚሻን ኣማኔቲሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">ባና ባርካ ባሌፎ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">ሄሳንካ ኢዚ ጎኣይ ባይንዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:31">ጊዲ ኣታና።<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>ኢዚ ዎዴይ ጋኮንታ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">ኡይ ሜሊዛ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">ሃጋቲካ ጪሊሎንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">ሚ ማላ ሃናና።<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>ኢዚ ቡሮን ካጾንታ ዲሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ኣይፌዚ ቆቆፌቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ዎይኔ ሚ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ጪሻይ ቆቆፌቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:33">ዎጋራ ሚ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>ጾሳ ጾሳቴ ኤሮንታ ኣሳታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ዜሬ ዴኤና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ጉቦን ኦሴቲዳ ኬቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:34">ታማን ዲፒ ጊ ጹጌታና።<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>ሃይሳ ማላ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">ጌኔ ሚሽ ቆፔቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">ሜቶካ ሜቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:35">ኢስታ ዎዚናይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 15:35">ባሌን ኩሚዴስ።»<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>ኢዮቢካ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>«ታኒ ሃይሳ ማላ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">ዳሮ ዎዴ ሲያዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">ኢንቴ ሳሌዛ ዞራንቻታ።<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>ሃይሳ ኢንቴ ሃዳ ሃሳያስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">ዉርሴ ባዬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">ሃይሳ ላጌ ታናራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">ማርሼታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">ኢንቴና ዴንዳይ ኣዜ?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>ኢንቴ ታ ሶሆን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ታኒ ኢንቴ ሶሆን ጊዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:4">ካን ታኒ ሁኤ ቃዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:4">ሃኢ ኢንቴ ጊዛይሳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ኢንቴ ቦላ ሎኤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ሃሳያናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>ሄሳ ማላካ ታ ዶናን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">ኢንቴና ሚንናኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">ሚንናስ ዳሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">ሃሳያናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>«ጊዶ ኣቲን ዳሮ ሃሳይኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ታ ሃርጌይ ሃ ሎኤና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ጮኡ ጋ ዳንዳይኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">ታ ዋዬይ ታፔ ኪቼና።<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>ጾሳዉ! ታና ኣሳቴፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">ካሬ ኬሳዳሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">ታ ዴሬ ኣሳ ኡባ ይሳዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>ታ ኣሳቴይ ጉንዶይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ታ ቦላ ዴንዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ኔኒ ናጋራንቻ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">ታ ቦላ ማርካቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>ጾሲ ታና ሃንቂዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ታ ኣሳቴ ቃንጼሬዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ታና ኢጺዲ ባ ኣች</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:9">ታ ቦላ ጋርጪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:9">ታ ሞርኬይ ባ ኣይፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:9">ታ ቦላ ማጺ ኬሲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>ኣሳይ ታ ዩሾን ሺቄቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">ታ ቦላ ጬቄቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">ታና ቂ ቃላን ባቂዳ።<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>ጾሲ ታና ኢታ ኣሳታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">ኣ ኢሚዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">ማካላንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">ኩሼን ዬጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>ታ ሳሮን ዳይሲኮሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ጊዲኮካ ጾሲ ባ ሃንቆዛን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ታና ሜንሬዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ታ ቆ ጩሊ ኦይኪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ታና ዳቡርሲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:12">ባ ቆፋ ታ ቦላ ፖሊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>ዎንዳፋንቻቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ታና ጊዶዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ቃቴ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ታ ኪላሆታ ቃንጼሬዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">ታ ጪዬዛካ ቢታ ቦላ ጉሲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>ኢዚ ታና ዛሪ ዛሪ ማዱንዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">ሚኖ ኦላንቻ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">ዚዚሚ ዪዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:14">ታና ሾጪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>«ታ ካዮቴስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ማቃ ሲካ ማይኣዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">ጉዱላ ቦላ ጉፋናዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>ታ ኣይፌሶይ ዬኮን ዞኢዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ሳካና ማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ታ ሲጲን ካሚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>ሃይሲ ኡባይ ሃንሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ታ ኦዳ ቆሆይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ታኒ ታ ዎሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ጾሳኮ ሺሺዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:17">ዎዚና ጌሻቴና።<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>«ቢታዞ! ታና ጋኪዳ ቆሆዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ኔ ካሞፋ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ሱሬ ፒርዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ታ ሺሺዛ ማጋናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ካሜቲ ኣታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">ኔ ኦፋ!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>ሄኮ ታስ ማርካቲዛዴይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">ኣፋካቶ ኤቂዛዴይ ሳሎን ዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16፡19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:25">ኢዮ 19፡25</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>ታ ላጌቲ ታና ሌቆን ጼሌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ታኒ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ፑዴ ጾሳስ ዬካይስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>ኣስ ኣሳራ ጋ ሃሳይሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ማቃዪንዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ዲዛይሳ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ኣስ ጾሳራ ጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ማቃዪንዛ ኣሲ ዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">ኣዜ ዲዛይ?<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>«ታ ላይስ ዉርሴይ ጋኬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">ታ ሃ ሲማ ዮንታሶ ባናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 16:22">ጉ ዎዴይ ጻላ ኣቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>«ታ ኣያናይ ዳቡርዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">ታ ዳና ላይይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:1">ፖሌታናዉ ማቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:1">ዱፎይካ ታና ናጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>ታና ቂዛይቲ ታና ዩዪ ኣዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">ታ ኣይፌይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:2">ኢስቲ ኢጺዛይሳ ጼሌስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>ታ ጾሳዉ! ኔፔ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">ታስ ኤቃናይ ሃራይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">ኔኒ ኔ ሁኤራ ታስ ዋሴ ጊዳ።<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>ኢስቲ ፒልጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">ኣኬካናዉ ዳንዳዮንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">ኢስታ ቆፋ ጎርዳዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:4">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኢስቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:4">ጾናና ማላ ኦፋ።<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>ሚሼ ዴማናዉ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ባ ላጌዛ ኣ ኢሚዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ኣሳ ናይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ቦላ ጎሜይ ጋካና።<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>«ጾሲ ታና ኣሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">ካሳ ሚሽ ኦዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">ኣሳይ ኢዛዴ ቦላ ጩቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:6">ኣሳ ማላ ጊዳዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>ኣፉንፌ ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ታ ኣይፌቲ ዶልጁሚዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ኩሜ ታ ኣሳቴይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ኤሾ ማላ ጊዲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>ጺሎ ኣሳቲ ሃይሳን ዳጋሜቲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">ጌሻቲ ጾሳ ኣማኖንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">ኣሳታ ቦላ ሃንቄቲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ጺሎቲ ቱማ ኦጌፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">ካሬ ኬኤቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">ጌሻቲ ሚኖቴ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">ሚኖቴ ጉጄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>«ኢንቴ ኡባይካ ናምኣን ዪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ታ ሲንን ማርሼቲኮ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">ኢንቴ ጊዶፌ ኢሲ ኣኬካራ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:10">ኣስ ዴሚኬ።<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>ታ ላይይ ዉሪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">ታ ቆፋይኔ ታስ ዎዚና ኣሞይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:11">ሃዳ ጊዲ ኣቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>ሃይቲ ሃ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">ኦማርሳ ጋላስ ጌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">ፖኦዛ ቃሴ ማና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">ሃኔስ ጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ታስ ዲዛ ቃዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">ዱጌ ሃይቂዳ ኣሳቲ ዲዛሶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:13">ዱፎን ዎ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:13">ያን ማሶን ታኒ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:13">ታ ሂጻ ኦንጋና።<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>ዱፎ፥ ‹ታ ኣዋዉ!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">ጋዳ ታ ጼይጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">ታና ሚዛ ጉጹኔታ ታኒ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:14">‹ታ ኣዬ፥ ታ ሚቼዬ!›</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:14">ጋዳ ጼይጋና።<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>ሂስቲን ታስ ኣይ ሂዶታይ ዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">ታስ ሂዶታ ጊዲዛ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 17:15">ኦኔ ታስ ጼላናይ?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>ታኒ ዱጌ ሲኦሌ ዎሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">ሂዶታይ ታናራ ኢሲፌ ዎኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">ኢሲፌካ ዱጌ ዱፎን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">ኑ ጌላኔ?»<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s">ቤሊዳዴ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>ሹሃ ዴሬ ኣስ ቤሊዳዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:1">ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>ኢዮቤ! ኔ ኣይስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">ሃይሳ ማላ ሃሳያ ዳርሳይ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 18:2">ኣኔ ኤዝጋ፤ ኑኒካ ሃሳዮስ።<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>ኔኒ ኑና ኣይስ ሜሄታ ማላ ቆዳይ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">ኔኒ ኣይስ ኑና ቱሌታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">ኣኬኮንታ ኣስ ኦ ጼላይ?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>ኔኒ ሃንቄቲኮ ኔና ቆሃሳ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ኔ ሃንቆዛን ቢታይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ሜላ ኣቴና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ዛላቲካ ባ ዲዛሶፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">ቃጼቴና።<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>ናጋራንቻ ጾምፔይ ቶኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">ታማ ላጮይካ ናምኣን ቤቴና፤<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>ኢዛ ዱንካኔ ጊዶን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">ፖኦይ ቶኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">ፖኦዚካ ማና።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18፡5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:17">ኢዮ 21፡17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>ኢዛስ ሚኖ ታንጎይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">ቃሚ ቃሚ ባና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">ጌኔ ቆፒዛዴ ቆፋይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 18:7">ኢዛ ዛሪ ኩንዲሳና።<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>ኢዚ ባርካ ቢዲ ዎጺማዴን ጌላና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">ኢዛ ቶሆይካ ጊቴን ቃጼታና።<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>ዎጺማዴይ ኢዛ ቂርጴ ኦይካና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">ሄንካ ዋጺ ኣሻና።<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>ሳኣ ቦላ ያርዴ ዎዶሮይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">ሚጬቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">ኢዛ ኦጌንካ ዎጺማዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">ጊጌቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>«ያሺ ኢዛ ጊዶዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">ጉዬራ ካሊ ካሊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">ጎዴሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>ኢዛ ዎልቃይ ኮሻን ዉሪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">ቦሻይካ ኢዛ ይሳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">ጊጌቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>ሃርጌይ ኢዛ ኣሳቴ ጊልቂሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">ሃይቆይካ ሙሌራ ኤኪ ባና።<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>ሂርጋይ ባይንዳ ኣማኔቲ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">ኬፌ ኢዚ ጎዴታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">ኣስ ኡባ ሃሪዛ ሃይቆይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">ኢዛ ኤካና።<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>ኢዛ ኬን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">ኣይ ሚሺካ ኣቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">ኢዚ ኣቂዛሶዛንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 18:15">ዲኔ ታማይ ላሌታና።<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>ጻጶፔ ሜሊዛ ሚ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">ሃጋቲካ ሜቄሬቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 18:16">ሚ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>ቢታ ቦላ ኢዛ ቆፒዛ ኣሲ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">ኢዛ ጎባቴካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">ቢታፌ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>ኢዚ ፖኦሶፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">ጌዴ ማን ጎዴታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">ቢታ ቦላፌ ኢዚ ኪቻና።<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>ኢዛ ዳቦታ ጊዶፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">ኢዛ ላታና ዬሌታይ ቤቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">ኢዛ ባቻንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">ዛሬይ ኢዛስ ኣቴና።<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>ኡሻቻ ባጋራኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">ሃዲርሳ ባጋራ ዲዛ ኣሳይ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">ኢዛ ቦላ ጋኪዳ ሜቶዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 18:20">ኬሂ ባቢዲ ኮኮራና።<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>ኣይ ዎዴካ ኢታ ኣሳታ ዉርሴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">ሄሳ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">ጾሳስ ያዮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">ኣሳ ቃዳይ ሃይሳ።»<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>ኢዮቢ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>«ኢንቴ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">ኣዉዴ ጋካናስ ዋዪሳንዴቲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">ኣዉዴ ጋካናስ ዮኦን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">ታስ ሜቄ ሜንንዴቲ?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>ሄኮ ኢንቴ ታና ታሙቶ ጫዬታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">ታና ካዉሺሼካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">ዬላቴኬታ።<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>ቱሙካ ታኒ ባሌቲዳ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">ታ ባላይ ታና ጻላ ቆሃና።<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>ቱሙ ኢንቴ ኢንቴና ቂሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">ታ ካዉሻቴ ኢንቴስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:5">ማርሼ ሚሽ ኦታ።<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>ጊዲኮካ ሃይሳ ኡባ ሜቶዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ታ ቦላ ጋዳይኔ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ጊቴ ጊዶ ታና ዬጊዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">ጾሳ ጊዲዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:6">ኢንቴ ኤራና ማላ ታ ኮያይስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>ታ ቆሄታዲስ ጋዳ ዎሲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ታና ሲዪዛ ኣስ ዴማቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ታ ቃላ ቁ ኦዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ማጋኒኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">ሱሬ ፒርዳ ዴማቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>ጾሲ ታስ ኦጌዛ ጎርዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ኣናሶይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ታ ባናሶዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ማን ጎርዲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>ታ ቦንቾዛ ታ ሁኤፔ ቃሪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">ታና ካዉሺዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>ታ ኣሳቴ ኡባሶራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ቆጼሬዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ሙሌራ ላሊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">ታስ ዲዛ ሂዶታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:10">ጻጶፔ ሾዴቲዲ ኩንዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:10">ሚ ማላ ኦዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>ጾሲ ታና ሃንቄቲዲ ጊታ ሜቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">ታ ቦላ ጋዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">ባስ ሞርኬ ማላ ታና ቆዲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>ታና ይሳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ባ ኦሳንቻታ ኪቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">ታስ ዱንካኔዛ ዩዪ ኣዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:12">ታና ጊዶዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>«ጾሲ ታ ኢሻቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">ታፔ ሃካና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">ኦዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">ታና ኤሪዛ ኣሳቲ ኡባይ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:13">ኣሳ ዴሬ ኣስ ኬሲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>ታ ዳቦቲ ታፔ ሃኪዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">ታ ላጌቲካ ታና ባሊዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>ታኒ ታሶን ኢማቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ሞካ ኤኪዳይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ኡባይ ታና ባሊዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ታ ጋራዴቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">ታና ኢማ ማላ ቆዲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:15">ኣላጋ ማላካ ጼሊዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>ታኒ ታ ኦሳንቻዛ ጼይጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">ኢዚ ታስ ኮዬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">‹ታና ማዳርኪ›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">ጋ ታ ዋሲሺንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:16">ኤሮ ጌና።<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>ታ ማቻ ታፔ ኬኢዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ፔኖዛ ሻቴታዱስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ታ ኢሻቲካ ሃራሬቲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>ቄሪ ናይቲካ ታና ካቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">ታና ቤኢዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:18">ታ ቦላ ቂልጬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>ታስ ማታ ላጌቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">ታና ሻቴቲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">ታ ሲቆቲ ታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:19">ሞርኬ ጊዲ ዴንዲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>ታስ ኣሾዚ ዉሪን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">ጋልባዚ ሜቄራ ኦይኬቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:20">ታና ሺሺን ኣታዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>«ታ ሲቆቶ! ጾሳ ኩሼይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">ታና ሾጪዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:21">ኣኔ ዛይ ታስ ሚሼቲቴ!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:21">ታስ ቃቲቴ!<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>ጾሲ ታና ጎዶይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">ኢንቴካ ታና ኣዛስ ጎዴቲ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:22">ሃይሳ ጋካናስ ኢንቴ ታና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:22">ዋዪሲዳይሲ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>ሃይሳ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">ታ ሃሳይዳ ቃላ ኣኬኪዛይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">ማጻፋን ጻፊዛ ኣሲ ዲዛኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:23">ታና ኣይ ማላ ኡፋይሳኔሺን!<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>ኢስኪርቶኒኔ ኢርሳሴን ጻፌቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">ዎይኮ ሹቻ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">ዎጬቲ ኡቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:24">ሜርናስ ዳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:24">ኦዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:24">ኣይ ማላ ታና ኡፋይሳንዴሺን!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ታና ኣሺዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">ፓጻ ዴኢዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">ዉርሴ ዎዴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">ታና ዎዛናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:25">ቢታ ቦላ ኢዚ ኤቃናይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:25">ታኒ ኤራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>ታስ ጋልባዚ ሜቴቲ ዉሪኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">ታኒ ታ ኣሳቴፌ ሻኬታዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:26">ታኒ ጾሳ ቤያናይሳ ኤራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>ሃራ ኣስ ጊዶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ኢዛካ ታኒ ታ ሁኤን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:27">ታ ኣይፌራ ቤያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ታ ዎዚናይካ ሄ ጋላሳዮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:27">ኬሂ ላሞቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>«ታ ሲቆቶ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">ታና ዋላሲዲ ዋዪሳናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">‹ሃይሳ ሜቶዛ ኢዚ ባርካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">ባስ ኤሂዴስ› ጊዲ ሃሳዬታ።<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>ጾሳ ሃንቆይ ማሻን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">ቃጻዬቴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">ጋዛ ጊሻስ ማሻይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">ኢንቴና ሞንታ ማላ ናጌቲቴ።</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 19:29">ጾሳ ፒርዳይ ዲዛይሳካ ኤሪቴ።»<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s">ዞፋሬ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>ናኢማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ዞፋሬይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:1">ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>«ኢዮቤ! ታና ዪሎ ቆፋይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ኔ ቦላ ዛሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ኢማና ማላ ሱጊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:2">ሄሳ ጊሻሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:2">ታ ሃሳያናዉ ኤሶቲዳይ።<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>ታኒ ታና ካዉሺዛ ሴራ ሲያይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ታ ኣኬኪዛ ኣኬካዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">ታና ኔስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:3">ዛሮ ኢማ ኢማ ጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>«ኣሲ ቢታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">ቤቶሶፌ ዶሚዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">ካሴፔ ሃይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">ጊዶይሳ ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>ኢታ ኣሳ ጬቄቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">ጉ ዎዴሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">ጾሳ ካዲዛ ኣሳታስ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">ኡፋይሳይ ቂጲዳ ኣይፌይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">ጼላና ጋካናሳ።<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>ኢታ ኣሲ ኣይኮካ ኦቶሬቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">ሳሎ ጋኪኮካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">ኢዛ ሁኤይ ሻራ ጋኪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">ቦቺንካ፥<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>ኢዚ ባ ሼሻ ኡቴ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">ሙሌራ ፒቴታና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:7">ካሴ ኢዛ ቤዪሼ ዲዛ ኣሳቲካ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:7">‹ኢዚ ኣዋን ዲዜ ጋኔ?›<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>ኣጉሞ ማላ ቲምኢ ጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">ይዛ ጊሻስ ቤቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">ኦማርሳ ኤሉን ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">ኢዚ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>ኢዚ ዲዛሶፔ ኤሾራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">ይዛ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">ኢሲቶ ኢዛ ቤኢዳ ኣስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:9">ናምኣን ዛሪ ቤዬና።<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>ኢዛ ናይቲ ኣዳሺዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ኢስታ ኣዋይ ማንቆታፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ጌኔራ ቦንቂዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ሚሻ ዛራና።<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>ዎልቃን ኩሚዳ ዬላጋቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ኣሳቴይ ጉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ዎዴፔ ጉዬ ቢታ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>«ኢታቴ ኢዛ ዶናን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">ካ ማላ ኣይ ማልኢኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">ባ ኢንጻርሳን ኢዚ ላጪ ጼሊኮካ፥<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>ዉሮንታ ማላ ዶናን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">ጮሚሼ ጋምኢኮካ<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>ኢዛ ኡሎ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ጫሞን ላሜታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ኢዛስ ሾሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ማርዜ ማላ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>ኢታ ኣሲ ባ ሚዳ ሚሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">ኡንኤቲ ዛራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">ኡሎ ጊዶን ዲዛይሳካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:15">ጾሲ ኢዛ ጮሻና።<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>ኢታ ኣሲ ሚዛይሲ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">ኢዛስ ሾሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">ማርዜ ማላ ጊዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">ሾሻ ማርዜ ማላ ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">ኢዛ ዎና።<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>ዎጋራ ዛይቴይ ዲኦ ማላ ጎጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">ኤሲኔ ማ ሻፋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">ሃ ማላ ጎጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:17">ኢዚ ቤኦንታ ሃይቃና።<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>ኢዚ ባ ዳቡርዳ ዳቡራ ኣይፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ዛሬ ጌዴ ኢማና ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:18">ባ ሁኤስ ሜና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ዛልኢዲ ኢዚ ሺሺዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:18">ዴኦዛንካ ኡፋዬቴና።<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>ሃይሲካ ሃንዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ኢዚ ማንቆታ ኡንኤዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ባ ኦንታ ኬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ጌኔን ኤኪዳ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>«ኢዛ ሂርጌቴዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">ኢዛስ ሼምፖ ይሲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">ኢዚ ሺሺዳ ሃሮይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:20">ኢዛ ኣሻናዉ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>ኢዛ ሃሮይ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ቁጬቲ ዉሪዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ኢዛስ ዶናን ጌልናዚካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ኣቴና።<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>ኣይኮካ ኢዚ ዱሬ ኣስ ጊዲንካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">ኢዛ ዪሎይ ጋካና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:22">ዳሮ ሜቶይካ ኢዛራ ጋይታና።<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>ኢዚ ታ ማዳ ካላና ጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">ጾሲ ዎልቃማ ሃንቆ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:23">ኢዛ ቦላ ዬጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:23">ባ ሃንቆዛካ ኢዛ ቦላ ጉሳና።<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>ኢዚ ቢራታ ማሻፌ ኣቲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">ጻርቂማላ ዎንዳፌን ጫዴታና።<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>ዎንዳፌዚካ ዞካራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">ካን ኬኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">ጾጾልቁ ጊዛ ጼራዚ ኢዛስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:25">ቲሬዛ ዱሴሬዲ ኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:25">ዎልቃማ ሂርጋን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">ኢዛ ዎዚናይ ዳጋማና።<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>ኢዚ ሺሺዳ ሃሮዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">ኡባይ ጊርዲ ጊዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">ማ ጊዶን ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:26">ኣሲ ኦይንታ ታማይ ጹጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:26">ኢዛሶን ኣቲዛ ሚሽ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:26">ዲፒ ሂስታና።<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>ኢዚ ኦዳ ናጋራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">ሳሎይ ቆንጪሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">ሳኣያካ ኢዛስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">ሞርኬ ጊዳዳ ዴንዳና።<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>ጾሳስ ሃንቆ ጋላስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">ኢዛ ሶን ዲዛ ሃሮይ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 20:28">ዲኦን ቁጬቲ ያና።<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>ጾሲ ማካላንቻታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">ዎዳ ቃዳይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">ኢታ ኣሳቲ ኤካና ዋጋይ ሃይሳ።»<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>ኢዮቢካ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>«ኣኔ ታ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">ዎዚናፔ ኤዝጊቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">ሃይሲ ኢንቴ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">ሚንዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:2">ኢንቴስ ቆዴታና።<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>ኢሲቶ ሃሳያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">ታስ ጊሺ ኢሚቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ኢንቴ ኮዪዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:3">ታና ቂናዉ ዳንዳዬታ።<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>«ታኒ ኣሾ ማይኢዳ ኣሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">ቦላ ሚሼታዚና?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">ሂስቲን ታስ ዳንዳዮንታ ኣጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:4">ኢዛን ኣዚ ማላሊሲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>ኣኔ ታኮ ሃ ጼሊቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">ሃሳያይ ኢንቴና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">ጾናናሼ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:5">ታ ሃኖዚ ኢንቴና ሻጴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>ታኒ ቆፒሺን ታናካ ዳጋንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ታ ኣሳቴካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">ያሻን ኮኮሪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>«ኣይስ ኢታ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">ላይይ ኣዱቂዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">ኢስታ ሃሮይካ ዳሪዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:7">ቢታ ቦላ ዲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>ኣይስ ኢስታ ናይቲኔ ናይታ ናይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">ዲጪዲ ሎኢ ዲሺን ቤዪዞ?<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>ኢስቲ ኣይኮ ሂርጋይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">ሳሮን ዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">ጾሳፌ ቦሻይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">ኢስታ ቦላ ጋኪ ኤሬና።<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>ኢስታ ሜሄቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">ኢሲ ሜቶይ ባይንዳ ዬሌቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">ኢስታስ ሚዛቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:10">ኣዉጫዮንታ ዬሌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>ባንታ ናይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">ዶርሳ ዉዴ ማላ ሄሜቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">ኢስታ ናይቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">ጉፒ ጉፒ ካኤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>ካራቤ ባቂሼ፥ ዲ ዲጺሼ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">ዲንኬ ፑኒሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">ኡፋይሳን ዬጼቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>ባንታ ላይ ዎጌቴኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">ኡፋይሳን ኣቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">ዋዬቶንታ ሃ ቢታፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:13">ሃይቆን ሻኬቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>«ሄሲ ሄሳ ጊዲ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">ኢስቲ ጾሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">‹ኑፔ ሃካ፤ ኔ ኦጌ ኤራናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:14">ኑ ኮዮኮ› ጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>‹ኑ ኢዛስ ጎይናና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ኢዚ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ኑ ኢዛ ዎሲን ኢዚ ኑና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ኣይ ማዳኔ?› ጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>ኢስቲ ሄሳ ጊዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">ኢስታ ኩሼን ዲዛ ሃሮይ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">ኢስታ ዎልቃን ኢስታስ ሺቂዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">ሚሳቲዛ ጊሻሳ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">ታኒ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:16">ኢታ ኣሳታ ቆፋ ኤኪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>«ሂስቲን ኢታ ኣሳታስ ጾምፔይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">ቶኢ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">ቦሻይ ኢስታ ቦላ ጋኪ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">ጾሲካ ኢስታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">ሃንቄቲ ኤሪዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>ኢስቲ ሃፓ ማላ ጫርኮን ቢዳሶይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">ጉዱላ ማላ ጎቴ ጫርኮን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:18">ኢስቲ ፒቴቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:18">ይዳ ዎዴይ ዲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>ኢንቴ፥ ‹ኣዋቲ ቆሂዳ ቆሆን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">ጾሲ ናይታ ሃንቄቴስ› ጌታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">ኣኔ ጾሲ ናጋራንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">ቃጻዮ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:19">ሄሳ ሃንኮ ባንታ ቆሆ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:19">ኢስቲ ኣኬካናዉ ዳንዳዬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>ናጋራንቻቲ ባንቲ ኦዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ቆሆን ባንታ ቂጻቴ ኤኬቶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:20">ባ ሃንቆዛ ኢስታ ቦላ ኤሆ።<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>ኣሲ ሃይቂዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">ባ ናይታስ ቆፒ ኤሪዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>«ጾሲ ጊታ ኣሳታ ቦላካ ፒርዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">ሂስቲን ኣሲ ኢዛ ፒርዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:22">ታማርሳና ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>ኢሲ ኢሲ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">ባንታ ላይ ዉርሴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">ጋካናስ ኣይኮ ሜቶይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:23">ኢስታ ቦላ ጋኮንታ ሚኖታኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:23">ሃርጌይ ባይንዳይታ ጊዲዲ<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>ኢስታ ቦላይ ኦርዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">ካይሺዳ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:24">ኢስታ ሜቄይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:24">ሺጪዳ ማላ ሃይቄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>ሃራቲ ጊዲኮ ዪሎኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">ጫሞን ኩሚዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">ሜቶን ኦይኬቲዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">ኣይኮ ሎኦ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:25">ቤኦንታ ሃይቄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>ኡባይካ ዱጌ ዱፎን ጌሊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ቢታ ጊዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ጉጹኔይካ ኢስታ ላታና።<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>«ቤኢቴ! ታና ቆሃናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ቆፒዲ ኢንቴ ቃቺዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ጌኔዛ ታ ኤራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>ኢንቴ፥ ‹ሃይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">ጊታ ኣዳሶይ ኣዋኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">ናጋራንቻዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">ዱሳሶይ ኣዋኔ?› ጌታ።<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>ማንዳራ ኣሳታ ኦይቺቤኬቲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">ኢስቲ ኢንቴስ ማርካቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">ማርካቴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:29">ኢንቴ ኤኬኬቲ?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>ሄይቲ፥ ‹ኢታ ኣሳታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">ቦሻይ ዪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:30">ቆሆይ ኢስታ ጋኬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">ጾሳ ሃንቆይ ቆንጪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:30">ኢስቲ ኣቲ ባና› ጊዲ ሃሳይዳ።<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>ኢታ ኣስ ኢዛ ኢታቴ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">ዋላሲዛይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">ኢታ ኦሶዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:31">ኢዛ ቃጻያናይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>ኢዚ ሃይቂዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">ኢዛ ኣሃ ቶኪ ኤኪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">ዱፎን ኤፌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">ኢዛ ዱፎይካ ናጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>ሾባን ዲዛ ቢታይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">ኢዛስ ጊጋ ጊዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">ኣሳቲ ኡባይካ ኢዛ ካሌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">ኣዳፌ ዳሮ ኣሳቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:33">ኢዛፔ ሲንራ ቤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>«ሂስቲን ኢንቴ ሃዳ ጊዲዳ ዮኦራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">ታና ሚንናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">ኣይስ ቆፔቲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">ኢንቴ ታስ ኢሚዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 21:34">ዛሮቲ ኡባይ ዎርዶ።»<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s">ኤልፋዜ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:1">ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>«ኣሲ ጾሳ ጎኣናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">ሃራይ ኣቶሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">ኤራ ኣስ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:2">ጎኣዚ ኢዛዴሳፌ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:2">ጾሳስ ጊዴና።<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>ኔ ጺሎቴ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">ጾሳ ኣይ ጎኣኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">ዎሶይ ባይንዳ ኔ ዴኦዚ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:3">ኢዛ ኣይ ማዳኔ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22፡2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:6-8">ኢዮ 35፡6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>ሂስቲን ኔ ቦላ ኢዚ ፒርዲዳይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">ሃይሳ ኔና ሃንቂዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:4">ኔኒ ጾስ ያዪዛ ጊሻሴ?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>ሃይሲ ኡባይ ኔና ጋኪዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">ኔ ኢታቴ ዳሪዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">ኔ ናጋራይ ዛዋይ ባይንዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:5">ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>ኢሲ ጋሶይካ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">ኔ ኢሻታፔ ኦይሶ ኤካዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">ቃሴ ኢስታ ማይኦ ቃራ ኤካዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:6">ኢስታ ካሎ ኣሻዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>ጋፊዲኔ ሳሜቲዲ ዳቡርዳይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">ካኔ ሃ ዲጋዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>ኔ ጋዳዴኔ ዎልቃማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">ኣስ ጊዳዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">ኢዛን ዲዛ ቦንቾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">ኣስ ጊዲኮካ፥<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>ኔኒ ኣምኤ ማጫሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">ሜላ ኩሼ ዬዳዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">ዪኦ ናይቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:9">ባና ኣይሳና ዴኦዛ ይሳዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>ሃይሳ ጋሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">ኔና ኦይካና ዎጺማዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">ኔና ዩዪ ኣዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:10">ኔ ኤዝጎንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:10">ሜቶይ ኔና ዳጋንና።<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>ኔና ጼሎይ ሜታና ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">ኔስ ሚዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">ዲኦ ሃካ ኔና ሜጪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>«ጾሳይ ቃ ሳሎን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">ዲዛይሳ ጊዴኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">ጾሊንቴቲ ኣይኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">ቃሶሆን ዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:12">ኢዚ ኢስታፌ ቦላራ ዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">ኢስታ ጼሌስ።<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>ኔኒ ጊዲኮ፥ ‹ጾሲ ኣይ ኤሪዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:13">ኢዚ ዋኒ ኑ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:13">ፒርዳናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>ሳሎ ቦላን ኢዚ ሲሜሬቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">ፒ ጊዳ ሻራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">ኢዛ ካሚዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">ኢዚ ቤያናዉ ዳንዳዬና› ጋሳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>«ናጋራንቻቲ ሲሜሬቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">ቤኒ ኦጌዛ ኔ ካላይ?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>ኢስቲካ ዎዴይ ጋኮንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">ሲንራ ቦሻን ሾጬቲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">ዲኦንካ ሜጬቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">ጻጶራ ይዳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>ኢስቲካ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">‹ኑፔ ኔ ሃካ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:17">ኔ ኑስ ኣይ ኦናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:17">ዳንዳያይ?› ጊዳ።<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>ጊዲኮካ ኢስታ ኬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">ዱሬቴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">ኩንዳይ ጾሳ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ታኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">ኢታ ኣሳታ ቆፋ ኤኪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>«ኪያ ኣሳቲ ኢታ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">ቃጻዬቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">ቤኢዲ ኡፋዬቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">ሱሬ ኣሳቲ ኢስታ ቦላ ቂልጬቴስ፥<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‹ቱንካ ኑ ሞርኬቲ ይዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">ኢስታ ሃሮዚ ኩሜ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">ታማን ጹጌቲዴስ።›<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>«ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኢዮቤ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">ኔናቴ ጾሳስ ሃሪሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">ኢዛራካ ኔ ሳሮን ዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:21">ኔ ሃይሳ ኦኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:21">ሎኦ ሚሽ ዴማና።<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>ጾሲ ኔስ ኢሚዛ ቲሚርታ ኤካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">ኢዛ ቃላካ ኔ ዎዚናን ዎ።<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>ኔናቴ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ኔ ዛሪዳኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">ኔ ካሴ ማላ ሃናና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:23">ኔ ሶፔ ኢታ ኦሶ ዲጋ።<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>ዎርቃ ጉዱላን ኦላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ኦፊሬ ዎርቃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ሻፋ ሹቻ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:24">ዎራ ኦላ።<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">ጾሳይ ኔስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">ዎርቃኔ ሙሩታ ቢራ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">ኔኒ ኡፋዬታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">ኢዛን ኣማኔታዳ ኔ ዳና።<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>ኔ ኢዛኮ ዎሲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">ኢዚ ኔ ዎሳ ሲያና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:27">ኔ ኣዲኔቲዳይሳ ኢዛስ ጋና።<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>ኔ ቆፋይ ኡባይ ኔስ ፖሌታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">ኔስ ኦጌ ኡባይ ፖኦ ጊዳና።<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>ጾሲ ኦቶራንቻታ ካዉሻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">ኣሽኬታ ጊዲኮ ኢዚ ኣሻና።<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>ኔኒካ ሱሬ ዎዚናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ዲዛዴ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ጾሲ ኢታ ኡባፌ ኔና ናጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:30">ኔ ኩሼቲካ ቆሆ ኦሶፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:30">ጌሽ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 22:30">ጾሲ ኔና ኣሺ ኤካና።»<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>ኢዮቢካ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>«ሃኢካ ታ ዎዚናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ጫሞ ቆፋኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ዙዙንን ኩሚዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ጌንጬጫን ታ ዎሲንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:2">ኢዛ ኩሼይ ታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:2">ዴጺዳ ማላ ዴስ።<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23፡2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ኢዛ ኩሼይ ታ ቦላ ዴጺዳ ማላ ዴስ ጊዛይሲ ኢብራዌታ ማጻፋን ታ ኩሼ ፑዴ ዴንናስ ታና ዴጼስ ጌስ።</char></note><verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>ኢዚ ዲዛሶታ ኤሪዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ኣይ ማላ ዶሳዚናሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ጌዴ ኢዚ ዲዛሶ ጋኪዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">ታ ኣይ ማላ ኡፋዬታኔሺን፤<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>ታ ማጋና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ታ ኢዛስ ሺሻናኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ታ ሚሻዛ ማራራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">ታ ኢዛስ ሺሻናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>ታስ ኢሜቲዛ ዛሮዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ታ ኤራናኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ታና ኢዚ ኣይ ጋናኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">ታ ኤራናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>ሂስቲን ጾሲ ባ ጊታ ዎልቃራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">ታና ፒርዳንዴሻ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">ኣካይ፤ ታ ጊዛይሳ ኢዚ ኤዝጋና።<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>ሄንካ ሱሬ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">ኢዛራ ማርሼታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">ታስ ፒርዲዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">ሜርናስ ታና ናጻ ኬሳና።<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>«ጊዶ ኣቲን ታ ኣርሼይ ሞኪዛ ባጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">ቢኮ ሄን ኢዚ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">ኣርሼይ ዉሊዛ ባጋካ ሲሚኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:8">ኢዛ ዴማናዉ ዳንዳይኬ።<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>ኢዚ ጊዲኮ ፑዴሃን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ባ ኦሳ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ታኒ ጊዲኮ ኢዛ ቤያናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ዳንዳያቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ዱጌ ባጋ ሲማዳካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ኢዛ ዴማናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ዳንዳያቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>ኢዚ ታ ታንጎ ኡባ ኤሬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">ታና ኢዚ ፓጪኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">ታኒ ዎርቃ ማላ ጌሽ ጊዳ ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:10">ኢዚ ታና ዴማና።<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>ታ ቶሆቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ኢዚ ዶሲዛ ኦጌታራ ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ባሌን ሃዲርሲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ኡሻቺካ ጊኬ።<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>ታኒ ኢዛ ኣዛዞታፔ ኬኢኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ኢዛ ቃላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ታ ሚዛ ቁማፔካ ኣዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ታ ዎዚናን ናጋዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>«ኢዚ ባርካ ባና ዳንዳይ ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">ኢዛራ ኤቄታናይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:13">ኢዚ ባ ዶሲዳይሳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:13">ኦሶ ዳንዳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>ታ ቦላ ኢዚ ቆፒዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ኡባ ፖላና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ሃይሳ ሚሳቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ዳሮ ቆፋቲ ዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኢዛ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">ኤቆይ ኬሂ ያሼስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">ታ ሃይሳ ቆፓዳ ያያዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>ጾሲ ታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">ዎዚናይ ዳቡራና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">ኦዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 23:16">ታና ዳጋንዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ታ ኣይፌታ ጎዚኮካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ሳካና ማይ ታ ሃሳዮንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">ታና ዲጊቤና።<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>«ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">ኣይስ ባ ፒርዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:1">ኢማና ጋላሳ ባሪቤኔ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:1">ኢዛስ ኣማኔቲዳይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">ኣዉዴ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">ኢዛ ፒርዳ ቃላ ናጌታንዴቶ?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>ኢታ ኣሳቲ ዛዋ ላሌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">ካይሲ ኤሂዳ ዶርሳታ ሄሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>ዪኦታ ሃሬ ቦንቄቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">ኣምኤ ማጫሳያ ቦራ ኦይዱስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:3">ጊዲ ባንታስ ኤኬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>ማንቆታ ሻቴቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">ጮ ኦጌፔ ጎዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">ኢስታ ሲንፌ ባቃቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">ቆቴታና ማላ ኦቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>ማንቆቲ ባዞን ዲዛ ሃርዲዳ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">ባንታ ናይታስ ካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:5">ኮያና ኬኢዲ ዳቡሬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>ኡኔቲዲ ሃራታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">ካ ሺሺዛይታ ጊዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">ኢታ ኣሳታ ሃሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">ጊዲዳ ዎይኔ ቶኪዛሶሆዛን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:6">ጌዶን ኣቲዳ ፑሹሎ ማጼቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>ኩሜ ኦማርስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">ካሎ ኢቺ ኣቄቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">ሞጬ ኣሺዛ ማይኦይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">ኢስታስ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>ዙማ ቦላ ቡኪዛ ኢራን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ኢስታ ኣሳቴይ ሙሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ኣቂዛሶይ ዪን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">ዛላ ጋርስ ሺቂ ኣቄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>ኣዋይ ሃይቂዳ ናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ኢስታስ ኣይሌ ጊዳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ኣዬይ ን ዲጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ቦንቄቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ሜቶቲዳይሳ ናዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ባ ኣጮ ጊሻስ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">ኦይሶ ኤኬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>ማንቆቲ ኣይኮ ማይኦይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">ፓጻ ካሎ ኦሶን ጌሌቴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">ካ ሺሾ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:10">ሚርቄዛ ቶኪ ሚዪሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:10">ባንታስ ጋፋን ሃይቄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>ኢታ ኣሳታ ጋዴን ዎጋራ ኣይፌፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">ዛይቴ ኬሴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">ዎይኔ ሚ ኣይፌፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:11">ጫጄ ኣጌቴሴሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:11">ኢስቲ ጊዲኮ ሳሜቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>ካታማታን ሃይቃናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">ቶቂዛ ኣሳቲ ጎታሬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">ማዱንጺዳ ኣሳቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">ማዶ ኦይሾን ዋሴቴስ።</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:12">ጾሲ ጊዲኮ ኢስታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:12">ኦሴቲዳ ጌኔዛ ቤዪቤና።<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>ፖኦ ኢጺዛ ኣሳቲ ዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">ፖኦይ ኣዛኮ ኤሮንታ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:13">ፖኦ ኦጌ ካሌቴና።<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>ሼምፖ ዎዛ ኡራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">ዎንቶንታ ዴንዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">ማንቆታኔ ሜቶታንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">ዎስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:14">ኦማርሲካ ካይሶስ ኬዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>ላይማ ኡራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ጋዴይ ኦማርሳናይሳ ናጌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ኦኒካ ቤኦንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ባ ሲን ጎዜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>ካይሶቲ ካይሶታናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ኦማርሳራ ኬ ቦኪ ጌሌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ጋላስ ጊዲኮ ቆቴቲ ፔኤቴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ፖኦካ ኢጼቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>ማራ ሺሮቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">ኢስታ ኡፋይሲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">ኡባሲካ ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">ኢስታስ ዎንታ ማላዶ ማላ።<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>«ጊዲኮካ ኢስቲ ሃ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ቤቲዛ ሆሞ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ጉ ዎዴስ ጻላ ኢስቲ ቤታና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ኢስታ ቢታይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ቃንጌቲዳይሳ ጊዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ኢስቲ ዎይኔ ሚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">ቶኪዛሶሆዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:18">ኦኒካ ቤና።<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>ሻቺ ሆኦን ማዪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">ይዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">ሲኦሌይካ ናጋራንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">ባኮ ቦንቃ ኤካና።<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>ኢስታ ኣዬቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ኢስታ ዶጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ኢስታ ኣሾዛካ ጉጹኔይ ማና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ኢታ ኣሳቲ ቆፌቶኮና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ሄሳካ ሚ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">ሜቄሬታና።<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>ሃይሲ ኡባይ ኢስታ ቦላ ጋኪዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">ኢስቲ ዬሎንታ ማይኒዳ ማጫሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">ቦንቂዳ ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:21">ኢስታ ኣዚናቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:21">ሃይቂዳ ማጫሳታስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:21">ኣይኮ ቃቴካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:21">ቤሶንታ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ጾሲ ባ ዎልቃን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">ዳናቴን ዲዛ ኣሳታ ዲጋና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">ኢስታስ ዴኦይ ጊጋ ሚሳቲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:22">ኢስታ ዱሳስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:22">ኣማንዛ ሚሺ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>ጾሲ ኢስታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">ሳሮን ዳና ማላ ኦኮካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">ኢስቲ ቢዛ ኦጌ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">ቲሺ ሂስቲ ጼሌስ<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>ኢታ ኣሳቲ ጉ ዎዴስ ዱሬታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኤሶራ ሻራፋ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">ሹሊ ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:24">ሹላ ካ ማላ ቡጬታና።<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>«ሃይሳ ማላ ጊዴና ጌቴቲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ታኒ ዎርዳንቻታኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ታ ሃሳይዳ ቃላይ ሊኬ ጊዶንታይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 24:25">ኦኔ ኣማንናይ?»<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s">ቤሊዳዴ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>ሹሃ ዴሬ ኣስ ቤሊዳዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:1">ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>«ማታይኔ ያሻቴ ጾሳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">ቦላን ባ ሃሪዛሶን ሳሎን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 25:2">ሳሮቴ ሜና።<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>ኢዛ ዎታዳራታ ቲሪፓቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">ቆዴታናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">ጾሳ ፖኦይ ኢዛስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">ፖኢሶንታዴይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>ኣሲ ጾሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">ዋኒ ጺሎ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">ቤታናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">ኣሾ ማይኢዳ ሜታ ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">ዋኒ ጌሽ ጊዳናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>ሄኮ ጾሳ ሲንን ኣጊናይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">ሙቃ ቦ ጊዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">ጾሊንቴቲካ ኢዛ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 25:5">ጌሻታ ጊዴቴና።<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>ሙሳኔ ጉጹኔ ጊዳዳ ሃይቂዛ ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">ሄሳፌካ ኣይ ማላ ኢታ!»<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>ኢዮቢ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>«ሃይሳ ኔ ሃሳዮይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">ዳቡራንቻታ ማዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">ኔስ ሚሳቲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">ቄሴይ ኣርጋጪዳዴ ሚንዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:2">ኔስ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>ኣ ኤራቴ ፓጪዳዴስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">ኔ ኣይ ዞሬ ኢማዲ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">ኣይ ኤራቴካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:3">ኢዛዴስ ቆንጪሳዲ!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>ሂስቲን ሃይሳ ኔ ሃሳያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">ኔና ማዲዳይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">ኔ ሃሳያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">ኔና ዴንዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:4">ኦና ኣያና!»<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>«ዎልቃማ ዎጋ ጊታ ኣባፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">ጋርሳን ዲዛ ሃይቂዳይታ ሼምፖቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">ዎልቃማ ኮኮርሳን ዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>ሲኦሌይካ ጾሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">ቆንጬን ዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">ኣባዶኔ ጌቴቲዛሶዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">ኣይ ሚሺካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">ካማናዉ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>ጾሲ ፑዴሃ ባጋራ ዲዛ ሳሎዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">ጫርኮ ቦላ ሚጪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">ቢታካ ኣይኮይ ባይንዳሶን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:7">ኩሎቲ ዳና ማላ ኦዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>ጾሲ ሻራቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">ሃ ጹንጺ ኦይካና ማላ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">ሃፌ ዴንዶይሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:8">ሻራቲ ዳኬቴቴና።<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>ኢዚ ኡቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">ካዎቴ ኣራታ ጌንና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">ሻራራካ ካማና።<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>ፖኦኔ ማ ሻካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">ዎልቃማ ዎጋ ጊታ ኣባ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:10">ሳሎዛ ዛዋ ኦዲ ሚጪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>ኢዚ ሃንቂዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">ሳሎ ቱሳቲ ዳጋማን ኮኮሬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>ኢዚ ባ ዎልቃን ኣባ ጮኡ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ኢዛ ኣ ኤራቴይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:12">ኤራኣቤ ጌቴቲዛይሳ ይሳና።<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>ባ ፔኖዛን ሳሎዛ ጌሻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">ጾንጌቲዛ ሾሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">ባ ኩሼን ጫዳና።<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>ሃይታንቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ጾሲ ኦዛ ኦሶታፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ጉታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ኑ ሲዪዛይሲ ኢዛስ ሳሱኬ ጻላ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:14">ዎልቃማ ጊሪሳ ኢዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 26:14">ኦኒ ኣኬካናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?»<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቤ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>ኢዮቢካ ባ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:1">ሲንዉ ጉጂዲ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>«ሱሬ ፒርዳ ዲጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ታ ሼምፖዮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ኣዳፌ ጫሞ ኦዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ዴኦ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:2">ሱንን ጫቃይስ፤<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>ጾሲ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">ሼምፖራ ዎዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">ዎዴይ ጋካናስ፥<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>ኡባካ ኢታ ቃላይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ታ ዶናፔ ኬኤና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">ታ ኢንጻርሳንካ ዎርዶ ሃሳይኬ።<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>ኢንቴ ሃሳይዳይሲ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ሊኬ ጋዳ ሙሌካ ኤኪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ታ ሃይቃናሼ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ሱሬቴን ሚና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ኤቃናይሳ ኣጊኬ።<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>ታኒ ታ ጺሎቴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ሚና ኤቃና ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ጺሎቴ ኣጊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ሼምፖራ ፓጻ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ላይ ኡባን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">ታ ዎዚናይ ሃ ሚሻን ሲና።<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>«ናጋራንቻታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">ፒርዴቲዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">ታ ሞርኬታ ቦላ ፒርዴቶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">ታና ኢጺዛይታ ቦላካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:7">ጌኔ ኣሳታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:7">ፒርዴቲዛ ማላ ፒርዴቶ።<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>ጾሲ ኢስታ ሼምፖዮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ኢስታ ኣሾፔ ሻኪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ኢስታ ላይ ቃንጺዳ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:8">ጾሳ ካዲዳ ኣሳታስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:8">ኣይ ሂዶታይ ዳንዴ?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>ሜቶይ ኢስታ ቦላ ዪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">ጾሲ ኢስታ ዋሶዛ ሲያንዴ?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">ኢስቲ ኡፋዬታንዴቶ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">ዎዴን ዎዴንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">ጾሳ ሱን ጼይጋንዴቶ?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>«ጾሳ ዎልቃይ ኣይ ማላ ጊታኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ታ ኢንቴና ታማርሳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ቆፒ ዎይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ታ ኢንቴፌ ቆቲኬ።<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>ኢንቴኒካ ሃይሳ ኡባ ኤሬታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">ሂስቲን ሃይሳ ሃዳ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:12">ኣይስ ሃሳዬቲ?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>«ሄኮ ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ኢታ ኣሲኔ ጌናንቻቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ኤካና ላታይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ሃይሳፌ ካሊዛይሳ።<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>ኢዛ ናይቲ ቲሪፒኮካ ኦላን ዉራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">ኢዛ ዜሬቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">ካ ዪን ኮሻታና።<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>ሄሳፌ ኣቲዳይቲ ሃርጌን ዉራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">ኣምኤቲካ ኢስታስ ዬኬቴና።<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>ኢታ ኣሲ ቢራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">ቢታ ማላ ሺሻናዉ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">ማይኦካ ማና ቢታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:16">ዶራናዉ ዳንዳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢታ ኣሲ ሺሺዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">ማይኦዛ ጺሎ ኣሲ ማይኣና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">ኢዚ ሺሺዳ ቢራካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:17">ጌሻቲ ጊሼቲ ኤካና።<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>ኢዚ ኬጺዛ ኬቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">ኣቻሮ ኬ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:18">ካ ናጊዛዴይ ኣቂዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:18">ጋባ ማላ ላሌታና።<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>ኢታ ኣሲ ዉርሴ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ዱሬ ጊዲዲ ኢቼስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ኢዚ ቤጊዛ ዎዴ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:19">ኢዛ ኣቆታይ ኡባይ ይዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>ዳጋማይ ኢዛ ቦላ ዲኦ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">ቆፖንታ ዲሺን ጋካና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">ጊዶካ ጎቴ ጫርኮይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:20">ኢዛ ዴን ኤፋና።<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>ኣርሼይ ሞኪዛሶ ባጋ ጫርኮይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">ኢዛሶፔ ኢዛ ፒቲ ይሳና።<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>ኢዚ ባቃቲዲ ኣቲ ባናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">ባጼቲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">ጫርኮዚ ቃቴ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">ኢዛ ቦላ ጌዴ ሚናና።<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>ጫርኮዚ ኢዛ ቦላ ኩሼ ባቂዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">ኢዚ ዲዛሶፔ ዋይቄን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 27:23">ፒጺሪ ዬጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s">ኣ ኤራቴ ናሻናስ ሺቂዳ ጊንጾ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>«ቱማፔ ቢታ ጋርሳን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">ማኢዲኔቲ ቦኬቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:1">ቢራ ኬኢዛሶይኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:1">ዎርቃይ ሴሪ ኦሴቲዛሶይ ዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>ቢራታይ ቢታፌ ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">ጻርቂማላይ ማኢዲኔ ሹቻፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">ሴሪዲ ኬኤስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>ኣሳይ ማ ካንዲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">ዱጌ ቢታ ጊዶ ቦኪ ጌሊዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:3">ሃኪ ዲዛሶዛ ዱጌ ዎዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:3">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:3">ማኢዲኔ ሹቻ ኮዬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>ኣሲ ዲዛሶፔ ሃኪዲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ኣሳ ቶሆይ ዬ ኤሮንታሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ጋኬቴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ሄንካ ጪማ ኦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ቦኬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">ዎዶሮ ቦላራ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:4">ኩሎቲ ኩሎቲ ዎዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:4">ኣሳፔ ሻኬቲ ባርካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:4">ኦቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>ቢታይ ሜቴቲዛ ካ ኢሜስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">ኢዛስ ጊዶይ ታማን ሴሪዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:5">ሺሬቲ ሺሬቲ ዎስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>ሴምፔሬ ጌቴቲዛ ኣልኦ ሹቻይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ቢታን ዲዛ ሹቻታ ጊዶን ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ሄ ቢታ ጊዶንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ዎርቃይ ቤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>ጌዴ ማኢዲኔዛኮ ኤፊዛ ኦጌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">ጺሎይካ ኤሬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">ኣንኮታ ኣይፌይካ ቤዪቤና።<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>ኢታ ዶኣቲ ሄ ሶሆዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">ዬቤቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">ጋሞይካ ኢዛ ባጋራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">ኣቤና።<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>ኣሲ ጋዴ ጎዪሼ ሚኖ ሹቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">ባ ኩሼን ዴንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">ዙማታካ ጻጶፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">ሺሪ ዬጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>ዛላካ ጳልቂዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">ኢዛ ጊዶራ ኣናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">ኦጌ ኬሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">ኣልኦ ጊዲዳ ማኢዲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">ሹቻታካ ዴሜስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>ሻፋታ ፑልቶታ ቴቄስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">ቢታ ጊዶን ቆታን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">ሚሻታ ቆንጬ ኬሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>ሂስቲን ኣ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">ኣዋፔ ቤቲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">ኣኬካሲካ ዲዛሶይ ኣዋ?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>ኣ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">ሼምፖራ ፓጻ ዲዛ ሜታቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:13">ዲዛ ቢታን ቤቱኩ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">ኢዚስ ቱማ ዋጋካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:13">ኤሪዛ ኣሲ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>‹ዎጋ ጊታ ኣባይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">ታ ጊዶን ዱኩ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">ኣባይካ ታናራ ዱኩ› ጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>ኤራቴ ጌሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">ዎርቃን ሻሜቱኩ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">ኢዚ ዋጋይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">ቢራን ሄሬጌቴና።<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>ኣ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">ኦፊሬ ጌቴቲዛ ዎርቃፌ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">ማርጊዴኔ ሴምፔሬ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:16">ኣልኦ ሹቻታፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:16">ኣ ቦንቼቲዳሮ።<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>ዎርቃይኔ ጌሻ ሄሬጋይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">ኢዚራ ጊናቴቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">ጺንታ ዎርቃፌ ኦሴቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">ጌጼይካ ኢዞ ላማና።<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>ቦንቼቲዳ ሄሌሎይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">ኣልማዜ ጌቴቲዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:18">ኣ ኤራቴራ ጊናቴቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">ኣ ኤራቴ ጋቴይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:18">ሉሌ ጌቴቲዛይሳፌካ ቦላ።<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>ቶጳዚዮኔ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">ቶጵያ ቢታ ኢንቁይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">ኢዚራ ጊኔና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">ኬሂ ጌዪዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">ዎርቃፌካ ኣዉስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>«ሂስቲኮ ኤራቴ ኣዋፔ ያዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">ኣኬካይካ ኣዋፔ ቤታዜ?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>ሼምፖራ ፓጻ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">ሜታታፔ ጌሚዳሮ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">ሳሎራ ፒራዛ ካፎቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">ኮዪዲ ኢዞ ዴሜቴና።<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>ዮይኔ ሃይቆይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‹ኑ ኢዚ ጊሻስ ኤሪዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:22">ዎሬን ጻላ› ጌቴስ።<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28፡22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ዎሬ ጊዛይሳ ኢሲ ኢሲ ባጋ ጋሞ ቃላን ፓፑን ጌቴስ። </char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>ኣ ኤራቴኮ ኤፊዛ ኦጌዛኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">ኢዛ ዲዛሶዛ ኤሪዛይ ጾሳ ጻላ።<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>ኢዚካ ሳኣ ጋጻ ኩሜ ዴሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">ሳሎፔ ጋርሳን ዲዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">ኡባ ቤዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>ኢዚ ጫርኮ ዎልቃ ኦዳ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">ዎጋ ጊታ ኣባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">ኢዚ ማኪዳ ዎዴ፥<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>ኢራሲኔ ዎልቃንራ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">ዳዳስ ዎጋ ዎዳ ዎዴ፥<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>ጾሲ ኤራቴ ቤዪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:27">ፓጪ ጼሊዲ ኢዞ ቦንቺዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 28:27">ፒልጊ ቤኢዲ ሚን ዎዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኣሳስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‹ሄኮ ኤራቴ ጉሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ጾሳስ ያሻቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ኣኬካ ጉሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">ኢታፔ ሃኮ› ጊዴስ።»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28፡28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:10">ማዛ 111፡10</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 1:7">ኢሳ 1፡7</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 9:10">9፡10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቢ ዉርሴን ሺሺዳ ማጋና</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>ኢዮቢካ ባ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:1">ሲን ጉጂዲ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>«ታስ ሃኢ ዴኦዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">ካሴ ጾሲ ታና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">ናጊዛ ዎዴዛ ማላ ጊዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:2">ታና ኣይ ማላ ኡፋይሳንዴሻ!<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>ሄ ዎዴ ማ ጊዶራ ታ ቢሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">ጾሲ ታስ ፖኢሲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:3">ታኒ ፖኦን ሄሜታይሲኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>ጾሳ ማዶይ ታ ኬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">ካሴ ናቴቴ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">ናጊዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:4">ሃኢካ ናጊዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:4">ኣዜ ዲዛይ?<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ታናራ ዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ታ ናይቲ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">ታ ዩሾን ዴቴስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>ታኒ ቶሆ ማን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">ሜጬታናሼ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">ዳሮ ማ ዴማይስኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:6">ዎጋራ ሚቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:6">ሜላ ቢታንካ ቶኬቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:6">ዲኦ ማላ ጎጊዛ ዳሮ ዛይቴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:6">ታስ ኢሜቴስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>ካታማ ፔንጌ ኣቻን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">ዱቡሻ ባዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">ዱላታን ታ ኡቲዛ ዎዴ፥<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>ናቴ ናይቲ ታና ቤኢዲ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:8">ቦንቾስ ታ ሲንፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:8">ኢሲ ባጋ ጌቴሲሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:8">ጪማቲካ ታ ቦንቾ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:8">ባ ኡቲዳሶሆፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:8">ዴንዲ ኤቄቴሲሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>ሃሳይሼ ዲዛ ዴሬ ካሌዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">ታና ቤኢዲ ባንታ ኩሼታን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:9">ባ ዶና ዶና ኦይኪዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:9">ጮኡ ጌቴስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>ዴሬ ዳናቲካ ታኒ ዲዛሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ጮኡ ጌቴሲሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ኢስታስ ኢንጻርሲ ኦይኬቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">ሃሳያይካ ኢስታ ጾኔስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>ታና ሲዪዳ ኡባይ ናሺዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">ታና ቤኢዳ ኡባይ ጋላቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>ሃይሲካ ሃኒዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ታኒ ማንቆታ ዎሳ ሲያዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ኢስታ ኣሺዛይሳኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ዪኦ ናይታ ታ ማዲዛ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>ሃይቃና ማቲዳ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ታ ማዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:13">ታና ኢስቲ ኣንጂዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ኣምኤ ማጫሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ታ ማዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ኡፋይሳን ዬጺዳ።<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>ጺሎቴ ማይኦ ማላ ማይኣዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">ሱሬ ፒርዳካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:14">ካባ ማላ ጎጳ ማይኣዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">ቆቤ ማላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">ሁኤን ዎዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>ቆቄታስ ኣይፌ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ዎቤታስካ ቶሆ ጊዳዲስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>ማንቆታስ ኣዋ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ታ ኤሮንታ ኣሳታስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">ኣፓካቶኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>ጌኔ ኣሳ ባንቂላ ሜንዲስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">ኢዚ ቦንቂ ኤኪዳይሳካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:17">ኢዛ ዶናፔ ዬጊሳዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>«ታኒ፥ ‹ታ ላይይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ኣንጮ ማላ ዳሪን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">ታኒ ታሶን ዲዛ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:18">ቦንቾን ሃይቃና›</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:18">ጋዲስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>ጻጶቲ ኡባ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">ሃ ዴሚዛ ማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">ሃጋቲካ ጻዛን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">ጪሊሊዛ ሚ ማላኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>ኡባ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ታ ቦንቼቲዳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ዳይስኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">ታ ዎልቃይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:20">ኡባ ዎዴ ኦራጼስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>ኣሳይ ታ ዞሬዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">ላሞታን ጮኡ ጊዲ ኤዝጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>ታ ሃሳያይ ኢስታ ኣሊዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ታፔ ጉዬራ ሃሳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ኣሲ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>ጎሻንቻይ ባሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">ኢራ ዴማናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">ኣሞቲዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">ኢስቲካ ታ ሃሳያ ሲያናዉ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:23">ባንታ ዶና ዶይዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:23">ናጌቴስኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>ታ ሚጫ ቤሲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ኢስቲ ኡፋዬቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ታ ሲንይ ፖኢሺን ጺርጶቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:24">ኢስታ ሲንይ ቢርሼቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>ካሴ ታ ኢስቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ኮዪዳ ማላ ኣይሳይስኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ባ ኦላ ኣሳ ካሌዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ካዎ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:25">ታ ኢስታ ካሌዲስኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:25">ኢስቲ ሙዞቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:25">ታኒ ኢስታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 29:25">ሚንይሲኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>«ኢስታ ኣዋቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ታስ ዶርሳ ዉዴዛ ሄሚዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:1">ታ ካናታራ ሞንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:1">ኢስቲ ታ ካዛ ኣሳታኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ሃኢ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ላይን ታፔ ናቲዛ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ታ ቦላ ቂልጬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>ኢስታስ ዎልቃይ ኢጺዳ ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">ኢስታ ቦላይ ጊልቂዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:2">ኣይኮካ ታና ጎኤቴና።<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>ሜቶፔኔ ኮሻ ዳሮፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ባዞ ቢታ ቢ ቢዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:3">ሚ ጻጶ ማጼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:3">ጋንጬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>ማጺኔ ማላ ማልኢዛ ባዞን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">ሞኪዛ ዱማ ዱማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">ሚ ሃይታ ማጼቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:4">ማልኦንታ ሳንካራ ጻጶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:4">ቆሬሬ ሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>ኣሲ ካይሶታ ዋሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">ጎዲዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">ኢስቲካ ዴራ ጊዶፌ ጎዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>ኢስቲ ባንታ ዱሳሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">ሃ ባይንዳ ሻፋ ጊዶን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">ኣሲ ባይንዳ ባዞ ቢታኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">ኬልካ ጊዶን ቦኬቲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">ጎንጎሎታን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:6">ዶሳይ ባይንዳ ዴኢዳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>ዎራይ ዲዛሶ ዩዪ ዩዪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">ዎራ ዶኣታ ማላ ዋሴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">ዎራ ጋርሳን ኢሲ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:7">ሺቄቲ ኣቄቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>ባንታ ቢታፌ ጹርቃፌን ሾጬቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">ጎዴቲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:8">ሎኦ ሱንኔ ዎዚናይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:8">ባይንዳይታ ጊዲዲ ዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>ሃኢ ቃሴ ኢስታ ናይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">ዬን ታና ቂቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">ታኒ ኢስታ ጊዶንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">ሚጬቴስ ኣታዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>ታና ሻቴቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">ታፔ ሃኬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">ኣይኮ ዬላይካ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:10">ታ ሲንን ጩቴቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>ጾሳይ ታ ዎልቃ ዳቡርሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">ታና ካዉሺዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">ኢስቲ ቃሴ ቢጻላይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">ፓራ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:11">ታ ቦላ  ቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>ታፔ ኡሻቻ ባጋራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ዬዳ ዲጪዳይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ታ ቦላ ዴንዲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ታና ኦይካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">ዎጺማዴ ዎዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:12">ታና ጊዶዳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>ታስ ኣዛሶ ይሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">ታና ዎና ኮዬቴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">ኢስቲ ሃይሳ ኦናይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:13">ዲጋናዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>ዲኦይ ሜን ጌሊዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ኢስቲካ ታና ጩጊ ጌሊዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ኡባካ ሜንሬዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ታ ቦላ ዪዳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>ጊታ ዳጋማይ ታና ጋኪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ታስ ዲዛ ቦንቾይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ጫርኮ ማላ ኣዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:15">ታ ኣታና ጊዛ ሂዶታይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:15">ሻራ ማላ ዴንዲ ይዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>«ታ ሼምፖያ ኬሃ ጬጫዱስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">ሃይቆስካ ማታዱስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>ኦማርስ ኩሜ ታ ሜቄቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">ሃርጌን ዋዬቴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">ሳኮዚካ ታስ ሼምፖ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:17">ኢሜና።<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>ታና ሳኪዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">ዎልቃማ ሳኮዛ ጋሶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">ታ ማይኦይ ጉንዲ ሞሬቲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:18">ቆ ጹን ሻሚዜ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:18">ታና ጩሊ ኦይኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>ጾሲ ታና ዱጌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">ቢታን ኦሊዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">ታኒ ጉዱላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">ቢዲን ሚሳታዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>ጾሶ፥ ታ ኔና ዎሳዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:20">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኔ ታስ ዛራቤካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ታ ኤቃዳ ኔኮ ዎሳዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:20">ኔኒ ጊዲኮ ኔ ሲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:20">ታኮ ዛራቤካ።<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>ኔ ታስ ኣዳፌ ሜንጼ ኢታዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">ኔኒ ኔ ጊታ ዎልቃንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">ታና ጎዳዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>ኔ ታና ዴንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">ጫርኮ ቦላ ዎዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">ኢዚ ታና ዩሻና ማላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">ኦዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">ጎቴ ጫርኮይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:22">ታና ሺሬቺ ሺሬቺ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:22">ዬጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>ኣሳ ኡባስ ቃዳ ጊዲዳ ሃይቆስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">ኔ ታና ኣዳ ኢማናይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:23">ታ ኤራይስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>«ኢሲ ሜቶቲዳ ኡራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ማዶ ዴማናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ባ ኩሼ ሚጪዲ ዎሲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:24">ቱማፔ ኣይ ኣሲካ ኢዛ ቆሄና።<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>ታኒ ሜቶቲዳ ኣሳታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">ዬካቤኪና?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">ማንቆታስካ ሚሼታቤኪና?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>ሎኦ ሚሽ ዴማና ጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ታ ናጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ኢታ ሚሺ ታና ጋኪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ፖኦይ ያና ጋ ታ ናጌቲሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:26">ታስ ጋላሳይ ሚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>ታ ዎዚናይ ዳሮ ጬጪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">ኣይ ሳሮካ ዴማቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:27">ሜቶ ጋላሳቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:27">ታ ቦላ ጋኪዳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>ታ ቦላይ ኣዋ ጹሳን ጊዶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">ሙዞቴን ካሬጺዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">ዱላታ ኣሳ ሲንን ኤቃዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:28">ማዶ ታስ ኦይቻይስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>ኣሳፔ ሻኬታዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">ዎራካናታስ ኢሻ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">ጉቶታስ ላጌ ጊዳዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>ታስ ጋልባዚ ካሬጺዲ ዴንዲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">ታስ ቦላዚካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">ሚሻን ጹጌቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>ታኒ ታ ኡፋይስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ኢስታን ቆንጪሲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ባጋናኔ ዛዬይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ሃኢ ታ ካዮታዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">ኬሲዛ ዚላሳ ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 30:31">ሲሲዛ ሚሽ ጊዲዳ።<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቢ ባ ዉርሴ ሃሳያ ፖሊዴስ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>«ሎኦ ማጫሳኮ ጼላዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">ኣሞቶንታ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">ታኒ ታ ኣይፌታራ ጫቆ ጌላዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>ቦላን ዴኢዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">ኣሳስ ኣይ ቃዳ ኢማንዴሻ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">ሳሎን ዲዛ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:2">ኣሳስ ኢሜቲዳ ጊሻይ ኣዜሻ?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>ኢታ ኣሳ ቦላ ቆሆይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">ናጋራንቻ ኣሳ ቦላካ ዮይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:3">ጋካናይሲ ኤሬቲዳዝ ጊዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>ጾሳይ ታ ኦዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">ኡባ ቤዬኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">ታ ሄሜታካ ሻኪ ኤሬኔ?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>ታኒ ዎርዶ ሃሳይዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">ኣሳካ ባሌዳ ጊዲኮ፤<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>ጾሲ ታና ሱሬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">ጌዳራን ጌዳሮ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">ታኒ ጺሎ ጊዲዳይሳ ሻኪ ኤሮ።<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>ታ ሱሬ ኦጌፔ ኬኢዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ታ ኣይፌይ ቤኢዳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ታ ዎዚናይ ኣሞቲዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">ቃሴካ ታ ኩሼይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:7">ናጋራን ቱኒዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>ታኒ ዜሪዳይሳ ሃራ ኣሲ ሞ።</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:8">ታ ጫሬቻዚካ ኩሜ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:8">ሾዴቲ ኦሌቶ።<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>«ታ ዎዚናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ሃራ ማጫ ኣሞቲዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ታ ሾሮዛ ማቾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ላይማታናስ ኢዛ ፔንጌን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">ታ ዙጊዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>ታ ማቻ ሃራ ኣሳስ ጋጩ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">ቃሴካ ሃራ ኣዴይ ኢዚራ ዚንኦ።<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>ሃይሲካ ኬሂ ቱና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">ዎጋንካ ቃጻይሲዛ ናጋራ።<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>ሃ ናጋራይ ታማ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ጹጊዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ታ ሃይሳ ኦዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ታ ኣቆታ ጹጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ይሳናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>«ማጫኔ ኣቱማ ጊዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">ታ ኣይሌቲ ታና ሞቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:13">ኢስታ ሞቶዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:13">ታ ካዳ ኣጊዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>ጾሲ ታና ፒርዲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">ታኒ ዋናኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">ቃሴ ኢዚ ታና ኦይቺዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:14">ታኒ ኣይ ዛሮ ኢማኔ?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>ታ ኣዬይ ኡሎን ታና ሜዳይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">ታ ኣይሌታካ ሜዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:15">ኢዛ ጊዴኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">ኑና ኡባታካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:15">ኣዪ ኡሎን ሜዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:15">ኢዛ ዴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>«ማንቆቲ ታና ዎሲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ታ ዲጋ ኤሪኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ቃሴካ ኣምኤ ማጫሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ሚንንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ኣጋ ኤሪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>ዪኦኔ ዪቶ ናይታ ኣጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">ታ ካ ታርካ ማቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>ታኒ ታ ዬላጋቴፌ ዶማዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">ታኒ ኢስታ ኣዋ ማላ ዲቻዲስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">ታ ዴኦ ላይ ኡባን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:18">ኣምኤ ማጫሳታ ማዳዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>ማይኦይ ዪን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">ሜጎይ ዎዛዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">ዎይኮ ሜቶፔ ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:19">ካሎ ዲዛዴ ቤያዳ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>ታ ዶርሳታ ኢስኬፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">ኦሴቲዳ ማይኦ ታ ማይዚን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">ኢዛዴ ሆኢን ታና ዛሪ ጋላቶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">ኣጊዳ ዎዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>ታኒ ሞቶን ኢስታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ላናይሳ ኤራዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ኣዋይ ባይንዳ ናይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ናቂዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>ታ ኩሼይ ሃሼፔ ኬኦ።</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:22">ታ ቄሴይካ ኩሬዛፔ ኮልዶ።<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>ታኒ ጾሳ ሃንቆስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ያዪዛ ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ኢዛ ቴማቴስ ያዪዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ሃይሳ ማላ ዮኦታ ኦናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">ታ ዳንዳይኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>«ታኒ ታስ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ኣቆታን ኣማኔታቤኬ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ዎይኮ ፓያ ዎርቃካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ታስ ኣማኔቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">ሚሽ ኦቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>‹ታስ ዲዛ ኣቆይ ዳሪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ታኒ ዱሬቴፌ ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:25">ዳሮ ሚሽ ዴማዲስ› ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ኡፋዬታ ኤሪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>ኣርሼ ፖኦዛ ቤያዳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">ኣጊና ሎኤቴ ቤያዳ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>ታ ዎዚናን ኢስታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">ጌማራ ቦንቻቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:27">ቃሴካ ታ ኩሼ ሚጫ ዬራዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:27">ኢስታስ ጎይናቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>ታኒ ሃይሳ ማላ ኦዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">ሳሎን ዲዛ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">ካዶ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:28">ሃይቲ ሃ ኦሶቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:28">ታ ቦላ ፒርዳ ኤሂዛ ናጋራታ።<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>«ታ ሞርኬታ ኩንዴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">ታኒ ኡፋዬታቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">ኢታ ሚሺ ኢስታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">ጋኪሺንካ ሚጫቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>‹ታ ሞርኬቲ ዬቶ› ጋ ቃንጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">ናጋራ ኦቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>ታኒ ኡባ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">ኢማ ሞኪዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">ታሶ ኣይሌቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:31">ታ ጊሻስ ማርካቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>ታኒ ታ ኬ ካሬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">ኦጌራ ኣ ቢዛ ማንዳራስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:32">ዶያ ዎዲስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ጋዴይ ቃሚን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:32">ዪዳ ኢማ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:32">ካሬን ኣይሳ ኤሪኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>ታኒ ታ ሞሮ ጌንቤኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">ሃራ ኣሳታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:33">ታ ናጋራካ ቆታቤኬ።<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>ታና ኣሳ ዳሮይ ያሺሲኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ሶ ኣሳታ ካይ ዳጋንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:34">ታኒ ታሶን ጮኡ ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:34">ቆቴቲዳ ዎዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>«ታ ጊዛይሳ ሲዪዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ቤቴሬኔሺን!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ታኒካ ቴቄ ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ሺሻናኮሺን!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:35">ታ ጊዛይሳ ዛሮ ኢዚ ኢሞ!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:35">ታና ሞቲዛ ሞታንቻይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:35">ታና ሞቲዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:35">ጻፊ ሺሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:35">ታ ቤያርኪናሺን!<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>ዎይቶ ማላ ታኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">ታ ሃሼን ቶካናኮሺን፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">ካላቻ ማላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">ታ ሁኤ ቦላ ጎጻና።<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>ዳናቴ ዲዛ ኣሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">ጾሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">ያዮንታ ኤቃዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:37">ታ ኦዳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:37">ቆንጪሳ ዮታናኮሺን።<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>«ኣሳ ጋዴ ዎጋይ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">ቦንቃ ኤካዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">ታኒ ጎዪዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>ሄ ጋዳ ጎዳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">ታ ሚሺሲዳ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:39">ኣይኮካ ኢስታስ ኢሞንታ ዳሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:39">ሞኪዳ ካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:39">ታኒ ሚዳ ጊዲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>ሄ ታ ጎዪዛ ጎሻሶን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">ጊስቴ ጊሻስ ኣጉን፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:40">ባንጋ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:40">ሻራፋይ ሞኮ» ጊዴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">ኢዮቢ ባ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 31:40">ሃይሳን ፖሊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s">ኤሊሁ ሃሳያ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32፡1—37፡24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>ኢዮቢ፥ «ታኒ ጺሎ ኣሳ» ጊዛ ቆፋ ላሞንታ ጊሻስ ሄ ኣሳቲ ኢዛ ዞሪዛይሳ ኣጊዳ። <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>ኤራማ ዜሬፌ ቡዜ ዴሬ ኣስ ባራኬሌ ና ኤሊሁይ ኢዮቢ ባና ጾሳፌ ኣዲ ጺሊሲዳ ጊሻስ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ኬሂ ሃንቄቲዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>ቃሴካ ኢዮቤ ላጌ ሄቲ ኢዮቤ ቦላ ፒርዳፌ ኣቲን ኢዛ ኣማንዛ ቃላ ዮቲ ኣማንንታ ጊሻስ ኢስታ ቦላካ ሃንቄቲዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>ኤሊሁይ ሃንኮይታፔ ዬላጋ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ ሃንኮይቲ ባንታስ ዲዛይሳ ሃሳዪ ዉርሳናሼ ጋካናስ ኢዮቤራ ሃሳያናዉ ባ ታራ ናጎ ቦላ ዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>ኢዮቤ ላጌ ሄቲ ኢዮቤስ ቤሲዛ ዛሮ ኢማናስ ዳንዳዮንታይሳ ቤኢዲ ኬሂ ሃንቄቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>ቡዜ ዴሬ ኣስ ባራኬሌ ና ኤሊሁይ፥</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">«ታኒ ኢንቴፌ ዬላጋ ጊዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">ኢንቴ ጪማ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:6">ፖኮይኔ ያሺ ታና ኦይኪን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:6">ሃኖ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:6">ታ ቆፋ ቆንጪሶንታ ጋምኣዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>‹ጪማቲ ሲንቲ ሃሳዬቶ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">ባንታ ላይን ዴሚዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:7">ኣ ኤራቴፌ ታማርሴቶ›</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:7">ጋ ቆፓዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ኣሳ ጊዶን ኣቂዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">ኣ ኤራቴ ኣሳስ ኢሚዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:8">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳ ኣያና።<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>ኣስ ኣ ኤራንቻ ኬሲዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ጪማቴ ጊዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ቃሴካ ኣሲ ኣኬካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ዳንዳይዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ኢዛዴስ ላይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:9">ኣዱቂዳ ጊሻስ ጊዴና።<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>«ሄሳ ጊሻስ ሎኤ ሲዪቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">ታኒካ ታ ቆፋ ኢንቴስ ዮታና።<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>ኢንቴ ሃሳይዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">ታኒ ጮኡ ጋዳ ኤዝጋይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:11">ኢንቴ ሃሳያና ቃላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:11">ቆፒሺንካ ታኒ ናጋይስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>ታኒ ኢንቴ ሃሳይዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">ሎኤ ሲያዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢንቴፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:12">ኦኒካ ኢዮቢ ሞራንቻ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:12">ጊዲዳይሳ ኣማንዳይኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:12">ቃሴካ ኢዛ ሃሳያስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:12">ቤሲዛ ዛሮ ኢሚዳይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>ኢዮቤ ሃሳያስ ቤሲዛ ዛሮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">ኢማናስ ዳንዳይዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:13">ጾሳፌ ኣቲን ኣስ ጊዶንታ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">ኢንቴ፥ ‹ኑኒ ኣ ኤራቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">ዴሚዶስ› ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">ጮ ሃዳ ጬቄቶፍቴ።<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>ኢዮቢ ማርሼቲዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">ኢንቴናራፔ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">ታናራ ጊዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">ታኒካ ኢንቴ ሃሳይዛይሳ ማላን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">ኢዛስ ዛሮ ኢሚኬ።<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>«ኢስቲ ዳጋሚዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">ሃሳይዛ ቃላይ ይዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">ኣይኮ ሃሳያናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">ዳንዳይቤቴና።<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>ሄኮ! ኢስቲ ሃሳይዛ ሚሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">ዪን ጮኡ ጊዲ ኤቂዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">ሂስቲን ታኒካ ጮኡ ጋ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:16">ናጋናሲ ታስ ቤሲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>ኣካይ! ጮኡ ጊኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">ታኒካ ታ ባጋራ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">ዛሮዛ ኢማና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:17">ታ ቆፋካ ቆንጪሳና።<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>ታ ሃሳያናስ ቤሲዛዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ዳሮይ ዲዛ ጊሻስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">ታናን ዲዛ ኣያናይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:18">ታና ዎልቃራ ሃሳይሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>ቤኢቴ! ታኒ ሃሳዮንታ ኣጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ዎይኔ ጫጄ ዎዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ኦራ ሉካሞይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:19">ሼምፒዛሶ ይዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:19">ቃናስ ፑሪዛይሳ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:19">ታ ጊዶይ ፑሪዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ቃና ጋኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>ኣኔ! ታኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ሃይሳፌ ሃሳያዳ ሼምፓይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ታ ዶና ዶያዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:20">ታኒ ሃሳያናስ ቤሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>ሃይሳ ሃ ዮኦዛን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">ታኒ ኦናካ ማዲኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">ዎይኮ ኣይ ኣሳካ ኣዳሺኬ።<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>ታኒ ኣስ ኣዳሾይ ሙሌካ ሃኔና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">ታ ሄሳ ማላ ኦኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">ታና ሜዳይሲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 32:22">ታና ሃንቃና።<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>«ኢዮቤ! ታ ኔስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ዮቲዛይሳ ሲያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">ታ ኔስ ጊዛይሳካ ኣኬካን ኤዝጋ፤<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>ታ ኔስ ዛሮ ኢማናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:2">ጊጌታ ኡታዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:2">ታ ዶናይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:2">ጊጌቲ ኡቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>ታ ሃሳይዛ ቃላቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ታ ዎዚና ሱሬቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ቆንጪሴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">ታ ኢንጻርሳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:3">ታ ኤሪዛ ቱማ ሃሳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>ታና ሜዳይ ጾሳ ኣያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">ታስ ዴኦ ኢሚዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:4">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳ ኣያና።<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>ኔኒ ዳንዳይዛ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">ታ ጎይሳስ ዛሮ ኢማ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">ኔ ጋናይሳ ጊጊሳዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">ታናራ ሃሳዬታ።<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>ሄኮ! ታኒ ጾሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">ኔናራ ጊና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">ታኒካ ሜቲዳይ ኡርቃፌ።<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>ኔኒ ታስ ያያናስ ቤሴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">ታኒካ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">ናቃናዉ ኮሼና።<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>ኔኒ ሃሳይዳ ኡባ ኤዝጋሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ታ ጋምኣዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">ኔ ኢንጻርሳፌ ኬኢዳ ቃላታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:8">ታ ሲያዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>ኔኒ ሃሳያሼ፥ ‹ታኒ ቆሆይኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ቦሬይ ባይንዳ ኣሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ታኒ ናጋራ ኦንታዴኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ጺሎ ኣሳ።<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ጾሲ ታና ቃጻያናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">ጋሶ ኮዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">ታናካ ባስ ሞርኬ ማላ ቆዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>ታ ቶሆታ ኢዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ዱሩማን ዱጺ ቃቺዴስ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ታ ቢዛሶ ኡባን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">ታና ጼሌስ› ጋዳሳ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">ኢዮ 13፡27</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>«ኢዮቤ! ሃይሲ ኔ ሃሳያይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ባላ ጊዲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ታኒካ ኔስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ቆንጪሳናስ ኮያይስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:12">ጾሲ ኣሳ ኡባፌ ኣስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>ሂስቲን፥ ‹ኔኒ ጾሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">ኣሲ ማጋኒዛ ማጋና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">ሲዬና› ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">ኣይስ ጾሳ ቦላ ዙዙማይ?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>ኣሲ ኣኬኬናፌ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">ጾሲ ዱማ ዱማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">ኦጌራ ሃሳዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>ኦማርስ ኣሲ ሂጻን ኢቺ ዲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">ኣሲ ኮይሮ ስኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">ሴራጊዳ ዎዴ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:15">ኣጉሞኒኔ ኣጁታንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:15">ጾሲ ሃሳዬስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33፡15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">ኢዮ 4፡13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኣሲ ኢዛ ቃላ ሲያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">ሃይ ዶዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">ኢዚ ባ ኢሚዛ ሴራንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">ዳጋንስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>ሄሳ ማላ ኦሶን ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">ናጋራ ኦንታ ማላ ዲጌስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">ኦቶሬቴካ ኢስታፌ ዴንስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>ጾሲ ኣሳ ሼምፖ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">ዮፔ ኣሼስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">ባሻ ሃይቆፔካ ዎዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>ዎይኮ ኣሲ ሜቄን ጌሊዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">ሳኮን ዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">ኣሲ ባ ባላፔ ሲማና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:19">ሃርጌ ሂጻን ጾሲ ዞሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>ሃይሳ ማላን ሃርጋንቻ ካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">ላንቃናስ ኢዛ ኢቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">ሎኦ ካካ ሃራሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>ጊልቃቴፔ ዴንዶይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">ኢዛስ ኣሾዚካ ዉሪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">ሜቄ ጻላ ኣቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>ኢዛ ሼምፖይ ኬዛናሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">ሞጌታናስ ማቲዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>«ኣሲ ሱሬ ኦጌ ቤሳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">ሺያን ቆዴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">ጾሳ ኪታንቻታፔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:23">ኢሶይ ኢዛ ማዳናስ ዪዳኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>ኪታንቻይ ኢዛስ ቃቲዲ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">‹ኢዛ ዎዚዛዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">ታ ዴሚዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">ኢዚ ዱጌ ዱፎን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">ዎንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">ኣጋጋ!› ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:24">ሃይቆ ኦይኪዳኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኢዛ ኣሳቴይ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:25">ቄሪ ና ኣሾ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:25">ዛሪ ኦራጻና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:25">ኢዛስ ዬላጋቴ ዎዴ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:25">ቃሴካ ሃናና።<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>ሄ ዎዴ ጾሳኮ ኢዚ ዎሳና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ኢዛ ዎሳካ ጾሲ ሲያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ጾሳ ሲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ኢዚ ቤኢዲ ኡፋዬታና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ጾሲካ ኢዛ ዎሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ዛሮ ኢማና።<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>ኢዚ ኣሳ ሲንን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‹ታኒ ናጋራ ኦዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">ሱሬ ጊዲዳይሳካ ጌላሳዲስ።</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:27">ጾሳይ ጊዲኮ ታ ሞራ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:27">ታስ ኦቤና።<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>ታኒ ዱፎን ጌሎንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">ታና ኣሺዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">ሄኮ ሃኢ ፓጻ ዳዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:28">ታኒ ፖኦ ቤያይስ› ጊ ዬጺዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>«ሄኮ! ጾሲ ሃይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">ኡባ ሚሻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">ኣሳስ ዛሪ ዛሪ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>ዴኦን ዲዲ ፖኦ ቤያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">ኢዛ ሼምፖ ሃይቆፔ ኣሼስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>«ኢዮቤ! ታ ኔስ ዮቲዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ሎኤ ሲያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ታኒ ኔስ ዮታይስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:31">ኣኔ ኔኒ ጮኡ ጋ።<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>ኔኒ ሃሳያናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ኮይዛ ሚሺ ዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ታስ ዮታ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ታ ኔኒ ጺሎ ጊዲዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 33:32">ኔና ቤሳና ኮያይስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>ኣካይ ጊኮ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ታኒ ሃሳይዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ጮኡ ጋዳ ሲያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ታኒ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">ኤራቴ ታማርሳና» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>ኤሊሁይ ባ ሃሳያ ጉጂዲ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>«ኢንቴኖ ኣ ኤራንቻቶ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">ታ ኢንቴስ ሃሳይዛይሳ ሲዪቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">ኢንቴኖ ኤራንቻቶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:2">ታ ሃሳያ ኤዝጊቴ።<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>ኢንጻርሲ ካ ማልኦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">ሻኪ ኤሬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">ሄሳካ ሃይ ዮኦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">ሻኪ ኤሬስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:11">ኢዮ 12፡11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>ቱሙ ጊዲዳ ዮኦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">ኣኔ ሻኪ ኤሮስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">ሎኦ ጊዲዳ ሚሺካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">ኢሲፌ ታማሮስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>«ኢዮቢ፥ ‹ታኒ ጺሎ ሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">ጾሲ ታና ሱሬ ፒርዳ ዲጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>ታኒ ቱማንቻሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ዎርዳንቻ ማላ ቆዴታዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">ታ ኣይኮካ ሞሮንታ ዳሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:6">ፓጾንታ ማዱንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:6">ዋዬታይስ› ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>ኢዮቤ ማላ ጾሳ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">ቂልጪዛዴይ ቤታንዴሻ?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>ኢዚ ኢታ ኦዛይታራ ላጌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">ኢዛስ ፔይሻይካ ኢታ ላጌታራ።<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>‹ጾሳ ኡፋይሳና ጊዲ ኦሶይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">ኣስ ኣይኮካ ማዴና› ጌስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>«ኣኬኪዛ ኣሳቶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">ኣኔ ታና ኤዝጊቴ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">ኢታ ኦሶይ ጾሳፌ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:10">ባላ ኦሶይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:10">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:10">ጾሳፌ ሃኮ!<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>ጾሲ ኣሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">ኢዛዴ ኦሶ ማላ ኢሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">ኢዛስ ኢዛዴ ሄሜ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">ኦስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34፡11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">ማዛ 62፡12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ሙሌካ ኢታ ሚሽ ኦና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ኣይ ኣሳስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">ሱሬ ፒርዳ ጌላሴና።<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>ጾሳሲ ቢታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">ሃዳራ ኢሚዳዴይ ዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">ኢዛ ኣላሜ ቦላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">ሹሚዳዴይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>ጾሲ ባ ኣያናዛኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ባ ሼምፖዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">ባኮ ዛሪ ኤካና ኮዪዳኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>ኣሾ ማይኢዳይ ኩሜ ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:15">ኣሳ ዜሬካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:15">ዱጌ ቢታን ሲማና።<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>ኔኒ ኣኬኪዛ ጊዲኮ ሃይሳ ሲያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">ታ ኔስ ሃሳይዛይሳ ኤዝጋ።<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>ሱሬ ፒርዳ ኢጺዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">ዴሬ ኣይሳናስ ዳንዳይዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">ኔኒ ጺሎኔ ዎልቃማ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:17">ናጋራንቻ ኬሳይ?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>ካዎታ ኢንቴ ሌኬታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">ሹሜታካ ኢንቴ ኢታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">ጋናይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>ኡባቲካ ኢዛ ሜታታ ጊዲዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ጊሻስ ኢዚ ሹሜታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ሻኪ ማዴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ዱሬታካ ማንቆታፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ሻኬና።<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>ኢስቲ ሌላ ጊዶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ቆፖንታ ሃይቃና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ኡባይ ኮኮሪ ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">ዎልቃማቲካ ኦና ኩሼይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:20">ቦቾንታ ኪቻና።<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>«ጾሲ ኣሳ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">ታንጎዛ ጼሌስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">ኢሳ ኢሳ ሄሜ ካሌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>ኢታ ኣሳቲ ቆቴታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>ጾሲ ኣሳ ቦላ ፒርዳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">ባሬ ኢሜና።<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>ዎልቃማ ዳናታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">ዳናቴፌ ዴንናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">ኢስታሶሆን ሃራ ዎናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:24">ኣይኮ ኦይሻይ ሺቆንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:24">ኢዚ ሄሳ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>ኢዚ ኢስታ ኦሳ ኤሪዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">ኢሲ ኦማርስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:25">ኢስታ ዳናቴፌ ይሳና።<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>ኢስቲ ኦዳ ማካላቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">ጋሶን ኡባ ኣሳ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:26">ማካላንቻታ ቃጻዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>ኢዚ ኢስታ ቃጻዪዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">ኢስቲ ኢዛ ካሊዛይሳ ኣጊዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">ጊሻሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:27">ኢዛ ኣዛዞታካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:27">ኢስቲ ካዳ ጊሻሳ።<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>ኢስቲ ማንቆታ ኡንኤዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ፑዴ ጾሳኮ ዋሳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ኦዳ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ጾሲካ ማንቆታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">ዋሶዛ ሲዪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>ጾሲ ጮኡ ጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">ኦኔ ኢዛ ቦላ ፒርዳናይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">ኢዚ ባ ዞኮ ዛሪኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:29">ኦኔ ኢዛ ቤያናይ?<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>ሄሳካ ጾሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">ያዮንታ ዴራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">ኡንኤዛ ካዎይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">ዴራ ቦላ ዴንዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">ኢዛ ኦኔ ዲጋናይ?<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>«ኢዮቤ! ኔኒ ኔ ናጋራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">ጾሳስ ፓጻዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">ዛራ ናጋራ ኦኬ ጋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">ቃላ ጌላዲ?<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>ታ ኦዳ ናጋራይ ኣዋይሳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ታና ታማርሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ታ ሞሪዳ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ዛራዳ ኢዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ኦኬ! ጋዲ?<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>ሂስቲን ኔኒ ማሬታናፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ኢጺስ ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ኔኒ ሺሺዛ ቆፋ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ጾሲ ኔ ኣሞዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">ኔስ ፖላና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:33">ኔ ኮያይ?<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>«ታና ሲዪዛ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">ኣኬኪዛ ኤራንቻቲካ፥<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‹ኢዮቢ ኤራቴ ባይንዳ ሃሳዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">ሁኤይ ባይንዳ ሃሳያታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">ሃሳዬስ› ጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>ኢታ ኣሳታ ዛሮ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">ዛሪዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">ኢዮቢ ዉርሴ ጋካናዉ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:36">ፓጬቲዳኮ ኣዜ ዲዛይ!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>ኑ ጊዶን ዎጋፔ ካሬ ኬኢዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ጾሳ ቦላ ካ ዳርሲዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ባ ናጋራ ቦላካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 34:37">ማካላቴ ጉጂዴስ» ጌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>ኤሊሁይ ባ ሃሳያ ጉጂዲ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>«ኢዮቤ ኔ ኔና፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">‹ታኒ ጾሳ ሲንን ጺሎ›</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:2">ጊዛይሲ ሊኬ?<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>‹ናጋራ ኦንታ ኣጊኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">ታ ኣይ ጎኤታኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">ቃሴካ ኣይ ዴማኔ?› ጋዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:3">ኔኒ ኦይቻዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>ታኒ ኔሲኔ ኔናራ ዲዛይታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ዛሮ ኢማና።<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>«ቁ ጋዳ ፑዴ ሳሎ ጼላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">ኔፔ ቁ ጊዲ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">ሻራ ኣኬካ።<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>ኔኒ ናጋራ ኦኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">ጾሳ ኣዛን ቆሃይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">ኔኒ ኢዛ ዳርሳ ዳርሳ ቆሂኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:6">ኢዛ ኣይ ኦናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>ኔኒ ጺሎ ጊዲኮ ኢዛስ ኣይ ኢማኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">ኢዚ ኔፔ ኣይኮካ ኮዬና።<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>ኔ ናጋራ ኦኮ ቆሃናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ኔ ማላ ኣሳታ ጻላ።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">ኔ ሎኦ ሚሽ ኦኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:8">ኔ ጎኢዛይ ኣስ ጻላ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35፡6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:2-3">ኢዮ 22፡2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>«ኣሲ ሃራይ ዳርሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">ቆሂሺን ዋሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">ባፔ ዎልቃቲዛዴ ኩሼፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">ባና ኣሺ ኤካናዴስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">ማጋኔስ።<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢስታፌ ኦኒካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">‹ታና ሜዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">ጾሳይ ኣዋኔ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:10">ሌላ ጊዶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">ማዛሙሬ ኢሚዛይሲ ኣዋኔ?<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>ሜሄታፔ ኑና ኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ታማርሲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ሳሎ ካፎታፔካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ኣ ኤራንቻታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ኦዳይ ኢዛ› ጊዳይ ባዋ።<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>ኢስቲ ዋሴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">ኢዚ ጊዲኮ ኢስቲ ኦቶራንቻታኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:12">ኢታታ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:12">ኢስታስ ዛሮ ኢሜና።<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>ጾሲ ቱማ ዎዚናፔ ጊዶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">ዋሶ ሲዬና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:13">ሄሳ ማላ ኤዝጌና።<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>ኢዮቤ! ኔኒ ታ ጾሳ ኣይኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ቤኢኬ ጊኮካ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ኔ ሜቶይ ኢዛ ሲንን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:14">ዴኢዛ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:14">ኔኒ ዳንዳያን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 35:14">ናጋና ኮሼስ።<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>ቃሴካ ጾሲ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ባ ሃንቆን ሃንቆንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ኣሳ ኢታቴ ጮኡ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">ኣና ኔስ ሚሳቲዜ?<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>ኢዮቤ! ኔኒ ጮ ሜላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">ሃሳያ ዳርሳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">ኤራቴ ባይንዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">ጮ ጋዳ ሃሳያሳ።»<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>ኤሊሁይ ባ ሃሳያ ጉጂዲ ሂዝጊዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>«ጾሳ ጊሻስ ታኒ ሃሳያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">ሃራይ ዲዛ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">ጉ ዳንዳያዳ ታ ጊዛይሳ ሲያ።<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>ታኒ ዳሮሶፔ ዴሚዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">ኤራቴን፥ ታና ሜዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">ጾሲ ጺሎ ጊዲዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:3">ታኒ ኔስ ኤሪሳይስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>ታ ቃላይ ዎርዶ ጊዶንታይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">ኔኒ ሎኤ ኤራ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">ኔናራ ሃሳያና ታስ ኩሜ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">ኤራቴ ዲዛይሳ ኤራ።<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>«ቱሙካ ጾሲ ዎልቃማ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">ጊዶ ኣቲን ኦናካ ካና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:5">ኢዚ ኡባካ ኣኬኬስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>ኢዚ ኢታ ኣሳታ ፓጻ ዎና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">ሜቶቲዳ ኣሳታስ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">ሱሬ ፒርዳ ፒርዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>ጾሲ ጺሎ ኣሳታ ናጌስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ካዎታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ቦንቾ ኣልጋን ኡቲሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ሜርናስ ኢስታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ቁ ቁ ሂስቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ኣሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">ሳንሳላታን ቃሼቲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">ዎይኮ ሜቶ ጊቴን ኦይኬቲኮ፥<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>ኢስቲ ባ ኦቶሬቴን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:9">ኦዳ ናጋራ ቆንጪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>ኢስቲ ሴራ ሲያና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">ኢስታ ሃይ ዶዬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">ኢስቲ ባንታ ኢታ ኦሳፔ ሲሚዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:10">ማሬታና ማላ ኣዛዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>ኢስቲ ጾሳስ ኣዛዜቲዲ ኦኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ባንታስ ኣቲዳ ላይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">ዱሬቴኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:11">ኡፋይሳን ኦንጋና።<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ኢዛ ሲዮንታ ኢጺኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">ኢስቲ ኦላን ዉራና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">ኢስቲ ባንታ ኤያቴን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:12">ዲሼ ሃይቃና።<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>«ባንታ ዎዚናራ ጾሳ ካዲዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">ቃጻዬቲዳ ማላ ዳና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">ኢዚ ኢስታ ቃጻይሺንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:13">ኢስታ ካሌዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:13">ዎሴቴና።<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>ኢስቲ ባ ፖሊዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ኢታ ላይማቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ቦሻን ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ባንታ ዬላጋቴ ላይንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:14">ሙልቄቲ ሃይቃና።<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>ጾሲ ሜቶን ኡንኤቲዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">ኢስታ ሜታፔ ኣሻና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">ኢስታ ጋኪዳ ሜታን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:15">ኢስታስ ቲሚርቴ ኢማና።<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>«ሃይሳ ሃ ዎዴዛን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">ጾሲ ኔስ ቆፒዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">ኔና ኔ ዲዛ ሜታፔ ኬሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:16">ሎኦ ካ ኩሚዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:16">ማዳን ኤፋናሳ።<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>ሃኢ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">ኔ ኦዳ ሞራፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">ዴንዶይሳን ኔ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">ፒርዴቲዳ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:17">ኔስ ቤሲዛ ቂጻቴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:17">ኤኮ ቦላ ዳሳ።<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>ኦኒካ ኔና ዱሬቴ ዳሮን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">ጪሞንታ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">ማታኤንካ ኔና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">ባሌንታ ማላ ናጌታ።<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>ኔስ ዲዛ ኣቆታይኔ ጎዳቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">ዳሮ ጊዲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">ኔና ሜቶፔ ኣሼቴና።<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>ዴራ ዲዛሶፔ ይሲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">ማ ዎዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">ያና ማላ ኣሞቶፋ።<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>ኔኒ ሜቶ ጊዶን ፓጬቲዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">ሄሳ ጋሶን ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:21">ሲማዳ ናጋራ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:21">ኦንታ ማላ ናጌታ።<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>«ጾሳ ዎልቃይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">ኣይ ማላ ጊታኮ ኣኬካ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">ጾሲ ኡባፌ ኣ ኣስታማሬ።<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>‹ሃይሳ ኦ› ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">ጾሳ ኣዛዚዛ ኣሲ ዎይኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">‹ኢታ ኦሶ ኦዳሳ› ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:23">ኢዛ ዋላሲዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>ኢዚ ኦዛ ኦሳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">ኣሳይ ኡባ ዎዴ ዬን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">ጋላቲዛይሳ ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">ኔኒካ ኢዛ ኦሳስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">ዬን ጋላታ።<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>ኣሳ ዜሬ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">ጾሳ ኦሳ ቤዪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">ኣሳይ ቲሺ ኦ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">ሃኮን ቤዪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>ጾሳ ጊታቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">ፒልጊዲ ጋካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">ኑኒ ዳንዳዮኮ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">ኢዛ ላይ ቆዳይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">ኑ ኤራፔ ቦላ።<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>«ጾሲ ሃ ኣባፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ፑዴ ሳሎ ኤፌስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ዛሪዲካ ኢራ ሳሎፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ዱጌ ቡኪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>ኢራ ሻራፔ ኬሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">ዎልቃማ ኢራ ኣሳስ ቡኪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>ጊዶ ኣቲን ጾሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ሻራ ዎስቲ ሚጪዛኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">ዎልቃን ጊዶን ኡቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:29">ኢዚ ዋኒ ሃሳይዛኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:29">ኦኒ ኤራናዉ ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>ጾሲ ኣባ ጪማቴ ካሚዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">ኢዚ ባ ዩሾን ዎልቃን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:30">ዎስቲ ላሊዛኮ ጼላ።<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>ሃይሳ ማላ ኦዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">ጾሲ ባ ዴራ ኣይሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">ኣሳይ ሚዛ ዳሮ ካካ ሞኪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>ዎልቃን ኢዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ባ ኩሼን ኦይኬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">ኦይኪዲ ባ ዶሲዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:32">ባጋ ባና ማላ ኣዛዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>ዳዳይ ዎልቃማ ኢራይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">ያናይሳ ማላቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">ሜሄቲካ ኢራ ኡሾይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 36:33">ዪዛይሳ ኤሬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>«ዎልቃማ ኡሾፔ ዴንዶይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ታ ዎዚናይ ኮኮሪዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">ያሻቴፌ ዴንዶይሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:1">ፒሪ ባና ጋኪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>ኢዛ ዶናፔ ኬኢዛ ቃላ ሲዪቴ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">ዳዳ ማላ ጉሚዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:2">ጊሪሳ ቃላ ሲዪቴ።<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>ሳሎፔ ጋርሳን ዎልቃን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">ዎልቃሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">ቢታ ጋጻ ጋካናዉ ኪቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ዎልቃማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ባ ጊሪሳ ሲሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ያሺሲዛ ባ ጊሪሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ዳዳ ማላ ጉንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ዎልቃን ፖኦይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ዛሪ ዛሪ ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ባ ያሺሲዛ ጊሪሳን ጉሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:4">ኢዚ ባ ጊሪሳ ሲሲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:4">ዎልቃን ዲጌና።<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>ጾሳ ጊሪሳ ጉንይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ማላሊሲዛ ጊታ ጉን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ጉሜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ኑኒ ኤራናዉ ዳንዳዮንታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:5">ጊታ ሚሻታ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>ቢታ ቦላ ሻቺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">ዎና ማላ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">ዎልቃማ ኢራይካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:6">ቡካና ማላ ኣዛዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>ኢዚ ሜዳ ኣሳቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ኢዛ ኦሶ ኤራና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:7">ኡባ ኣሳይ ባንታ ኦሶዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ኦንታ ማላ ቴቄስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>ሄ ዎዴ ዎራ ዶኣቲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">ባቃቲዲ ባንታ ቆቴቴሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">ጌሌቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">ባንታ ጎንጎሎዛን ቆቴቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>ዎልቃማ ጫርኮይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">ፑዴሃፔ ዴንዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">ሞጪዛ ጫርኮይ ፑዴሃፔ ዬስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>ጾሳ ፔኖይ ሃ ሞጪሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">ኢዛፔ ሻች ሜስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>ሻራይ ሃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ቶካና ማላ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">ባ ጊዶን ዎልቃን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:11">ዎልቃማና ማላ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>ጎዳ ካሌን ሻራቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ቢታ ዩሾን ዩዬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ባንታና ማዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">ኣዛዞታካ ፖሌቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>ጾሲ ኢራ ቡኪሲዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">ቢታ ኢርጺሳናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">ኣሳታ ቃጻያናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:13">ዎይኮ ባ ሲቆ ቆንጪሳናሳ።<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>ኢዮቤ! ኔኒ ታኪ ጋዳ ሲያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">ጾሲ ኦዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">ማላሊሲዛ ኦሶታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:14">ዎዚናን ዎዳ ኣኬካ።<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>ጾሲ ሻራ ዎስቲ ኣዛዚዛኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">ዎልቃንካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">ዎስቲ ዎልቃንዛኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:15">ኔኒ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>ሻራ ሳሎ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">ዎስቲ ዎዳኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">ማላሊሲዛ ኡባ ኤሪዛ ጾሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:16">ኦሶዛ ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>ሳሎይ ጻርቂማላ ሚሳቲዛ ዎዴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ዎልቃማ ባዞ ጫርኮይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:17">ቢታ ቦላ ጫርኪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:17">ኔኒ ሆምቤን ሴራና።<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>ጾሲ ሳሎ ሴሪዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">ማስቶቴ ማላ ሚጪኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">ኔኒ ኢዛ ማታን ኡታዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:18">ማዳናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>«ኑስ ኤራይ ፓጬ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">ኑኒ ኣይ ጊዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">ጾሳስ ዛራናኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:19">ኔኒ ኑና ኣኔ ታማርሳ።<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>ጾሳራ ሃሳያና</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">ጋዳ ኦይቺኬ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">ታ ኢዛ ኦይቻዳ ኣዛስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">ኢዚ ታና ይሳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">ዴን?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>ጫርኮይ ሻራ ሳሎፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ቁጪ ጌሺዛ ዎዴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ኦኒካ ጾልቂዛ ኣርሼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ቲሺ ሂስቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:21">ጼላናስ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>ፑዴሃፔ ዎርቃ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">ጾልቂዛ ፖኦይ ያና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">ጾሲ ማላሊሲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">ቴማን ቆንጫና።<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>ኡባ ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">ኑ ቆፋፔ ቦላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">ኢዛ ዎልቃይ ጊታ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:23">ኢዚካ ቱሙ ፒርዲዛዴ።<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>ባንታ ቆፋን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">‹ኑኒ ኣ ኤራንቻታ› ጊዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 37:24">ኢዚ ካስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኣሳይ ዉሪ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">ኢዛስ ያዬስ።»<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s">ጾሳፌ ኢዮቤስ ኢሜቲዳ ዛሮ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ጎዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:1">ጎቴ ጫርኮ ጊዶን ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:1">ኢዮቤስ ሂዝጊዴስ፥<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>«ሃይሲ ኤራይ ባይንዳ ሃሳያን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ታ ዞሬዛ ካዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">ኢዚ ባስ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>ኣኔ ኣዴ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ዳንጬታ ታ ሲንን ኤቃ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ታኒ ኔና ኦይቺዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ታስ ዛራ።<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>ታኒ ሃይሳ ኣላሜዛ ሜሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">ኔኒ ኣዋን ዳይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">ኔ ኤሪዛኔ ኣኬኪዛ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:4">ኣኔ ታስ ዮታ።<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>ሃይሲ ሳኣይ ኣይ ኬና ጊዳናኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">ቆፋ ቃቺዳይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">ሳኣ ቦላ ኢዚ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:5">ሚጼ ዎዶሮታ ሚጪዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:5">ኦናኮ ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>ቢታ ቱሳቲ ኩንዶንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">ሚን ኦይኪዳ ዎልቃይ ኣዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">ኣላሜዛ ኦሶ ዶሚሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:6">ዮቻ ሹች ዬጊዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>ባካሌ ጾሊንቴቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">ኢሲ ቦላ ዬጺዛሼ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">ኪታንቻቲ ኡባይ ኢሊሊዛሼ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:7">ኔኒ ኣዋን ዳይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>«ኣባይ ቢታፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">ቂ ኬኢዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">ፑልቶ ኣይፌታ ጎርዲዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>ኣባ ሻራን ካሚዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">ቃሴካ ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:9">ጎርዲዳይ ታና።<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>ኣባስ ዛዋ ሜዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">ፔንጌኔ ዛዋ ዎዳይ ታና።<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>ሃይሳ ጋካናዉ ያ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">ሃይሳፌ ኣፋ!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:11">ኔ ዎልቃማ ዳምባላይ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:11">‹ሃይሳን ኤቆ› ጋዲስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38፡8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:22">ኤር 5፡22</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>«ኢዮቤ! ኔኒ ዬሌቶሶፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">ዎንታይ ዎንታና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">ኣዛዛ ኤራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">ዎንታ ፖኦስካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">ሶሆ ጊጊሳ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>ዎንታይ ቢታ ቦላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">ፖኦ ቤሳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">ኢታ ኣሳቲ ቆቴቲዳሶፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">ቆንጬ ኬዛና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:13">ኔ ኢስታ ኣዛዛ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>ዎንታ ፖኦይ ቢታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">ቃላምኤቲ ዲዛ ማይኦ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:14">ቤታና ማላ ኦስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">ማና ሚሻ ቦላ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">ማታሜ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:14">ቆንጬን ቤሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>ኢታቲ ፖኦ ዲጌቲዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">ኢስቲ ማካላቴን ዴንዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:15">ኩሼይካ ሜቂዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>«ኔ ዱጌ ጪማ ኣባን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">ዎዲ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">ዎጋ ጊታ ኣባ ጋርሳን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:16">ሲሜሬታ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>ሃይቆ ፔንጌታ ኔና ቤሲዴ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">ጊርዲ ጊዳ ማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">ፔንጌታካ ቤያዲ?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>ሳኣይ ኣይ ኬና ዳልጋ ጊዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">ኔ ኤራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">ኣኔ ሃይሳ ኡባ ኤሪዛ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:18">ኔ ታስ ዮታ።<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>«ፖኦይ ዲዛሶ ኤፊዛ ኦጌይ ኣዋኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">ቃሴካ ማይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">ዴኢዛሶይ ኣዋኮ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:19">ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>ኔኒ ፖኦኔ ማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">ኢስቲ ዲዛሶ ዲዛሶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:20">ኤፋናስ ዳንዳያዪ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">ኢስታሶይ ዲዛሶ ኤፊዛ ኦጌዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:20">ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>ኔኒ ቢታይ ሜቲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">ዬሌቲዳ ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:21">ኔስ ላይይካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">ዳሮ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:21">ኔ ኤሮንታ ኣጋካ!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>ሻቺ ዎዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">ኬን ጌላዲዬ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">ዎይኮ ኡቲዳ ሻቻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">ዶሬ ቤያዲ?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>ሃይሳ ሃ ሻቻዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ታ ኦላ ጋላሳሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ሜቶ ጋላሳስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:23">ጎኤታናስ ሚንጃ ዎዳዛ።<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>ዎልቃን ኣዋፔ ዴንዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">ዎይኮ ኣርሼይ ሞኪዛ ባጋፌ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:24">ጫርኮይ ቢታ ቦላ ላሌቲዛሶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:24">ኤፊዛ ኦጌይ ኣዋኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>ኢራ ዎዛሶ ጊግሲዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">ዳዳይ ዋላኬቲዳ ኡሾስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:25">ኦጌ ጊግሲዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>ኦኒካ ባይንዳ ቢታን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">ኣሲካ ዶንታ ባዞን ኣሺዛይ፥<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>ኢራይ ቡካና ማላካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">ኦዛይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">ኣሲ ባይንዳ ሶሆዛኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">ባዞ ቢታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:27">ሃ ካልሲዳይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:27">ቢታይካ ማታ ሞካና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:27">ኦዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>ኢራኔ ጻዛ ኢሚዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>ሻቺኔ ኬንቾ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">ኢሚዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>ኬንቾ ሃ ሹቻ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">ሚንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">ኣባ ሃካ ሻቻ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">ሹቻታና ማላ ኦስ።<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>«ፒሊያዲሴ ጌቴቲዛ ጾሊንቴታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">ኢሲ ቦላ ቃቻናስ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">ኦሪዮ ጌቴቲዛ ጾሊንቴቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:31">ኢሲ ቦላ ኦይኬቲዳ ዎዶሮዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:31">ዱናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38፡31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">ኢዮ 9፡9</ref>፤ <ref loc="AMO 5:8">ኣሞ 5፡8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>ጾሊንቴታ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ኢስታ ዎዴን ዎዴን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ኬሳናዉ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ዛርዶ ጌቴቲዛ ዶኣ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ሜይ ዲዛ ጾሊንቴ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:32">ኢስታ ማራታራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">ኔ ካሌናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>ሳሎቲ ኣይ ማላ ዎጋን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">ኣቂዛኮ ኤራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">ሃይሳ ሃ ዎጋዛካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">ቢታ ቦላ ኦሲሳና ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>«ዳሮ ኢራ ኔስ ቡኪሳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">ሻራ ኔ ኣዛዛናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>ዎልቃን ኔ ኣዛዞን ዎልቃሚዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">ዎልቃን ኔ ዬዳናስ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:35">ኢስቲካ ኔስ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:35">‹ሄኮ ኑ ሃን ዶስ› ጊ ኤሪዞ?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>ዎዚናስ ጪንጫቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">ቆፓናስ ካሃ ኢሚዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>ባ ኤራን ሻራታ ቆዳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">ሳሎፔ ሃ ዱጌ ቲጋናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:37">ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>ጉዱላ ኦይሴዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ጳሼ ኬሳናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>«ማጫ ጋሞይ ዎራ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">ዛማዳ ኡቲዳሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">ኔ ኢዚስ ሚዛ ሚሽ ሻንካታዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:39">ኢማናስ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>ዎይኮ ጋፊ ኡቲዳ ኢዚ ማራታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">ካልሳናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>ቁሮቲ ጋፊዲ ቢቻሪዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">ኢስታ ጪዬቲካ ሚዛ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:41">ይዲ ታኮ ዋሲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:41">ኢስታስ ሚዛ ሚሽ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 38:41">ኢሚዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>«ጌኔሳቲ ዬሊዛ ዎዴ ኔ ኤራይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">ዉሻ ጌቴቲዛ ዶኣይ ሚጻቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:1">ዬሊሺን ቤያ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>ኢስቲ ሴባቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">ኣይ ላጌ ዎዴ ጋምኢዛኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">ኣዉዴ ዬሊዛኮ ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>ጉልባቲ ሚጻቲሼ ባንታ ማራታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">ኢስቲ ዬሊዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">ኣዉዴኮ ኔ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>ኢስታ ማራቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">ዎራን ዲጪዲ ሚኔቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">ኢስታፌ ሻኬቲዲ ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:4">ቢዳፔ ጉዬ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">ባንታ ኣዬታኮ ሲሜቴና።<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>ሃርዲዳይ ዬዳ ዳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">ኦዳይ ኦኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">ኢስታ ቃሾፔ ቢርሺዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>ባዞዛ ኢስታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">ዲዛሶ ሂስታ ኢማዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">ማጺኔይ ዲዛ ዴምባን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:6">ኢስታ ዎዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>ካቺ ዳሪዛ ካታማታፔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">ሃኪዲ ዴቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">ጉዬራ ላጊዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">ቆዲዛይሳ ዶሴቴና።<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>ዙማታ ቦላን ፔኤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ሄን ባስ ጊዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:8">ጪሊላ ማታ ኮዬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>«ሜን ኔስ ኦናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">ኤኖ ጋንዴ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">ዎይኮ ኔ ዜን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">ኤኖ ጊ ኤቃንዴ?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>ሜን ዋጻዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">ጎሽ ጎያናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>ኢዛ ሚኖቴን ኔ ኣማኔታይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">ኔስ ዴጺዛ ኦሶዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:11">ኢዚ ኦና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:11">ኢዛስ ኣጋ ኤራይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>ኢዚ ኔኮ ሲሚ ያና ማላ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">ኔ ካ ቡኪዛ ባሌይ ዲዛሶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:12">ሚያናይሳ ኣማኔታይ?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>«ያንቻይ ባ ቄፌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">ኤሶን ሚጫዉስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">ጊዶ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">ሳንጋኖ ካፎ ማላ ፒራኩ።<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>ያንቻይ ባ ጱጱሌ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">ቢታን ዬጋዉስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">ቢታ ጊዶን ኡቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:14">ሆኣና ማላ ኦዉስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>‹ሄራ ኣዛዴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ባ ቶሆን ሜንስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ዎራ ዶኣቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">ዬ ሊቂሴቴስ›</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:15">ጋዳ ቆፑኩ።<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>ባ ጪዬታስ ኣላጋ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">ሜንጼ ኢታዉስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">ኢዚ ዳቡራይ ሃዳን ኣቲኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:16">ዉዳ ጉኩ።<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>ሃይሳ ኢዚስ ጪንጫቴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">ይሳዳ ኢዛ ኤሮንታ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">ኦዳይ ታና።<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>ኢዛ ዴንዳዳ ዎጺዛ ዎዴ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">ባናራ ጋዴ ዎጺዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:18">ቶጋታ ቦላ ሚጫዉስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>«ኢዮቤ! ፓራታስ ዎልቃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">ኢሚዳይኔ ኣዱሳ ጋማ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">ኢስታ ሞርጌን ማይዚዳይ ኔኔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>ፓራታ ቦሌ ማላ ጉፒዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">ኢስቲ ሃርቡቂሼ ኣሳታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">ዳጋንና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">ኦዛይ ኔኔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>ፓራቲ ኦላ ዴምባ ቶጌቲ ቢሼ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">ባንታ ዎልቃንካ ጬቄቲሼ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:21">ሎዳን ኣዳራሶ ዶሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>ያሽ ጊዛ ሚሽ ሙሌካ ኤሬቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">ኣይ ሚሺካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">ኢስታ ዳጋንና፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:22">ኢስታ ቦላ ጊ ማሻ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:22">ዴንዳኮካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:22">ጉዬ ሲሜቴና።<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>ኢስታ ቶጊዛ ኦላንቻቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">ኦይኪዳ ኦላ ሚሻቲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">ዋዋጪ ጊሼ ባንታ ጊዶን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:23">ጊሬቲሼ ሲዬቴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>ዛዬይ ዛዬቲሺን ጮኡ ጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">ኤቃናዉ ዳንዳዬቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">ዪሎኒኔ ሃንቆን ኩሚዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:24">ኦላ ዴምባ ዎጼቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>ዛዬይ ፑኔቲዳ ታይቦን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ኡፋይሳን ዋይቄቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ሃኮን ዲሼ ኦላ ፔኖ ኤሬቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:25">ኦላ ካሌዛይቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:25">ኢሚዛ ኣዛዞዛኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:25">ኦላንቻታ ጬቄቴ ሲዬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>«ጺሎይ ሳሎ ቦላ ፓሊዛይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">ኢዚ ባ ቄፌዛ ዱጌሃ ሚጪዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:26">ኔ ኤራቴኔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>ጎሌይ ፑዴ ኬኢዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">ቃሶሆን ባ ኬ ኬጺዛይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:27">ኔ ኣዛዚኔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>ጎሌይ ዛላታ ጊዶን ኣቄስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">ኬልካ ጊዶን ባ ኬ ኬጼስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:28">ዛላቲካ ኢዛስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:28">ቆቴቲዛሶ ጊዴቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>ሄን ኡቲዲ ባስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">ሚዛ ሚሽ ጼሌስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">ኢዛ ኣይፌቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:29">ሃኮን ዲዛዝ ዴሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>ሃይሳ ማላን ጎሌቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">ሚዛዚ ዲዛሶ ሺቄቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">ኢስታ ጪዬቲካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 39:30">ሱ ኡዬቴስ» ጊዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39፡30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">ማቶ 24፡28</ref>፤ <ref loc="LUK 17:37">ሉቃ 17፡37</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>ቃሴካ ጾሲ ኢዮቤስ፥<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>«ኢዮቤ! ኣሲ ኡባ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">ዳንዳይዛ ጾሳራ ማርሼቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:2">ላና ኔስ ሚሳቲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">ታናራ ጾሳራ ማርሼቲዛይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">ኔና ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:2">ኣኔ ታስ ዛራ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>ኢዮቢ ዛሪዲ፥<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>«ጎዶ! ታኒ ኣይኮ ማዶንታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">ላፋ ኣሳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">ሃኒፌ ጉዬ ታ ኩሼን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:4">ታ ዶና ጎርዳዳ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:4">ጮኡ ጉሳፌ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:4">ኔስ ታ ዛራና ዛሮይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:4">ታስ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>ታኒ ኢሲቶ ጋናይሳ ጋዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">ጊዶ ኣቲን ታስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">ዛሪዛ ሚሺ ባዋ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:5">ሃይሳፌ ጉዬ ኡባካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:5">ታ ሃሳይኬ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ጎዳይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:6">ጎቴ ጫርኮ ጊዶን ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:6">ኢዮቤስ ሂዝጊዴስ፥<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>«ኣኔ ኣዴ ጊዲኮ ዴንዳዳ ጊጼታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ታ ኦይቺዛይሳ ታስ ዛራ።<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>ታና ፒርዳ ጌላሲዛዴ ኬሳዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">ኔና ጺሎ ኣስ ኬሳናስ ዳፌታይ?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>ጾሳ ዎልቃ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">ሚኖ ዎልቃይ ኔስ ዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">ጾሳ ቃላ ጉን ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:9">ኔ ቃላይ ጉማናዉ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:9">ዳንዳይዜ?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>ሄሳ ማላ ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ኣኔ ኔ ቦንቾኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ኔ ጊታቴን ዴንዳ!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:10">ኔ ቴማቴኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:10">ጊታቴ ማይኣ።<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>ኦቶራንቻታ ቤያዳ ካዉሻ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">ኔ ሃንቆዛ ኢስታ ቦላ ጉሳ።<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>ኣኔ ሎኤ ጼላዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">ኦቶራንቻታ ኡባ ዬላቻ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">ኢታ ኦዛይታ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:12">ኢስቲ ዲዛሶን ሄን ይሳ።<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>ኢስታ ኡባ ሞጎ ማይኦን ጻጻዳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">ኢሲ ቦላ ዱፎን ሞጋ።<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ኔኒ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ኔ ዎልቃን ጾኒዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">ታኒ ኔስ ማርካታና።<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>«ታኒ ኔና ሜዳይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">ሆሪቄ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">ዶኣ ሜዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:15">ኢዚካ ቦራ ማላ ማታ ሜስ።<figure style="fig" alt="Hippopotamus" file="BK00026B.TIF" size="col" ref="40፡15">ሆሪቄ</figure><verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>ኢዛስ ጼሳን ዲዛ ዎልቃ ቤያ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">ኢዛስ ኡሎ ጊዶን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">ሻያ ሚኖቴ ጼላ።<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>ኢዛስ ጎይናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ሊባኖሴ ዚጋ ሚ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:17">ሲቲ ጊዳይሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ኢዛስ ጌዳ ጻጶቲካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ሚኖኔ ኦርዴታ።<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>ኢዛ ሜቄቲካ ጻርቂማላኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">ቢራታ ማርጮ ማላ ሚኖታ።<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>ታ ሜዳ ሜታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ኡባፌ ዎልቃማ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ታፔ ኣቲን ኢዛ ጾናናይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ሃራይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>ዎራ ዶኣቲ ኡባይ ካኢዛ ዙማይ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">ኢዛስ ሚዛ ሚሽ ሞኪሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>ኩዋይ ዲዛ ሚ ጋርሳን፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">ማቃ ጊዶኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">ሃ ዲዛሶ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">ጫሬ ጊዶን ኢቼስ።<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>ኩዋይ ዲዛ ሚቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">ኢዛ ባንታ ኩዋን ጌንቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">ሻፋ ዶናን ዲጪዛ ሚቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:22">ኢዛ ካሜቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>ሻፋ ሃ ኪጻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">ኢዚ ዳጋሜና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">ዮርዳኖሴ ሻፋይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:23">ኬሂ ኩሚዲ ጎጊንካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:23">ኢዚ ያዬና።<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>ኢዛ ኣይፌታ ቶይሲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">ኢዛ ኦይካና ኣሲ ዲዜ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">ኢዛ ሲካ ዳፎን ቃቺዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 40:24">ኢዛ ኦይካናስ ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>«ኔኒ ሌዋታኔ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">ኣባ ጊዶን ዲዛ ዶኣ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:1">ሞሌ ኦይኪዛ ማንጻኮን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:1">ኦይካናስ ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:1">ዎይኮ ኢዛ ኢንጻርሳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:1">ዎዶሮን ቃቻናስ ዳንዳያይ?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41፡1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:14">ማዛ 74፡14</ref>፤ <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104፡26</ref>፤ <ref loc="ISA 27:1">ኢሳ 27፡1</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>ኢዛ ሲዛን ዳፎ ኣዳ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">ዎይኮ ኢዛ ጋጮዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:2">ማንጻኮን ጌልዳ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:2">ኦይካናስ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>ኢዚ፥ ‹ታና ማራርኪ!› ጊ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">ኔና ዎሳኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">ዎይኮ ሎኦ ቃላን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">ኔና ኦይቻንዴ?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>ኔስ ሜርናስ ኣይሌ ጊዲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ኔስ ኦናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ኢዚ ኔስ ቃላ ጌላኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>ኣሳራ ሜዜ ካፎ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ኔ ኢዛ ኔናራ ሜዜሳኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ዎይኮ ኔስ ማጫ ናይታ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ካሳና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">ኔ ቃቻ ዎኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>ሞሌ ዛልኣንቻቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">ኢዛ ሻማናዉ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">ሚሻን ማርሼታኔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">ዎይኮ ቃንጼሬዲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:6">ኢዛ ባንታስ ጊሼታኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>ኢዛ ጋልባካ ኔ ኮዪዳሶራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">ቶራን ጫዳ ዳካናስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">ዳንዳያይ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">ዎይኮ ኢዛ ሁኤዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">ሆጼ ሚሻን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:7">ጫዳ ሉካናዉ ዳንዳያይ?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>ኣኔ ኔኒ ኢዛ ዳንዳያና ጊዲኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ኩሼን ቦቻ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ኢዛራ ኔ ባጼቲዳ ባጼ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ዎዴናዉካ ባላካ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:8">ናምኣን ኢዛራ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:8">ኔ ባጼታናስ ካጃላካ።<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>ሌዋታኔ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ኣባ ጊዶ ዶኣራ ባጼቲዲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ኢዛ ጾናና ካጃሎስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ሌይ ዴና።</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ኢዛ ቤኢዛ ኡባይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:9">ባቦን ኮኮሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>ኢዛ ቦላ ሜቶ ጋና ጉሲ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">ሄሳ ኬና ዴጾ ጊዲኮ፥</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:10">ሂስቲን ታናራ ኤቄታናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:10">ጻሊዛዴይ ኢዚ ባስ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>ሳሎፔ ጋርሳን ዲዛ ሚሺ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">ዉሪካ ታሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">ሂስቲን ታ ኢዛስ ዛራና ማላ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:11">ታስ ታልኢዳይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>ሌዋታኔ ጌቴቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ኣባ ዶኣ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ኢዛ ሚኖ ዎልቃ ጊሻሲኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ኢዛስ ሎኢዛ ቦላ ጊሻስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ታ ቆንጪሶንታ ኣጊኬ።<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>ኦርዴ ጊዲዳ ኢዛ ጋልባ ሾቃናስ፥</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">ዎይኮ ኢዛ ባንቂላ ፖቃናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:13">ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>ኬሂ ያሺሲዛ ኣቻቲ ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">ኢዛ ባንቂላታ ፖቃና</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:14">ዳንዳይዛይ ኦኔ?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>ኢዛስ ዞኮ ጋልባይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">ማራራ ኡቲዳ ጎንዳሌታ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:15">ኣዳፌ ሺዲ ኦይኬቲዳይታ።<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>ኢስቲ ኢሶይ ኢሳራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">ሺጲ ጊዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">ኢስታ ጊዶራ ሃራይ ኣቲን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:16">ጫርኮይካ ኣና።<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>ኢስቲ ኡባይካ ኢሶይ ኢሳራ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ኦይኬቲ ኡቲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ኣይ ሚሺካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">ኢስታ ሻካናዉ ዳንዳዬና።<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>ኢዚ ሺዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">ጾጾልቁ ጊዛ ፖኦይ ቤቴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">ኢዛ ኣይፌቲካ ዎንታ ማላዶ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:18">ኣርሼ ማላ ፖኤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>ኢዛ ዶናፔ ታማ ላጮይ ኬዜስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">ታማ ፒንጼካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">ላሌቲሼ ቤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>ፔንቲዛ ዲስቴይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">ኡቲዳ ጮጬን ዲዛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">ኣፊራይ ጩዋቲዛ ማላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">ኢዛ ሲፔ ጩዋይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:20">ኬዚሼ ቤቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>ኢዚ ሼምፒዛ ሼምፖዛ ሴላይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">ጺጺን ኦይሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">ታማ ላጮይካ ኢዛ ዶናፔ ኬዜስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>ኢዛ ሞርጌን ዎልቃይ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">ኩሚዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">ኢዛ ሲንይ ያሺሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>ኢዛ ኣሾይ ዲላኣ ጊዲዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">ኢዛ ቦላይ ቢራታ ማላ ሚኔስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>ኢዛስ ቲራይ ሹቻ ማላ ሚኖ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">ጋጪዛ ዎጻ ማላካ ሚኖ።<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>ሃ ዶኣዚ ዴንዲዛ ዎዴ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">ዎልቃማቲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">ኣቶንታ ባቦን ኮኮሬቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>ኣይ ማሻኒኔ ቶራን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">ዎይኮ ዎንዳፌኒኔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">ጫዲዛዛን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:26">ኢዛ ኢስቲ ጫዲኮካ ጾኔቴና።<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>ኢዚ ቢራታ ማቃ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">ሜንሬስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">ጻርቂማላካ ሙሳ ሚ ማላ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">ቲፌሬስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>ኢዛ ቦላ ዎንዳፌ ጾንጊኮካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">ኢዚ ያዪዲ ባቃቴና፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">ያንባርሻ ሹቺካ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:28">ኢዛ ሲንን ኢሺና ማላ።<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>ኮጼ ማታ ማላ ቆዴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">ኣሲ ኢዛ ቦላ ቶራ ጾንጊሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:29">ቂ ሚች ሚጬስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>ኢዛስ ኡሎ ጋልባ ሃንቻዚ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">ኢዚ ኡርቃ ጊዶራ ቢሺን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:30">ቢታ ማራሻ ማላ ቦኬስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>ኣባ ሃ ፔንታ ማላ ፖጪሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">ኦቶን ፔንቲዛ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:31">ዛይቴ ማላ ፖሴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>ኢዚ ኣ ቢዛ ኦጌይ ፖኢሴስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">ኣባ ሃካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">ሆሞ ጮፑ ሂስቴስ።<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>ኢዚ ያሽ ኤሮንታ ሜታ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">ቢታ ቦላ ኢዛ ሚሳቲዛ ሜታይ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 41:33">ሙሌካ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>ኬሂ ጊታ ጊዲዳ ሜታታካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">ኢዚ ካስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">ኢዚ ዶኣ ኡባ ቦላ ካዎ።»<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s">ኢዮቢ ባና ካዉሺዴስ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>ሃይሳፌ ጉዬን ኢዮቢ ጾሳስ ሂዝጊ ዛሪዴስ፤<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>«ታ ጎዳዉ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ኔኒ ኡባ ሚሽ ኦናስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:2">ዳንዳይዛይሳ ታ ኤራዲስ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ኔ ቆፋካ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">ጲ ዲጋናይ ዴና።<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>ታ ኤሪዛራ ኬሂ ጉ ጊዲሺን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ታ ዳሮ ሃሳይዛይሳ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ኣዛስ ጊዲዳኮ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ኔ ኦይቻዳሳ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">ቱሙካ ታኒ ኤሮንታይሳኔ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:3">ኣኬኮንታ ኡባ ሃሳያዲስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42፡3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:2">ኢዮ 38፡2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>‹ታ ኦይሻ ኤዝጋ ሲያዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:4">ታስ ዛሮ ኢማ› ጋዳሳ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42፡4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">ኢዮ 38፡3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>ታ ሃኖ ጋካናስ ኔ ጊሻስ ኤሪዛይሲ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">ኣሳፔ ሲዮይሳን ጻላ፤</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">ሃኢ ጊዲኮ ታ ኣይፌታን</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:5">ታ ኔና ቤያዲስ።<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>ሄሳፌ ዴንዲዳይሳን</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">ታ ሃሳይዳ ሚሻቲ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:6">ታና ዬላቺዳ ጊሻስ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:6">ቢዲንኒኔ ጉዱላን ኡታዳ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="JOB 42:6">ታ ኔፔ ማሬታና።»<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">ኩሻ ቆፋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>ጾሲ ኢዮቤራ ሃይታንታ ኡባ ሃሳዬቲዳፔ ጉዬ ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜስ፥ «ኢንቴ ታ ኣይሌ ኢዮቤ ማላ ታ ጊሻስ ሊኬ ሃሳዮንታ ጊሻስ ታኒ ኔ ቦላኔ ኔ ላጌታ ቦላ ሃንቄታዲስ። <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>ሄሳ ጊሻስ ሃኢ ላፑን ዎፋኖታኔ ላፑን ርሾታ ኤኪዲ ታ ኦሳንቻ ኢዮቤኮ ቢቴ። ሄን ኢንቴ ናጋራ ጊሻስ ጹጌቲዛ ያርሾ ሺሺቴ። ታ ኦሳንቻ ኢዮቢ ኢንቴስ ዎሳና፤ ታኒካ ኢዛ ዎሳ ሲያዳ ኢንቴና ኢንቴ ናጋራ ማላ ቃጻይኬ። ኢንቴ ታስ ኢዮቤ ማላ ሎኦ ሚሽ ሃሳይቤኬታ» ጊዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ቴማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ኤልፋዜይ፥ ሹሃ ዴሬ ኣስ ቤሊዳዲኔ ናኢማኔ ዴሬ ኣስ ዞፋሬይ ቢዲ ጾሲ ኢስታ ኣዛዚዳ ማላ ኦዳ። ጾሲካ ኢዮቤ ዎሳ ሲዪዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>ኢዮቢ ባ ሄ ላጌታስ ዎሲዳፔ ጉዬ ጾሲ ኢዚ ዛሪ ዱሬታና ማላ ኦዴስ። ካሴ ኢዛስ ዲዛይሳፌ ኣዲ ዳኮ ኢዛስ ኢሚዴስ።<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42፡10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-3">ኢዮ 1፡1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>ሄ ዎዴ ኢዮቤ ኢሻቲ፥ ኢዛ ሚቼቲኔ ካሴ ኢዛ ኤሪዛይቲ ኡባይ ኢዛ ቤያናስ ዪዳ። ኢዛራ ኢሲፌ ኢዛሶን ካ ሚዳ፤ ኢስቲ ኢዛስ ሚሼቲዛይሳ ቆንጪሲዲ ጾሲ ኢዛ ቦላ ጋዳ ሜቶዛ ጊሻስ ኢዛ ሚንዳ። ኢሶይ ኢሶይ ቢራፔኔ ዎርቃፌ ኦሴቲዳ ሚዲጋ ኢዛስ ኢሞታ ኢሚዳ። <verse eid="JOB 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>ጾሲ ኢዮቤስ ዉርሴ ዴኦዛ ኮይሮይሳፌ ኣ ኣንጂዴስ። ሄሳ ጊሻስ ኢዮቤስ 14,000 ዶርሲ፥ 6,000 ጋሜላቲ፥ 1,000 ዋ ቦራቲ፥ 1,000 ማጫ ሃሬቲ ዴቴስ። <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>ቃሴካ ላፑን ኣቱማ ናይታኔ ሄ ማጫ ናይታ ዛሪ ዬሊዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>ማጫ ናይታፔ ኮይሮሮ ዪሚማ፥ ናምኣንዮ ቄጺኦ፥ ሄንዮ ቄሬኔ-ሃፊኮ ጊዲ ሱንዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>ቢታ ቦላ ኢዮቤ ማጫ ናይታ ማላ ሜ ሎኦ ማጫይ ቤቲቤና። ኢስታ ኣዋይ ኢስታስ ኢስታ ኢሻታራ ቢታ ላታና ማላ ሻኪ ኢሚዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>ሄሳፌ ጉዬ ኢዮቢ 140 ዴኢዴስ። ባ ናይታ ኦይዳን ዬሌታ ጋካናስ ቤዪዴስ። <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>ኢዮቢ ዳሮ ላይ ዲዲ ሎኦ ጪማ ጪሚዲ ሃይቂዴስ።<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
